{
//config//
"config.Clint.name": "Clint",
"config.Demetrius.name": "Demetrius",
"config.Gus.name": "Gus",
"config.Linus.name": "Linus",
"config.Marnie.name": "Marnie",
"config.Pam.name": "Pam",
"config.Willy.name": "Willy",
"config.Wizard.name": "Wizard",
"config.Krobus.name": "Krobus",
"config.Dwarf.name": "Dwarf",

//Clint
"Clint_Introduction": "A customer? You're new around here, right? I'm Clint, the town Blacksmith. If you need a tool upgraded, I can probably help.#$e#Nice to meet you. Let's work together sometime.",
"Clint_event_advice1": "I'll try to remember that.#$e#See you, @.",
"Clint_event_advice2": "But what happens if they don't like me for who I am?$s#$e#See you, @.",
"Clint_spring_Mon": "I've been a Blacksmith for a long time now. It's hard work. Somedays I enjoy it. Others, like today, I don't.#$b#Unless you got geodes, what are you here for?#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_spring_Tue": "Bring anything to be crushed? I'm in a particularly bad mood today. Could use a good smash session.#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_spring_Wed": "Rocks are hard, right? But we have tools to break them apart.#$b#I wish I had a tool to make my day not feel so worthless.$2#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_spring_Thu": "Be sure to upgrade your tools ahead of when you think you'll need them. Not my fault it takes awhile to create something extra special.#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_spring_Fri": "I make weapons for the Adventurer's Guild. Marlon really appreciates my attention to detail.#$b#I bet I could you a really awesome sword sometime, too.$3#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_spring_Sat": "I wish I could crush my doubts as easy as I do geodes, but it's not to be.#$b#Why am I telling you this? Sorry to waste your time.$2#$e#I'll see you soon, @.",
"Clint_spring_Sun": "It's days like today I rather be outside than in. But having fun doesn't pay the bills, so here I stand.#$b#Need anything smashed with a hammer?$2#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_spring_Mon2": "Why are you being so nice to me? Do you have something to gain with my friendship?$3#$b#It's just that not a lot of people give a damn about me. Now you're giving me gifts.#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_spring_Tue2": "Hey, @. Here you are again. What'd you bring me today? I hope you're enjoying this.#$b#I'd be lieing if I said I didn't entirely think you were just trying to use me.$2#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_spring_Wed2": "Do you really enjoy seeing me that much? It's interesting, really. Most people scowl when they see me, but you actually bring me stuff.#$b#It's very curious, @.$2#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_spring_Thu2": "I didn't think you'd actually come by today, and yet here you are. You're sure about all this?#$b#If you keep wanting to get to know me, you might not like what you find.$2#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_spring_Fri2": "Sometimes I wonder if it's just geodes you want from me. Maybe discounts on upgrades?#$b#Well, it's not happening. Not yet, anyway.$3#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_spring_Sat2": "Do you have a crush on me or something? Get it? Crush? I smash geodes, it's like my thing.$1#$b#I can see on your face my joke has failed miserably. Well, here we are.#$b#Yikes.#$e#I'll see you soon, @.",
"Clint_spring_Sun2": "I'm suspicious of your intentions, @, because anyone who wants to be my friend has something wrong with them.#$b#I may not know now, but I will find out, just you see.$2#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_spring_Mon4": "It's actually really nice outside, isn't it? Is it weird for me to say something like that?#$b#I know I've been grumpy from time to time, but we can talk weather, right? It's what people do.#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_spring_Tue4": "Would you want me to make swords? I really wish I could. If I did, I'd make a broadsword and call it, 'The Best.'#$b#It'd be awesome. It would defeat anything with one swing.$1#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_spring_Wed4": "It's amazing what the tools can pull off once they are upgraded. It's almost magical. Do you believe in magic?#$b#If I had magic, I'd clone myself and make him do all my work for me.$1#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_spring_Thu4": "I learned how to make musical instruments, but I can't actually make them. I know the process, not the craft. Does that make sense?#$b#I met someone who could make ocarinas once.#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_spring_Fri4": "Spring is the time of year I like to become inspired, then just crush geodes all day long. It's calming.#$b#Anger problem? What's that? I'm fine, I think.$3#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_spring_Sat4": "Here's an idea, @. You'd appreciate this, you're a farmer after all. Take a watering can, axe, and hammer, and put them together.#$b#I'd call it, the 'Farm-ultimate-tool. What do you think? Good name, bad name?#$b#I don't like it either...$2#$e#I'll see you soon, @.",
"Clint_spring_Sun4": "My busy days are after it rains, did you know that? It's only then do people realize they need to fix up their houses.#$b#I'm open all year, folks. Why wait?$3#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_spring_Mon6": "You've met Emily, right? She's great. I really enjoy talking with her. She's just one of those people, you know?#$b#You're starting to become cool to talk to, @. Starting.$1#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_spring_Tue6": "My personal goals this year are simple. Get stronger, crush more geodes, and maybe talk with Emily about...#$b#I'm saying this to you why? Don't think anything of it.$2#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_spring_Wed6": "How cool would it be if something I made got into the museum? Something that people got actually excited about.#$b#Like, people are happy to have tools, but they just sit around. Nothing exciting about that.#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_spring_Thu6": "Emily is one of those people who I wish could be around all the time. She just makes me feel happy.#$b#I wonder if I could ever actually, you know, be with someone like her.$2#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_spring_Fri6": "I don't actually use a gold hammer for crushing geodes, I use a hammer I found by a railroad. It was rusted and I restored it.#$b#I call my hammer 'Hope Restored.'$1#$b#My other name for it was 'Rock Pounder' but it's not as cool.#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_spring_Sat6": "One of these days I'm going to get the courage to tell Emily how I really feel about her. I just hope it doesn't make things awkward.#$b#Nothing sucks more than making things awkward with friends.$3#$e#I'll see you soon, @.",
"Clint_spring_Sun6": "It'd be cool to crush geodes with my fist instead of with a hammer, like some sort of super hero.#$b#Rock Smasher Clint isn't that catchy of a name, though...#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_spring_Mon8": "You've been so nice with me, @. How's life on the farm going? I'm sure you smash rocks all day long, like me.#$b#Do you regret leaving your old job? Do you enjoy it? Tell me everything.#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_spring_Tue8": "Spring has got to be awesome on the farm, eh? Birds chirping, the cool air, it all sounds pretty romantic.#$b#Maybe I could come around and check it out?$1#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_spring_Wed8": "I hope the tools I make help you on the farm, @. It does give me pleasure knowing that I can actually help out, in some way, with your dream.#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_spring_Thu8": "It's good to see you around, @. Bring something good for me to crush? Let's get you an upgrade!#$b#Or if not an upgrade, at least something cool.$1#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_spring_Fri8": "Emily and I are watching a movie tonight, can you believe that? I'm showing her one of my favorites, and she's bringing one of hers.$4#$b#I'm actually nervous. Maybe I'll go hammer something.$2#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_spring_Sat8": "Sometimes I doubt I'm doing my best, like maybe I just suck at what I do. Are you happy with my work?$2#$b#It's people like you, @, that make it worth it for me in the end.$1#$e#See you around, @. Thanks for talking with me.",
"Clint_spring_Sun8": "Thanks for sticking with me, @. I know I can be mean sometimes, and grumpy. It's just hard for me to be honest sometimes.#$b#Luckily you always seem to be understanding. Thank you.$1#$e#Bye, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Clint_spring_Mon10": "I may grump about it from time to time, but I actually really do like being a Blacksmith. I'm my own master.#$b#I'm sure you can relate, working on the farm, being free from Joja. We're warriors, you and I!$5#$e#I hope nothing ever changes that. Bye, @.",
"Clint_spring_Tue10": "I became a Blacksmith because of hope, have I ever told you that? I realized that just because someone or something is broken doesn't mean it can't be fixed.#$b#It's this idea that keeps me going and improving.$3#$e#Talk to you later, @. Have a good one.",
"Clint_spring_Wed10": "It's friends like you and Emily that make me excited to work on myself. I want to be a better friend than I was before.#$b#It's tough to admit when you're not the best, but I'm working on it.$1#$e#Here's hoping for a great tomorrow! See you, @.",
"Clint_spring_Thu10": "I've had a pretty good day so far. I've gotten a lot done, and I think I have a new idea for a practical tool.#$b#I call it the 'Cow Talker,' and it makes it possible to talk to cows.$4#$b#I'm joking but, I think my humor fails again.$1#$e#Moo. That's cow for 'bye.' I'll shut up now.",
"Clint_spring_Fri10": "Last night I had dream about you, @. You were on your farm, under attack by geodes. I saved you with my hammer, then we ate apples.#$b#What do you think that means? Should I eat an apple, or crush more geodes? Dreams are weird.$4#$e#I'm just glad I could save you from harm. See you, @.",
"Clint_spring_Sat10": "Do you want to know my favorite thing about Emily? It's the fact that she's so earnest. She actually cares.#$b#There aren't too many people like that around. I respect that so much.$1#$e#You're another one, for sure! See you later, @.",
"Clint_spring_Sun10": "I'm glad I'm a Blacksmith. I got to meet you, @. Things are really coming along.#$b#I also get to crush geodes all day, so that's extra cool.$1#$e#Life works out sometimes. See you, @.",
"Clint_spring_Mon_inlaw_Emily": "How's Emily doing? I haven't had a chance to talk to her recently.$2#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_spring_Mon6_inlaw_Emily": "How is it waking up to someone like Emily every day? Does it make the sun shine brighter?$2#$b#I should have been more open with my feelings, I guess.$2#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_spring_Thu6_inlaw_Emily": "You married Emily, that's awesome. I hope someday I can meet someone like her, but this time, they go with me!$1#$e#I'll see you soon, @.",
"Clint_spring_Sat6_inlaw_Emily": "I regret sometimes not being more honest with people. You never know where it might lead.#$b#I don't want any more missed opportunities in my life.$2#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_spring_Mon8_inlaw_Emily": "You're my friend, @, but the idea of you and Emily together is really hard for me.$2#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_spring_Fri8_inlaw_Emily": "Emily and I used to watch movies on nights like tonight. Now I watch them alone.#$b#Not a big deal. More popcorn for me, right?$2#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_summer_1": "It's gotten really hot out there. Have you noticed?#$b#It must be summer. Good luck this season.$3#$e#Don't overheat! I'll see you around.",
"Clint_summer_Mon": "As the town Blacksmith, it's hard to go on vacation. The people need me, how can I abandon them?#$b#I also can't afford a vacation, so there's that.$2#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_summer_Tue": "If I could go on a summer vacation, I'd go somewhere cold. Somewhere far away.#$b#I'd still bring my hammer, though.$3#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_summer_Wed": "It's been difficult working today, the heat is unbearable. How much longer till fall?$2#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_summer_Thu": "I'm sorry if I smell. I can't stop sweating. Being a Blacksmith in summer is a rough job.#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_summer_Fri": "Are you an illusion brought on by the heat, or a real person? Let me see...$3#$b#Nope, it's definately you. What can I do for you?#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_summer_Sat": "I'd love to jump into the river right now and just float away, but I just got some orders. Maybe next time.#$b#You understand right? I may be hot, but I'm still proud.#$e#I'll see you soon, @.",
"Clint_summer_Sun": "Summer comes once a year, but it always trys to overstay it's welcome. Here's hoping it leaves early this year.#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_summer_Mon2": "It's so hot, @. Why are you hanging around here with me? You need something made?#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_summer_Tue2": "Bring more geodes to be crushed by the sweltering heat? My hammer literally burst into flames this morning.#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_summer_Wed2": "If I was you, I'd wait till winter to bother upgrading your items. Not that it's special, just so I wouldn't have to work.#$b#Hey, at least I'm honest with you.$1#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_summer_Thu2": "How hot is it out there? I haven't left my workshop today. The sun burns my skin so easily.#$b#Maybe I'll go outside when it's night. Wander the streets.$2#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_summer_Fri2": "When you crush as many rocks as I do, you start to wonder what would happen if you smashed the sun itself. What would be inside?#$b#Revenge, that's what would be inside. Vengeance.$3#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_summer_Sat2": "I may have overdone it today. I pushed myself to my limits, and now I have a headache. I'll do whatever you need, though.$2#$b#The headache of bills is worse than heat stroke.$2#$e#I'll see you soon, @.",
"Clint_summer_Sun2": "If fall shows up early, I'll upgrade whatever tool anyone wants, for free. Whatever spirits of fall that are listening, heed my call. $3#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_summer_Mon4": "When I was a kid, I tried to like summer, but my family always wanted to go to really boring places.#$b#I traveled all over, but never saw anything interesting. My family fell for tourist traps, and usually ran out of money before anything cool.#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_summer_Tue4": "Do you have good summer memories, @? Nostalgia for the good ol' days? I sure don't.$2#$b#Problem is, I haven't made any good summer memories yet, so I'm just bitter.#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_summer_Wed4": "You never know your last summer. Before my final year of school my family went to the beach.#$b#I was so mad, I didn't want to swim. I wanted to be at home. I was that angry teenager you always see.$3#$b#Why am I telling you this stuff? Sorry to waste your time.$2#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_summer_Thu4": "There is something I miss about the summers growing up. It was just how simple it all was.#$b#Now everything is complicated, and nothing is as it seems. But back then? Dinner time was the most that was happening.#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_summer_Fri4": "It's so hot today that it's made me wonder if I actually did something to the sun to make it hate me.$2#$b#I have said a lot of mean things about the sun, though, so maybe I deserve it.#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_summer_Sat4": "I just finished drinking one of my favorite beverages. It's like Joja Cola, only made with organic sugars. It sounds crazy, but it's addicting.$5#$e#I'll see you soon, @.",
"Clint_summer_Sun4": "I've crushed so many geodes today, I can't feel my arms anymore. Do I still have arms? Can you check for me?$4#$b#This heat is really getting to me, @.$2#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_summer_Mon6": "Spending the summer nights with friends is a great way to beat the heat. Emily and I have been doing just that, and having a lot of fun.$1#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_summer_Tue6": "I complain a lot about the heat but the nights are usually the best. It's cool, the crickets are out, I really like it.#$b#Then the sun comes up the next morning and ruins all the fun.$3#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_summer_Wed6": "How are you enjoying Summer so far, @? Is it rewarding to you? The caverns are cool, right?#$b#This summer hasn't been quite so bad...yet.$3#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_summer_Thu6": "I've been working at night more lately, on some personal projects. I put the radio on and just zone out.#$b#You understand, right @?$1#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_summer_Fri6": "I have plans tonight to play board games with Emily. I'm oddly nervous about it. I really hope I don't screw it up.#$b#I'm not that good at games, to be blunt. I get too flustered.$2#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_summer_Sat6": "Tonight I'm going to do some self-reflection. I think I complain too much. It must rub people the wrong way.#$b#Or maybe it's just the heat getting to me. It really is hot, you know?$2#$e#I'll see you soon, @.",
"Clint_summer_Sun6": "I crushed some geodes today that actually made it colder in the room. Is that possible? Could such magic rocks exist?#$b#Maybe it's too much for a lowly Blacksmith like me to know...$2#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_summer_Mon8": "Do you like working on the farm in summer, or do you mostly fish and go into the caves? If I could, I'd go adventuring.#$b#I'd get geodes I could actually keep, for once.$3#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_summer_Tue8": "It's great to see you doing so well on that farm, @. I didn't think you could do it, if I'm being honest.#$b#Now I know you have what it takes. You keep up the great work, and keep bringing me stuff!$1#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_summer_Wed8": "It's hot out today, as usual, but I've been thinking about ways to make it cooler for myself. Think that's a good idea?#$b#It's thanks to your support that I'm starting to think maybe I've been doing things wrong, and need to innovate.$1#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_summer_Thu8": "Whoa, @! You're not dead under this heat. That's impressive. I had bet you'd burst into flames working on the farm today.$4#$b#I'm just kidding, I didn't bet that. I was trying to be funny. I'm not good at it.#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_summer_Fri8": "Emily surprised me with lemonade today. Isn't that great? Things are really happening between us. Am I blushing? I think I'm blushing.$4#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_summer_Sat8": "Not too many orders this week, so I've had some time to think up some new ideas for tools.#$b#My latest invention idea? A hammer that has a fan on it. I call it the 'Hammer fan.' Good, huh?#$e#I'll see you soon, @.",
"Clint_summer_Sun8": "I think tonight is going to be a beautiful summer night, @. I hope you enjoy yourself and don't overheat too much.#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_summer_Mon10": "I really like to hate on summer, and tend to complain a lot about it, but I'm going to be honest. It's not the heat that bugs me.#$b#When I was a kid, my Dad left us. He was a Blacksmith that had the wanderlust, and one night he left and never came back.$3#$e#Things like that really change a person. See you, @.",
"Clint_summer_Tue10": "After my Dad left, I didn't know what to do. We were really poor, and one day I was walking down the street.#$b#Someone needed help fixing their tool, so I helped them, and they paid me enough to feed the family that night. I realized then I wanted to be a Blacksmith.#$e#Working with my hands can be rewarding, who knew? Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_summer_Wed10": "I learned some of what it means to be a blacksmith from my Dad, but a lot of it was self-taught.#$b#I got a lot of aggression out smashing every rock I could find after my Dad abandoned us.$3#$e#That's the blunt version. Have a good day, @.",
"Clint_summer_Thu10": "I've been thinking a lot of why I hate summer so much, and I think that if my Dad was still around, I might like it a bit more.#$b#Is that giving him too much power? I suppose.$2#$e#Stay cool today, @. See you.",
"Clint_summer_Fri10": "I told Emily about what happened with my Father leaving us during summer. She was really understanding.#$b#You and Emily are awesome, you know that, @?$1#$e#Good to know I have people like you around. See you.",
"Clint_summer_Sat10": "Want to know something, @? I have a lot of hope this year. I think it's because of how nice you've been to me.#$b#How does one survive the summer heat? Get good friends.$1#$e#Have a good day, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Clint_summer_Sun10": "I opened a geode today and found a rock that looks just like you, @. Is that weird? I'm keeping it.$4#$e#Have a good rest of the day, @!",
"Clint_summer_Mon6_inlaw_Emily": "I miss the nights I'd spend with Emily during summer. It's always better with friends, you know? I suppose you get her all the time now.#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_summer_Fri6_inlaw_Emily": "Emily is really good at board games. Have you lost to her yet? She always finds a way.#$b#We used to play a lot, back in the day.$1#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_summer_Fri8_inlaw_Emily": "Does Emily still make that awesome summer lemonade? I've been craving that stuff for so long.$1#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_fall_1": "The cool days of fall are here again! This is a time of celebration. Bring on the geodes!$1#$e#Have a nice day, @. Embrace fall!",
"Clint_fall_Mon": "I have this belief that it's easier to find gems in fall. Their special properties bring them up to the earth.#$b#At least that's what I like to believe, I get a lot more work during fall.$1#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_fall_Tue": "I love emeralds and aquamarines, jades and amethysts. Cracking those open from a geode is a special feeling.#$b#It's like finding pure joy, locked away inside the rock.$1#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_fall_Wed": "There's copper, iron, gold, and iridium bars. I specialize in all four, as you know.$3#$b#Touching iridium makes your hands vibrate, isn't that cool?#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_fall_Thu": "My favorite kind of geode to smash is the Omni Geode. I almost don't want to charge for the honor.#$b#People are always surprised at what comes out. It's always exciting.$1#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_fall_Fri": "I once had someone bring in a ruby and ask me to crush it to see what was inside. I said I could not, would not, do that.$3#$b#They got really mad and left. What a strange person.$3#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_fall_Sat": "Fall makes me want to watch movies and eat artichoke dip. It's what I plan on doing tonight, in fact.#$e#I'll see you soon, @.",
"Clint_fall_Sun": "People always bring in Quartz thinking it's special and demand high prices for it. It's uncomfortable telling them how wrong they are.$3#$b#There's also a little bit of enjoyment in exposing the truth, though.#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_fall_Mon2": "You get all these crazy minerals from me, @. What do you do with them? I'd hope you sell them. That's what I would do.#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_fall_Tue2": "When I first started as a Blacksmith I started keeping a rock and mineral collection. It got pretty big before I just got tired of looking at it.#$b#Leave work at work, you know what I'm saying?#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_fall_Wed2": "Have you found any minerals you haven't been able to sell? You never know who is going to look for something like that. Keep an eye on that job board.#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_fall_Thu2": "If I could grow rocks like you grow crops, I'd have a fortune and wouldn't need to be a Blacksmith anymore. Imagine that?#$b#But then, who would upgrade the items? Joja Mart?#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_fall_Fri2": "I was reading up on what different rocks mean to different cultures. Can you believe some of these things were worshipped?$3#$b#Some rocks cursed, others cured, it's ridiculous, which is why I always carry with me my lucky pebble.$4#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_fall_Sat2": "To think the earth can create such beautiful stones, it's really eye opening. All I can make is artichoke dip.$2#$e#I'll see you soon, @.",
"Clint_fall_Sun2": "Fall is a great time to crush geodes. Cool enough not to overheat, but also to keep the windows open.#$b#Fall is the best time of year to be a Blacksmith. Now, let's crush some geodes.$1#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_fall_Mon4": "I love fall. It's my favorite season of the year. All the best memories of my life happened when the leaves change color.#$b#I hope this fall continues that tradition of good things happening to me.$1#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_fall_Tue4": "During fall as a kid I would wander the woods with my hammer and look for rocks to crush. I found some cool stuff in them.#$b#One time, I found a large gem that, I swear, had a crack in it that looked like a tree. I kept it for many years, but lost it in a move.#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_fall_Wed4": "You ever climb a tree during fall, @? It's easier since all the leaves are off it. You can see really far.#$b#If I tried to climb a tree these days, I might just scare someone. Give them the wrong impression.$2#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_fall_Thu4": "I plan on going into the woods soon and just absorbing everything that makes fall special to me. Nothing can go wrong when I'm at peace.$1#$b#You should try it sometime, @. Just take it all in.#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_fall_Fri4": "The rivers in fall are so cold, I once made the mistake of jumping into one with my swim trunks. It froze my soul.#$b#The ocean gets really cold, too. I wonder why that is? I'm sure there's some reason.$3#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_fall_Sat4": "The only thing that I hate about fall is all the wet leaves. Makes it hard to make a fire. This place needs a lot of maintenance to prevent stuff like that.$3#$e#I'll see you soon, @.",
"Clint_fall_Sun4": "Today is going to be one of those special fall days and I'm stuck inside. The woes of being a Blacksmith. At least you're outside a lot, @.$2#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_fall_Mon6": "I really want to make a weapon that can both crush geodes and slay monsters. However, since I can't, I'm telling you about it, @.#$b#Are you a master monster hunter, or do you just wonder what lurks beneath?$1#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_fall_Tue6": "The creepy noises that come from the mines sometimes makes me nervous, if I'm being honest. I hope they never, you know, rise up or something.$2#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_fall_Wed6": "I used to be a bit of a spelunker, exploring the caves around my home and Pelican Town. It was pretty exciting.#$b#You never know what you're going to find down there...$3#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_fall_Thu6": "Once I went too deep into the mines and found something that I haven't been able to explain well since.#$b#It had horns, sharp teeth, and feathers. It came right for me, but I got away. I wonder if it's still down there?$4#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_fall_Fri6": "I tried to keep a slime I found in the mines as a pet, but it always found a way to escape. It was discouraging, but also inspiring.#$b#His tenacity was something I strive for from time to time.$1#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_fall_Sat6": "I was watching the news and they talked about someone who got lost in the mines who was never found.$2#$b#They came across the camera he was using to record himself, and were able to show the footage.#$b#I've had nightmares all week, @. Seriously.$2#$e#I'll see you soon, @.",
"Clint_fall_Sun6": "All that treasure waiting in the mines, if only I had become an adventurer instead of a Blacksmith.$2#$b#The bright side is, adventurers don't get to crush geodes, now do they?#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_fall_Mon8": "I make a stable living as a Blacksmith, @, but I wish I could make enough to afford to give Emily awesome minerals.#$b#Something I could really show my affection with, you know?$2#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_fall_Tue8": "Emily likes rubies and emeralds, and so do I. Just one of the many things we have in common. I hope to someday give her some.$1#$b#Is that a good goal? Maybe?$2#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_fall_Wed8": "Hey, @, you know what makes fall so great? It's the best time to watch movies with the people you care about.#$b#Lots of warmth to share against the cold of night.$1#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_fall_Thu8": "I wonder where I'd be if I hadn't become a Blacksmith. Think I could have had a farm, @?#$b#It's a lot of responsibility. I don't really like plants.$3#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_Clint_fall_Fri8": "I've been a Blacksmith for a while now. I keep thinking I'm going to give it all up and start over, but I never do.$2#$b#I wonder if that's a healthy way of thinking or not.$3#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_fall_Sat8": "Have you seen it? The first sign of winter? It always creeps up when you least expect it. I think it's behind a tree, staring at my house.#$e#I'll see you soon, @.",
"Clint_fall_Sun8": "Some people love minerals, others hate them. It's always awkward when you give someone a gift they don't like, especially if it's a ruby.$1#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_fall_Mon10": "Before I came here I did work in a far away mountain town. There was this jerk of a Blacksmith, and he was my Rival.#$b#Just thinking about him makes me mad, @.$3#$e#Grudges last, you know? See you, @.",
"Clint_fall_Tue10": "My rival Blacksmith was a jerk. He would do everything he could to out class me, even going so far as to finding out who I liked and try to date them.$3#$b#What a creep that guy was. All for the art of crushing geodes and making things?$3#$e#See you later, @.",
"Clint_fall_Wed10": "When I lived in the mountain town, my jerk rival Blacksmith actually stole a large order of gold bars from me. It would have led to a fortune.$2#$b#How do I know this? Because it did for him. His business took off and got so large, I had to leave if I was going to survive.$2#$e#Still a bit mad. See you later, @.",
"Clint_fall_Thu10": "When I left the mountain town and came here, I was beaten and depressed. But the people here have a special way of cheering you up.$2#$b#Really, I think that's why I've stayed here as long as I have. It's the people, @.#$e#You're great. I'll talk to you later.",
"Clint_fall_Fri10": "There's a lot of people you meet that are mean or they do their best to be better than you.#$b#Years of bitterness has taught me that it's better to just keep improving yourself for your own gain. That's what I strive to do now, @.$1#$e#Maybe someday I won't be so shy. Have a great one, @.",
"Clint_fall_Sat10": "I feel inspired during fall, like I can do anything I set my mind out to do. You know what I'm talking about, @?#$b#I hope you brought some geodes to crush. Let's do it!$1#$e#Have a wonderful day, @.",
"Clint_fall_Sun10": "It's a beautiful day today, @. It's great to see you. Bring anything good?$1#$e#I'm in a good mood, and you made it better. See you again soon, @.",
"Clint_fall_Mon8_inlaw_Emily": "You ever give Emily some of the minerals you find, @? Does she like them? I bet she likes rubies.#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_fall_Tue8_inlaw_Emily": "It's great to have things in common with people. Emily likes rubies and emeralds, as do I. How about you?#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_winter_1": "Winter is here at last. It's my birthday month, which is always exciting.#$b#Another year, another season.#$e#Don't freeze! See you later, @.",
"Clint_winter_Mon": "The tools I upgrade here, it's amazing how efficient they become. It's like magic, but all I do is typical Blacksmith things.#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_winter_Tue": "The gold pickaxe, I've been told, can break actual meteorite. I'm always stunned when people bring bits of it back.#$b#It's great to know I'm not wasting my time at this job.$2#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_winter_Wed": "Of all the axes, the iridium one is my favorite. Purple, menacing, it's a sight to behold.#$b#It can chop down any tree in two swings, isn't that impressive?#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_winter_Thu": "I've tried to make fishing poles before, but I just couldn't figure it out. I think it's because I don't like fishing.$2#$b#Talk to Willy if you want better fishing rods, unless you want me to make you a fishing axe?#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_winter_Fri": "I made an iridium scythe once. It was cursed. I had nightmares that a being in a cloak, wielding it, would be watching me.$2#$b#It's why I refuse to update the scythe, no matter what. Some powers you don't mess with.$4#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_winter_Sat": "There's all sorts of watering cans, but in other places, they just use hoses. I tried to make a gold hose once.#$b#It didn't work out.$2#$e#I'll see you soon, @.",
"Clint_winter_Sun": "I once pitched the idea of a gold milk pail to some friends and they all thought I was crazy.$4#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_winter_Mon2": "You just hanging around here because it's warm, @? At least bring some geodes to be crushed.$3#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_winter_Tue2": "Everyone is complaining about how cold it is, but as a Blacksmith, it's nice and warm. If I do get cold, I just increase the fire.#$b#It'd be wrong to say that Blacksmithing didn't have any benefits.#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_winter_Wed2": "It's extra cold today, which means I'm close to the fire, crushing geodes. It's not a bad time of year, you know?#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_winter_Thu2": "There should be someone that sells items that makes it easier for people to be warmer. Like, a fire stone vendor.#$b#Would that be good? I'd sell it at the shop if it existed.#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_winter_Fri2": "The holidays are here again. I've been getting a lot of requests to make tools for gifts.#$b#I put in a lot of work for those kinds of upgrades, I just hope people use them.$2#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_winter_Sat2": "Cold weather makes the muscles ache more. At least, they make mine hurt.#$b#You know, it's hard being a big, buff blacksmith during the year.$1#$b#You're not laughing...my humor needs work.#$e#I'll see you soon, @.",
"Clint_winter_Sun2": "I haven't gotten too much work done today. I've just been sort of lounging around.#$b#If you got something for me to do, @, I could do it. Free me from my lazy spell.#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_winter_Mon4": "I'm not great at holiday parties. I don't know what to talk about, and tend to drift to topics that start fights.$2#$b#I try to just stand in the corner, but that bothers some people too. It's hard to win at a holiday party.$2#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_winter_Tue4": "Getting together with my family is...interesting. We don't get along very well, and instead just eat angrily at the dinner table.$2#$b#I've stopped going to family gatherings, to be honest.#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_winter_Wed4": "The awkward questions people come up with at holiday functions is always amazing to me. 'Why aren't you married yet' or 'You don't have a girlfriend?'$3#$b#Thanks for spreading that holiday cheer, Grandma. You know what I mean?$3#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_winter_Thu4": "I've overstepped my boundaries with gift giving once. I gave this girl I liked some earrings. I thought it was nice. Her boyfriend didn't.#$b#Life is all about survivng horrendous, awkward experiences.$2#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_winter_Fri4": "It's been extra cold this winter, which has allowed me to go all out with my work. It's a good thing too.#$b#A lot of orders come in during winter, since it's a great time to upgrade tools.#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_winter_Sat4": "I don't speak to my father anymore, not even during the holidays. It's just not worth it.$3#$b#Is there anyone in your family like that, @?#$e#I'll see you soon, @.",
"Clint_winter_Sun4": "This winter, I hope I can finally do something I've put off for a while: work on my six pack abs.$1#$b#You're not laughing. It's a joke. I already have a six pack.#$b#That's a joke too...$2#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_winter_Mon6": "It's so quiet now, with the snow on the ground. It really lets your mind yell at you.#$b#I just get right on back to crushing geodes. That usually shuts it up.$3#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_winter_Tue6": "Hey, @. I see you've survived in Pelican Town till Winter. Good for you. I thought you'd be out by the end of Spring!#$b#I'm glad I was wrong, though. It's good to have you around.$1#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_winter_Wed6": "I always forget how much it snows. You think it'll just be a little bit, then, it's like you're swimming in ice.#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_winter_Thu6": "When the snow gets too crazy I just smack it with a hammer I heat up. It doesn't help, but it's really fun.#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_winter_Fri6": "I've been a Blacksmith for a long time now. I'm always learning new things. I can't share how with you, or else you might doubt my work! $1#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_winter_Sat6": "I didn't think you'd come see me today, @. I'm glad I'm mistaken. It's gotten good to see you all the time.#$e#I'll see you soon, @.",
"Clint_winter_Sun6": "When it's your birthday season, it's bittersweet. You get gifts, but you're also a year older.#$b#Not that it's a bad thing, being older, it's just that time goes by so fast.$2#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_winter_Mon8": "I wonder what I should get Emily this year. It's always so hard to pick the right thing. Jewels? Crafts?#$b#Something that can really stand out and be awesome. I'd like to get her one of those.$1#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_winter_Tue8": "I really like topaz, there's something about the color that inspires me. You're like a topaz, @. You make me happy.#$e#Enjoy the rest of today, @.",
"Clint_winter_Wed8": "This time of year brings out something I despise more than any other. It's Holly, have you seen it yet? I just don't like it.$3#$e#I hope you have a good day today. See you.",
"Clint_winter_Thu8": "I think this is the year I get that special someone something that's really super special. You know it's important because I say a lot of words that start with 'S'.$4#$e#Do something fun today, @.",
"Clint_winter_Fri8": "This year has been really rewarding for me. Being a Blacksmith has felt great, for once. The people, the atmosphere, you, it's all come together.$1#$e#See you around, @.",
"Clint_winter_Sat8": "How's it been on the farm this winter? Is there more to do, or is it stressful?#$e#I'll see you soon, @.",
"Clint_winter_Sun8": "I crushed a geode today that had inside, I kid you not, a bunch of snow flakes. I'd show you, but they all melted.#$e#Crush you next time, @. I mean see you. Is this awkward? It's awkward now, isn't it? Bye. See you, okay? I'm shutting up.",
"Clint_winter_Mon10": "For years I was lonely, @. I know I'm not the easiest to get along with, but your kindness has really helped ease that pain.$2#$b#I'm glad I met you, @. Let's be friends for many years.$1#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_winter_Tue10": "When you're lonely and depressed, it's hard to think you'll ever get out of it. I know a lot of people who haven't.#$b#I still struggle with it, but knowing you and Emily care is a big help.$2#$e#Thanks for being there for me, @. See you later.",
"Clint_winter_Wed10": "It's gotten dark for me a couple of times, where I just wanted to end it, you know? You're the first person I've told this to.$2#$b#But something keeps me going, and I really think it was worth the wait.#$e#Thank you, @. Let's keep it going. See you.",
"Clint_winter_Thu10": "I've been really thinking about who I used to be a lot this season. Depression can really mess with your head.$2#$b#Things really do lose their color, it becomes difficult to sleep...if you ever feel like that, @, get help.#$e#I'm always here to talk, as well. See you, @.",
"Clint_winter_Fri10": "I look forward to next year, @, and am thankful for this year. It's been an eye opening experience, gaining a friend like you.#$e#Have a great day today, okay? See you.",
"Clint_winter_Sat10": "I lost a friend once to depression, many years ago. Nothing I could say or do could help them. When they died, I knew I should get help.$2#$b#I did, and though it didn't feel like it was working for a time, I eventually pulled myself out of the slump.$3#$e#Heavy stuff. Have a good day, @.",
"Clint_winter_Sun10": "Nothing feels right when you're lonely. I hope you never had to know what that's like, @. It's a cold existence.#$b#Which is why I'm so glad we're friends now!$1#$e#Have a great day, okay, @?",
"Clint_winter_Mon8_inlaw_Emily": "Would it be weird if I got a gift for Emily, @? Since you're married and all. I don't suppose, right?#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Clint_winter_sun10_inlaw_Emily": "I'm glad you have Emily, @. She's really great.#$b#If it was anyone else, I'd have something to say!#$e#Have a good one, @.",

		
//Demetrius
"Demetrius_Introduction": "Hello there! I'm Demetrius, a botanist. The only scientist for miles around, in fact.#$b#You're a Farmer? That's great! I bet I could learn a lot from you.#$b#Have you met my daughter, Maru, or my stepson, Sebastian? They're good kids.#$e#I hope you enjoy your time here!",
"Demetrius_Event_tomato1": "You'd think a farmer would know the answer...$s",
"Demetrius_Event_tomato2": "I can't be wrong, @ agrees with me. A farmer agrees with me!$1",
"Demetrius_Event_Lab_Silence": "Well, better get back to it, right?$2",
"Demetrius_Event_Lab_Rat": "Alright... %fork$4",
"Demetrius_spring_1": "A new year, a new season, and a whole host of new memories to be made. Let's work our hardest!$1#$e#Have a great spring, @! Let's do it up!",
"Demetrius_spring_Mon": "Spring is the best time to be a botanist. The beauty of nature reminds me why I do this work in the first place!#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_spring_Tue": "Plants are constantly making energy, thanks to the sun. I'm inspired by them.#$b#At night they go to sleep, but I keep working!$1#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_spring_Wed": "You're a farmer, @. Do you have a favorite spring fruit yet? I love strawberries the most!$1#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_spring_Thu": "Sometimes it's a weird feeling to see a budding plant and know exactly what’s happening.#$b#You have no secrets from me plant! I know what you're up to!#$b#I'm not crazy. Yet.$3#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_spring_Fri": "Sebastian, my step son, isn't one for science. Maru, on the other hand, enjoys working with me.#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_spring_Sat": "Science is constantly changing, and I'm always learning something new. This valley is still full of secrets to be discovered.#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_spring_Sun": "You may have heard plants like music being played to them. That's entirely wrong.$4#$b#Plants much prefer to watch the latest shows. Think I'm kidding? It's scientific!$3#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_spring_Mon2": "You've been working so hard on that farm, @. Have you noticed anything suspicious?#$b#Science mysteries can pop up from anywhere. Always be on the lookout.#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_spring_Tue2": "Can you imagine if plants used something other than water to grow? Like soda? Our world would be different.#$b#I'm sure Joja would be in even more stores if that was the case.$3#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_spring_Wed2": "Have you been able to grow anything giant yet? It's a phenomenon in this valley.#$b#Plant two rows of three of the same plants, and it may happen. Isn't that crazy?$1#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_spring_Thu2": "Green beans can be delicious if you cook with them. They release all sorts of flavors, I love it.#$b#If you ever cook something like that, @, definitely let me know!$1#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_spring_Fri2": "Strawberries...just thinking about them can make me excited.$1#$b#I love them as much as Maru! Is that embarrassing? It should be.#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_spring_Sat2": "I usually bore Robin with science from time to time, but she smiles and nods.#$b#I once made a bunch of facts up, and she caught me. I was shocked!$6#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_spring_Sun2": "Sebastian doesn't like nature or science too much, at least from what he's said so far. It's so hard to connect sometimes.$2#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_spring_Mon4": "These Spring temperatures have been all over the place lately. Sometimes warm, sometimes cold...$2#$b#It's messing with my experiments, I tell you.$4#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_spring_Tue4": "I've had a lack of breakthroughs this Spring. It's fine, but I hope I can find something soon.$2#$b#Nothing makes you feel like a failure faster than a lack of progress.$2#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_spring_Wed4": "Sorry, @, I've been concentrating really hard. I don't have much to say today.$5#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_spring_Thu4": "The feeling you get when you think about a problem for a long time, then figure out the solution, and it's so simple...#$b#It's the best, and worst, feeling in the world.$1#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_spring_Fri4": "I used to think the older you got, the smarter you became. It takes a lot of effort to stay current and keep learning.#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_spring_Sat4": "Sebastian and I had a fight today. Sometimes I wonder if he'll ever accept me.$4#$b#Why can't he be more like Maru?$4#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_spring_Sun4": "Science quiz time! What's the worst part about making a discovery?#$b#You need to find one first...$2#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_spring_Mon6": "I met Robin during a particularly bad time in my life. Sometimes when the world seems about to end, a door opens.#$b#If not for Robin, I don't know where I'd be now.$1#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_spring_Tue6": "I love Maru with my whole heart and soul, but Sebastian...$2#$b#I've had to learn to love him. If only he'd be more agreeable.$4#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_spring_Wed6": "The other day, Robin taught me a new carpentry trick. It's amazing what can be done with some nails and wood.#$b#I really love that woman.$1#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_spring_Thu6": "Maru helps me from time to time, and I appreciate her being around. She's my pride and joy.#$b#I think the plants like her too, but it's hard to get a confession out of them.$1#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_spring_Fri6": "I tried to show Sebastian a cool science trick, but he didn't find it that interesting.$2#$b#Sometimes I wonder if I should just give up trying with him.$2#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_spring_Sat6": "Robin is the kind of person you realize is one of a kind. Without her, and the things she's gone through, I wouldn't be half the person I am now.#$b#I hope you find someone like that someday, @!#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_spring_Sun6": "Maru and Sebastian get along pretty well. It makes me happy to see that it all worked out for them.#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_spring_Mon8": "Don't do botany if you want to get rich, @. It's a passion focused profession. Sometimes you hit big, other times you don't.$5#$b#You have to love it, you really do.#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_spring_Tue8": "Robin brings in most of the money with her carpentry. She covers all the bills, which allows me to work on my discoveries.#$b#Some people might be bothered by that, but her support means the world to me.$1#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_spring_Wed8": "Scientific theory can't reveal all the secrets of life, @. Sometimes I wonder if I've been a good father, or better yet, the best father I could be.$2#$b#There's no way of knowing for sure, I just have to keep doing my best.#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_spring_Thu8": "It's a strange dichotomy: I study plants and figure out how they live; Robin specializes in cutting them down. Yet, we're married.#$b#And best of all, we love each other. Cheesy? Absolutely.$1#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_spring_Fri8": "Hey @! Good to have you around. I was wondering if you were going to come by today. How's it been?$1#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_spring_Sat8": "I've been thinking a lot about underwater plant life and how it would compare to study them. I've gotten some books on kelp.#$b#If you ever want to know obscure kelp facts, @, I can give you some.$1#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_spring_Sun8": "I tried my hand at carpentry once when Robin and I were dating. I promptly cut my hand open.$3#$b#Needless to say, it brought us closer together, and me far away from wood saws.$1#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_spring_Mon10": "I'll let you in on a secret, @. I want to end world hunger. If I could figure it out, no one would ever go hungry again.$4#$b#It's a goal I thought about a lot as a child, when I was starving in the streets. Someday I hope to help others like that.$2#$e#Have a great day, @. Think positive!",
"Demetrius_spring_Tue10": "Relationships and plants have a lot in common. In order to blossom, certain factors need to be met.#$b#Sometimes it can go really well, and become a beautiful flowers. Other times, just one piece can mold, and the whole thing is ruined.$2#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_spring_Wed10": "I was recently featured in a scientific journal about one of my discoveries, and I have to thank you, @, for inspiring me!#$b#Without you, I'm not sure I would have taken another look at farm crops.$1#$e#You're the best. I'll see you later, alright?",
"Demetrius_spring_Thu10": "Good to see you around here, @. I look forward to taking a break when you come by. How are things going on the farm?$1#$e#I hope it all goes well! Have a great one, @.",
"Demetrius_spring_Fri10": "I'm a terrible cook, which is unfortunate because plant life has all sorts of uses in cooking.$2#$b#If I cook something, I'll have you try it. I'd like your feedback.#$e#Just don't expect anything too great! See you, @!",
"Demetrius_spring_Sat10": "Breakthroughs come in all shapes and sizes. Sometimes it can change the world, other times, it can make your life easier.#$b#My greatest discovery lately? Your friendship, @!$1#$e#Have a cheesy day, @!",
"Demetrius_spring_Sun10": "All in all, I'm very happy this spring, and I hope for many more ones like it with my family. Of course, you're invited too, @!$1#$e#Smell the flowers, and have a great day.",
"Demetrius_spring_Sun2_inlaw_Sebastian": "Has Sebastian come around to liking nature? Sometimes people surprise you.#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_spring_Sat4_inlaw_Sebastian": "Sebastian and I used to fight sometimes over the most ridiculous things.$2#$b#I'm glad he's shown maturity living with you, @!#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_spring_Tue6_inlaw_Sebastian": "I'm glad Sebastian has found happiness with you, @. For a long time, I was worried about him.#$b#Being a step father can be difficult at times.$2#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_spring_Thu6_inlaw_Maru": "It's so great that you and Maru have each other now, @. She used to help me with my projects, back in the day.#$b#Now I hope she's as helpful to you as she was to me!$1#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_spring_Sat6_inlaw_Maru": "For me, Robin is my other half. What she's been through, and her insight, inspire me every day.#$b#I hope Maru is that person for you, @.$1#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_spring_Sat6_inlaw_Sebastian": "Robin is my everything. Without her insight, I don't know what I'd be.#$b#I hope Sebastian can be that sort of someone for you, @!#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_summer_1": "Summer is here! Bring out the melons, the sunscreen, and let's get to the beach!$1#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_summer_10": "It's Maru's birthday today. Don't tell her, but I've prepared a special flower to surprise her.$3#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_summer_Mon": "Heat and the sun can have a really negative effect on the body. Be sure to stay cool and hydrated this summer, @!#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_summer_Tue": "Maru has told me a lot about how dangerous heatstroke can be. It effects people who spend their days in the sun...be careful, @!$2#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_summer_Wed": "It's crazy to me to think that air conditioners are still a new idea, history of the world speaking.#$b#I'm glad I never lived when they weren't around.$1#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_summer_Thu": "Some engineers dedicate their entire lives to making things cooler for humans and animals. Isn't that a wonderful calling?#$b#I fully support them in every way I can. I'm pro-air conditioning.$1#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_summer_Fri": "I'm sure you've heard that us humans are sixty percent water. During the summer, I'm one hundred percent iced tea.$3#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_summer_Sat": "It's a hot one today. Remember how cool it was during spring? Don't overdo yourself, @!#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_summer_Sun": "Some people say the best way to rehydrate yourself is with coconut water. I just don't like the taste of it.$4#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_summer_Mon2": "Being a farmer during summer is a lot of hard work, I'm sure, but you get such great crops.#$b#Corn, tomatoes, melons...my mouth is watering at the potential.$1#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_summer_Tue2": "Summer is a great time in Pelican Town for hops. There used to be a legendary brew called 'Pelican Pale Ale,' but it's since disappeared.#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_summer_Wed2": "Corn is a crazy versatile crop. It can be used for so many different things, especially oil!#$b#Then that oil is used for so many things, it's truly a wonderful thing!#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_summer_Thu2": "Robin got a melon once that was so big it took us an entire summer to eat. It wasn't as sweet, of course, but still impressive.#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_summer_Fri2": "I tried to make frozen tea popsicles the other day. It worked, but they weren't very good. I hope to try again soon!$2#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_summer_Sat2": "Have you had a good Summer so far? Grow lots of melons and corn. It'll be worth it if you save some for winter.#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_summer_Sun2": "Summer is a great time for movies with the family and lots of popcorn!$1#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_summer_Mon4": "All I want is a cold beer. That's it. It's been one heck of a day, and I just want one.$4#$b#I won't, though. I won't break my promise ever again.$2#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_summer_Tue4": "It was so hot today I had a hard time concentrating in the lab, and Robin was busy. Not every day can be great.$4#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_summer_Wed4": "The crickets have been loud lately, so they must be happy. Playing their hearts out to find mates.#$b#I always wish crickets luck. I hope they appreciate it.#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_summer_Thu4": "Sebastian has been home more lately, practicing his music. Between the heat and the noise it's almost impossible to concentrate.$4#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_summer_Fri4": "What I'd give for a Pelican Town Pale Ale right now. If not for my integrity, I'd crack open one.$2#$b#Get my mind off it, @. Quick. How's the farm?$6#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_summer_Sat4": "The heat makes people angry, so even the small things feel worse. I just need to calm down today, is all.$2#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_summer_Sun4": "I've been addicted to two things today: my fan, and iced tea. I will do nothing but enjoy them.#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_summer_Mon6": "I have a lot of bad summer memories, but after meeting Robin I have nothing but good ones.#$b#When you find someone like that, you know you have it made.#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_summer_Tue6": "When we were dating, Robin and I scored a getaway to a beach resort for a weekend. It was then that I realized I'd marry her.#$b#I'm feeling nostalgic this summer!$1#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_summer_Wed6": "It's a blessing and a curse to have a kid whose birthday is in summer. Pool parties are great, but children can overheat so easily.$2#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_summer_Thu6": "I wish I could make summer memories with Sebastian, but he's stand offish, as usual. Maybe someday.$2#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_summer_Fri6": "One of the first trips we took to the beach as a family sticks out in my mind as particularly memorable.#$b#Maru was afraid of the water until she chased a crab right into it, and forgot all about her fear. We shared melon as the sunset...#$b#I'm not crying, you're crying, @!$2#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_summer_Sat6": "Sometimes I go a bit overboard showing how much I love Robin, but I can't help it. Especially during summer!$1#$b#If not for her, the thought of where I'd be scares me.$2#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_summer_Sun6": "How are you, @? Keeping up on everything? Don't get heatstroke! Who else would I talk to about crops?#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_summer_Mon8": "Some people leave and go on crazy vacations during their summers in college, but me? I stayed behind and experimented on things.#$b#That's where a lot of the fun was had: in laboratories on school grounds with no one around!$1#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_summer_Tue8": "During those summers in the lab, me and some friends found a way to bring back a long-thought extinct plant. It was an electric time.$1#$b#We found the seeds in an old book on plants, and after getting it's environment right, it sprouted.#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_summer_Wed8": "Been thinking about my summers in college lately. It all came crashing down when one of my 'friends' took credit for our discovery.$2#$b#He was writing a paper on it behind our backs. Before we knew what was happening, he got all the credit.$4#$b#I'm still angry about it, if I'm being honest.$4#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_summer_Thu8": "Sometimes you think that people who you consider friends could never betray you. Then reality sets in, and you're stunned, forever changed.$2#$b#After my 'friend' took all the credit, it sent me down a dark path, something I'm not proud of.$2#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_summer_Fri8": "You ever try moving during the summer? Moving houses, that sort of thing. It's a horrible trial of wills.#$b#We moved into Pelican Town the Summer after Robin and I married.#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_summer_Sat8": "Sometimes I wonder if I had been the one to write that paper during college, instead of my 'friend.' Where would my life be now?$5#$b#Would it be better, or worse? I think it's best just not to know.$5#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_summer_Sun8": "Every time I think about moving, I remember what it was like to move during summer, and promptly shut up. Know what I mean, @?#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_summer_Mon10": "We're good enough friends now, @, that I feel I can tell you what happened to me. After our work was stolen, I drank. A lot.$2#$b#When I woke up in the morning I'd wash my mouth out with beers, liquors, wine, anything. I gave up on going to class, studying, everything. I was a mess.$4#$b#Crazy, right? I'm still amazed.$2#$e#Heavy stuff. I'll see you later, @.",
"Demetrius_summer_Tue10": "When I drank, it was to get gone as soon as I could. Jealousy, anger, anguish, all of it hit me really hard. Eventually I was kicked out of college all together.$2#$b#I just wandered the streets, and it was around then that Robin found me.$5#$e#Crazy how it all works out. Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_summer_Wed10": "When Robin found me out in the streets, drunk as could be, she offered me a glass of water and some dinner. I poured my heart out to her.#$b#She told me this: while it definitely sucked to be betrayed, there was more to life than discoveries and advancements. It wouldn't be the last.#$b#Throwing my life away wouldn't help anything, or make me feel better. It would kill me. I was touched to hear this from a stranger.$2#$e#I'm still stunned. Have a good day, @.",
"Demetrius_summer_Thu10": "I started going to meetings every day to recover from my addiction to the drink, I explained what happened to the dean of my college, and after a six-month detour, I was back to where I was.#$b#Robin saved my life. I'll still be in her loving debt till the day I leave this mortal coil.$1#$e#Have a good one, @. Make good choices!",
"Demetrius_summer_Fri10": "I've been sober for quite a while. But when the days are hot, and the nights are cool, sometimes I still just want a beer!#$e#I will remain strong. Have a great one, @.",
"Demetrius_summer_Sat10": "Thanks for coming around and hearing me out, @. I raise my glass of iced tea to your health, since I don't do beer anymore.$1#$b#Cheers!$3#$e#Go smell some flowers today, @. Have a great day.",
"Demetrius_summer_Sun10": "Want to know the biggest irony? That friend of mine who stole our work? He left science all together to work fast food.$6#$b#In the end, I really don't understand any of it, but I fixed my life, so I win!$1#$e#Happy thoughts, @! Smell some flowers.",
"Demetrius_summer_10_inlaw_Maru": "I hope you did something awesome for Maru today, @. It's her birthday!$1#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_summer_Thu4_inlaw_Sebastian": "Sebastian used to practice a lot during the summer. He was getting pretty good before he moved out!$1#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_summer_Thu6_inlaw_Sebastian": "I'm glad you're making summer memories with Sebastian! Summer is a special time for things like that.#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_fall_1": "The cooler temperatures are finally here. It's time to double down on science!$1#$e#Happy fall, @!",
"Demetrius_fall_21": "It's Robin's birthday today! I have quite the surprise for her later. I hope she enjoys it!#$b#If she hates it, well, that would be awkward.$3#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_fall_Mon": "Fall means it's time to be with family and science! Granted it's hard to get everyone together these days.#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_fall_Tue": "Maru's been so busy lately, as has Robin. Luckily the plants are there for me, as always.#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_fall_Wed": "Can you believe that all the trees can go dormant as they do? It still baffles me they evolved like that.#$b#I'm glad we humans don't do something similar. That'd be creepy.$2#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_fall_Thu": "Smell that in the air? It's a fall potpourri Robin brought for me. I actually didn't like it at first...#$b#But as is the way in fall, I grew to like it. Crazy how it works sometimes.$1#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_fall_Fri": "I love this time of year. All these excuses to get together as a family, and I can crack plant jokes.$1#$b#Here's one. What did the radish say to the onion?#$b#Plants can't talk! You should know that. Unless you've seen some things...$3#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_fall_Sat": "There's writer's block, artist block, and I'm feeling science block right now. I'm going to wander outside for a bit, I think.$2#$b#Best way to find inspiration is to just walk away sometimes.#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_fall_Sun": "Oh! @! I've been meaning to tell you something. What was it again?$6#$b#I'm having a hard time remembering. This is embarrassing. If I think of it again, I'll let you know.$2#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_fall_Mon2": "How's your family? I heard you got the farm from your grandfather. Sorry about his passing.$2#$b#I never had the chance to meet him, but if he was like you, @, I'm sure he was nice.#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_fall_Tue2": "When you got the ranch, were you overwhelmed? I would be. That's the thing about science, it doesn't exist until it's discovered.#$b#You had an entire ranch to fix up. Not an easy task!$1#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_fall_Wed2": "I've seen you through the seasons now, @. How does fall treat you? Does it make things easier, or harder?#$b#Who wants to work when it's so nice out? It's the season for exploring and walks.#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_fall_Thu2": "Do you hope to have a large family, or just be by yourself? No shame if you don't want to answer.#$b#I never thought I'd be a family man. Yet, here I am. Strange how it works out sometimes.$1#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_fall_Fri2": "I've been enjoying listening to music more lately. I haven't in a long time, since it breaks up my concentration.#$b#But this time of year, with the window open and a good song, it's really nice.#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_fall_Sat2": "You think you'd ever sell the ranch, if someone offered a big enough sum? It's amazing how some people balk when it comes to money.#$b#They forget the memories all for cash. Don't be like them, @!$4#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_fall_Sun2": "I heard some advice the other day that said, 'don't give up on your dreams.' But what if you have to care for a family?$2#$b#Then again, if you're happy, it's better for your family...quite the problem.$5#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_fall_Mon4": "I just don't get Sebastian sometimes. He's an enigma, an uncrackable nut. I just wish he could trust me.$4#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_fall_Tue4": "Many years ago we had a family game night. We stopped doing it after a while, since it got a bit awkward.$2#$b#I beat Sebastian at a card game and he said I cheated, and it became this huge thing.$4#$b#I don't miss those days, I'll tell you that.$2#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_fall_Wed4": "Every few years your kids change into different people. They are still your kids, but they are smarter, more experienced.#$b#It's always fun to meet the people they become. I just hope they grow into good people!$1#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_fall_Thu4": "I haven't told my kids all my secrets. I wonder if that's wise. It might change how they see me...$2#$b#I wasn't always Mr. Science, @. I have quite the past!$5#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_fall_Fri4": "I just can't do anything right today. Everything has failed. My plans, my experiment, all wasted.$2#$b#It's frustrating when everything falls apart. Here's hoping for tomorrow.$2#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_fall_Sat4": "I had a fight with Maru of all people recently. I'm still a bit shocked. Sometimes I overstep my boundaries as a father.$2#$b#She's growing up to be a fine person. I need to respect that.$2#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_fall_Sun4": "Robin is far more understanding than I of Sebastian. It's an odd topic to bring up sometimes, but her insight is helpful.$2#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_fall_Mon6": "Once all the work is done, Robin and I have been spending time reading together. She has her books, I have mine, and it's peaceful.#$b#She's a fast reader, too. She's already lapped me with her romance novels.$6#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_fall_Tue6": "I want to make a big discovery. Something that really stuns the world. I wonder what it could be?#$b#'Corn likes sheep better than cows,' or maybe, 'trees can sing songs taught to them.' Weird, but still discoveries.$3#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_fall_Wed6": "One of my college friends made a big discovery that drove him crazy. He always wondered about the way the eye perceived human head shapes.#$b#He ran an experiment and discovered he had one of the ugliest head shapes, according to the brain.$1#$b#He wore lots of hats after that, and to admit, he did look better.$3#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_fall_Thu6": "A professor told me this once. 'Your discovery will happen when you least expect it.'#$b#He also admitted he had never discovered anything except that teaching position, so in my mind, that advice sort of hangs there.$3#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_fall_Fri6": "I'm reading one of my favorite book series right now. It's called the 'Jurassic Scientist,' and it's about a science major who travels back in time and fights dinosaurs.#$b#I'm terribly addicted, even though they aren't that well written. Is that so bad?$2#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_fall_Sat6": "Science can inspire, enlighten, and also terribly depress. Like when discoveries are made too late, or you find a situation is really hopeless.$2#$b#I hope to keep things positive, no matter what I find.#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_fall_Sun6": "Talking with Maru, I can see things she picked up from me, and from Robin. Both good and bad.#$b#I hope she picks up a love of cheesy adventure stories, then I could talk about 'Jurassic Scientist' with someone!$1#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_fall_Mon8": "One of the things I fear the most is fading into obscurity. It'd be like all my hard work in the field of science would be for nothing.$2#$b#I'd like to leave something behind to make people proud. Make my legacy, that sort of thing.#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_fall_Tue8": "Thanks for getting to know me, @. In truth, I don't talk to a lot of the people in Pelican Town, since I'm always here at this lab.#$b#Perhaps I should start, though. Maybe soon.#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_fall_Wed8": "I wonder if I will be a good grandfather. It's so hard to wonder impossible questions.$2#$b#They always strike in the middle of the night for me. It's why I'm so tired today.#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_fall_Thu8": "Perhaps one's legacy doesn't have to be purely academic. Passing on genes, inspiring others, there's many ways to become a legend, so to speak.#$b#Hopefully my legend is one well remembered! The great botanist from Pelican Town.$1#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_fall_Fri8": "You ever wonder what happens to the names of the scientists who were proven wrong? They get written into a book at colleges around the world called, 'The Pioneers.'#$b#It's a secret book though, and only the best scientists know it exists.$3#$b#I'm also making this up, but it sounds really cool.#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_fall_Sat8": "I was recently listening to a news program cover a popular fad with kids these days. I didn't get the appeal, but then it hit me.#$b#I've become so old that the things exciting the new generation are as foreign to me as botany is to them. That's quite the shock.$6#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_fall_Sun8": "If I fade into obscurity, I guess it's fine. I had fun doing what I love, and no one can take that away from me.#$b#Unless it's revealed I did a really bad job, then, well, let's not go there.$2#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_fall_Mon10": "You see anything out there, @? Anything strange? If you do, let me know.$2#$e#Have a good day, okay, @?",
"Demetrius_fall_Tue10": "I swear I keep seeing things wandering the forests at night. Am I going crazy? Am I on to something?$2#$e#Such strange happenings. See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_fall_Wed10": "When I was a kid, I got locked in my grandma's attic. She had this forest gnome statue that looked like the devil itself.$4#$b#I was up there an hour before she let me out. I swear it moved around.$3#$e#I still don't like thinking about it. See you, @.",
"Demetrius_fall_Thu10": "Lawn gnomes, garden gnomes, gnome anything, I can't stand them. How can something meant to be cute look so sinister? No thanks, I say.$4#$e#I bet the flowers are creeped out, too, by Garden Gnomes. Have a weird one, @.",
"Demetrius_fall_Fri10": "Fall's the time of year when I see them most. It must be a coincidence, but they creep me out.$2#$b#The gnomes wander the forests of my dreams! It makes me shiver, @.$2#$e#Enjoy today, @. Be careful.",
"Demetrius_fall_Sat10": "Fears are learned. Some are inherent. I'm not sure if my fear of gnomes comes from my grandma's attic, or from my very being.$2#$b#Either way, I prefer not to look at them, at all.#$e#Stay sane, @. Make good choices.",
"Demetrius_fall_Sun10": "Once, someone remarked that baby Maru looked like a little gnome. I looked them straight in the eye and said, 'hell no she doesn't.'$4#$b#Maru is far cuter than any demon of the forest realm.$4#$e#Have a good one, okay?",
"Demetrius_fall_Thu2_inlaw_Maru": "I hope you enjoy being a part of a family as much as I do. It's a lot of fun when things work out right.#$b#You and Maru are happy, and that makes me very happy!$1#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_fall_Sat4_inlaw_Maru": "Maru and I rarely fought, but when we did, she usually won. Never get on her bad side!#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_fall_Thu2_inlaw_Sebastian": "I hope family life is treating you as well as it treats me. I really do love it.#$b#When things work out, it's a magical feeling.#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_fall_Mon4_inlaw_Sebastian": "I'm glad you were able to connect with Sebastian, @. He's such an enigma to me still.$2#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_winter_1": "Everything has frozen over, and all the plants have gone into their long sleep. You know what that means? Vacation time!#$e#Happy winter to you, @! Have a great day.",
"Demetrius_winter_Mon": "I always vacation in winter. It keeps my brain in line with the plants. However, I still spend a lot of time in the lab.#$b#Seems it's more my attitude that goes on a vacation than my actual work habit.$1#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_winter_Tue": "I love reading, and during winter it's the best to stay in bed and enjoy a good book as the snow falls. It's very relaxing.#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_winter_Wed": "I've tried many hobbies over the years to get my mind off botany. Tennis, baking, sewing, things like that. I didn't really enjoy them.#$b#But a good book? One with good characters and dialogue? I'm all in.#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_winter_Thu": "I'm not one of those people who will have to finish a book they start. If it's not good, it's not worth my time.#$b#I still feel a little bad, however. Sometimes if the plot is good but writing is bad, I'll see it to the end.$3#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_winter_Fri": "When I'm on vacation, I try not to think about plants and instead focus on relaxing.#$b#But when I'm relaxed, I start thinking about plants, and I get excited. It's a vicious circle.$2#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_winter_Sat": "I've read enough books now that I like to think I can feel when a writer gives up on a story. Usually when something crazy happens.#$b#'She walked into the room and found the murderer.' It's like, really?$4#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_winter_Sun": "This vacation is going to be extra special because Robin is going to take some time off as well. I'm planning special dates!$1#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_winter_Mon2": "Robin's been doing some special wood working projects lately that are really inspiring. They are complete works of art!$1#$b#She tries to say they are nothing special, but they really are great. Maybe you'll get to see some, @.#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_winter_Tue2": "I love everything about plants, but when it comes to medical things about humans I can get queezy.$1#$b#Maru knows this and when she starts talking about her day, sometimes I have to block it all out.$2#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_winter_Wed2": "Maru was telling me this particularly gross story about when she was in school to be a nurse. It involved things she had to clean up.$2#$b#I feel sick just bringing it up to you, @. Let's talk about other things.$2#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_winter_Thu2": "I'm really bad with my hands when it comes to crafting something. I could never do what Robin does, and I'd be a clumsy nurse.#$b#My special power is my ability to look at things and think about them. Be jealous, @!$1#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_winter_Fri2": "Seeing Robin work on her projects gets me really excited. I can't wait to see what she comes up with next.#$b#I'd like to come up with something excites her someday!$1#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_winter_Sat2": "I also have a secret super power. It's the ability to bore anyone within arm’s length by talking about botany.$3#$b#However, talking about it makes me happy, so it's a give and take sort of power.$1#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_winter_Sun2": "The crazy thing about plants, it's that they want to live. Just like everything else, they have that inherent drive to last.#$b#It's inspiring stuff on a lot of levels to me.#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_winter_Mon4": "I'll be straight with you, @. There are a lot of aspects of botany I really enjoy and find interesting.#$b#On a scientific level, though, how plants survive the winter does nothing for me. It's a deep field of study, but it bores me.$2#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_winter_Tue4": "It was just me and Sebastian eating breakfast today, and it was completely silent. I wish I could have said something.$2#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_winter_Wed4": "I love Robin with everything in me, which is why it's so hard when I fail to cheer her up.$2#$b#Sometimes people need their space, but it can still feel like failing.$2#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_winter_Thu4": "Studying plants in college was invigorating, but one of the classes I hated was creative writing.$2#$b#I'm a big reader, but creative writing does not come naturally for me. Where do writers get their ideas?$4#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_winter_Fri4": "Maru is a very understanding person. She has great empathy. She can always tell when I'm in a bad mood.#$b#Just seeing her cheers me up, though. She's one of a kind!$1#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_winter_Sat4": "Just because a scientist pursues a field doesn't mean they are interested in every single aspect of it.#$b#I met a scientist once that hated dogs, but was fascinated by how their worked. Interesting person.$6#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_winter_Sun4": "Nothing can shatter a relationship between scientists like disagreements. It's never what you would expect, either.#$b#I once almost fought a geologist who put the milk in the bowel before the cereal. I mean, who does that?$4#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_winter_Mon6": "I really hope everyone in my family is happy with where they are. I have confidence they would tell me if they weren't.$2#$b#Yet, sometimes I wonder if they are as happy as they could be. Weird thoughts, I know.$2#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_winter_Tue6": "Cats and I don't really get along very well. Not sure what it is, but every time I meet a cat, I can feel their hatred.$2#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_winter_Wed6": "There's a cat that wanders around near the house sometimes. I stare at it, it looks right at me. Time freezes. Then it moves on.$3#$b#Is it trying to tell me something, or do I just look funny to it?#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_winter_Thu6": "I recently got an offer to go out and work with some old friends of mine. I had to turn them down.$5#$b#Running with them again wouldn't lead to anything good. I like where I am now, I don't want anything to change that.#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_winter_Fri6": "I've been thinking about expanding the lab, but I'm not sure what it will do for me. What I have now works fine, but expansion is intriguing.#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_winter_Sat6": "Happy winter, @. How's the farm coming? Don't get too cold out there!$1#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_winter_Sun6": "Seeing Maru become a nurse has filled me with pride. She's perfect for the job.#$b#She mentioned she'd like to become a doctor someday, and I'm fully supporting that.#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_winter_Mon8": "Want to know why I become a botanist? It's an interesting story, at least I think so.#$b#Actually, come back tomorrow. It's hard to sum up on the spot.$2#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_winter_Tue8": "When I was a kid, my grandmother kept all sorts of plants. One of them she called her 'secret spice,' and would use it in everything.#$b#Well, I hated that spice, and the plant smelled terrible, but she'd never tell me what it was.$4#$b#Grandmothers, right?$3#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_winter_Wed8": "After my grandmother wouldn't tell me the type of plant she used, I went to the library and got a book on them.#$b#I went through every page, learning a lot about plants, until finally finding it.#$b#It was peppermint. I still hate the taste, but it started the journey to where I am today.$6#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_winter_Thu8": "Sometimes when people realize what they want to do, there's a lot of celebration and excitement in their family.#$b#When I announced I wanted to be a botanist, no one knew what it was. I was the only one who cared.$2#$b#I'm still not sure if that was for the best or not.#$e#Go smell some flowers! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_winter_Fri8": "Peppermint is one of the few herbs you can't grow here, which works for me. The smell makes me sick.$4#$b#Robin calls my dislike of peppermint a 'fault,' which is fair. I take this burden with me.#$e#Make some good choices today, @! For science!",
"Demetrius_winter_Sat8": "We're not boring people, us botanists. We just thought our ancient ancestors were onto something, and picked up the work where they left off.#$b#Also, the biology class was full, and this degree needed less credits.$2#$b#I'm kidding! Neither had people.$1#$e#Time to continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_winter_Sun8": "I'm glad I've gotten to know you this year, @. You're one of the few people who can stand my botany talk honestly!$1#$b#Which is why I've saved a list of botany facts for you today. Number one, sunflowers, do they contain the sun?$3#$e#Make today have meaning, @! See you.",
"Demetrius_winter_Mon10": "I hope we have many years of friendship together, @. You feel like part of the family now. It's been a pleasure getting to know you.#$e#Have a splendid winter day!",
"Demetrius_winter_Tue10": "You have my respect, @, I just want to let you know that. It's not easy, doing what you do, but you keep at it.#$b#It inspires me, if I'm being honest. Never stop!$1#$e#For me, I'll focus on science. Have a good one!",
"Demetrius_winter_Wed10": "Can you imagine if we can discover a new kind of crop together? I'd call it the @ Berry. Or maybe, @, the great vegetable.#$b#I'm not good at names. Clearly.$3#$e#Corn on the @? No? Okay, I'm done.",
"Demetrius_winter_Thu10": "What a fast year it's been. I may have spent a lot of time here in the lab, but with you around, @, it's made things interesting.#$b#In a good way, of course!$1#$e#Now I must continue my research. See you later, @!",
"Demetrius_winter_Fri10": "From Robin and I, we hope you have a very wonderful winter. You've been great this year.#$e#To many more exciting times! Have a great day, @.",
"Demetrius_winter_Sat10": "@! What a nice surprise to see you today. Glad to have you. I'm about to make a breakthrough! Hopefully it works out.$1#$e#If it doesn't, well, I'll try again! Have a good one, @.",
"Demetrius_winter_Sun10": "Whenever I get down or doubtful, the love of my family and my friends cheers me up.#$b#Thanks for being a part of that, @!$1#$e#See you around, okay? Cheers.",
"Demetrius_winter_Tue4_inlaw_Sebastian": "Back in the day, Sebastian and I would eat breakfast, not saying a word.$2#$b#Hopefully he's broke that habit with you, @!#$e#Back to the science! See you around, @.",
"Demetrius_winter_Mon10_inlaw_Maru": "I'm so glad you're a part of the family now, @. I hope we have many years together. It's been great getting to know you.#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @. Be positive.",
"Demetrius_winter_Mon10_inlaw_Sebastian": "It's great having you be part of the family now, @. It's my hope we have lots of years together. It's been fantastic.#$e#Talk to the plants, @, and have a wonderful day.",
"Demetrius_winter_Sun10": "All in all, remember this, @: the only energy you truly need is your own.#$b#Use that logic, and seize the day. Let nothing stop you!#$e#Unless it's not a good idea, in which case, don't do it.",


//Gus
"Gus_Introduction": "Welcome to the Stardrop Saloon! I am Gus, your humble barkeep.$1#$b#You must be new around here, which is good for me! The more the merrier, especially in Pelican Town.",
"Gus_SeedShop_Entry": "Hello there, Pierre!/What did I need again?/Wonderful, wonderful!/It's going to be a good one tonight!/Where's the good stuff, Pierre?/Pierre! I need the best!",
"Gus_spring_1": "Spring! The season of love and hope, beauty and grace. It makes me want to drink a nice glass of wine. Maybe two!$1#$e#Have a good day, @! Stay cool!",
"Gus_spring_Mon": "Have you tried Journey of the Prairie King yet? It seems simple, but can be quite difficult.#$b#Those dents in the machine are not from me, I swear!$1#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_spring_Tue": "I cook everything here myself. It's a lot of work, but it's always been worth it.#$b#Have you tried my pizza yet? It's a specialty!#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_spring_Wed": "This Saloon has been in Pelican Town for a long time. According to the last owner, I'm the 33rd!#$b#I didn't have the heart to change the look of the place, so here we are.#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_spring_Thu": "Thanks for coming in to cool off, @! I do my best to make the place comfortable.#$b#Sometimes I can go a bit overboard, though. No free drinks!$1#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_spring_Fri": "I was up extra early today to make sure everything would be perfect for tonight. I love my work!#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_spring_Sat": "Some people start off as bad cooks then become good cooks, but I have always been a wonderful cook!#$b#However, I'm terrible at making salad. Isn't that strange?$2#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_spring_Sun": "I provide some recipes, but they are not as good as my own! Everything here is cooked with my own secret ingredients...$3#$b#What are my secret ingredients, you wonder? My love of cooking!#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_spring_Mon2": "I've been seeing a lot of you lately, @! That's a good thing. The more the merrier.#$b#The more customers I get, the longer I can do this!$1#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_spring_Tue2": "The Saloon is an odd place. Sometimes it does really well, and other times it does not.$2#$b#I try not to worry about it, though. I just keep having fun!#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_spring_Wed2": "I used to carry a local brew called Pelican Pale Ale. Truly a great beverage, full and boastful in flavor.#$b#Then, the creator stopped, and with him, his secrets. Such a shame!$2#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_spring_Thu2": "Emily is a great help, and usually closes up shop for me. I just go straight to bed, but not before having a glass of wine!#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_spring_Fri2": "Seems we're going to hit the rent this month! Drinks all around! You still have to pay for them, though.#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_spring_Sat2": "Hey there, @! Come to spread the joy around, or get something to eat? All are welcome and appreciated!$1#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_spring_Sun2": "I made some really bad coffee this morning, and had to pour it out. I gave it to the plants, and they said, 'yuck!'$2#$b#I'll need to do something nice for them...#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_spring_Mon4": "@! You're like a patron now. It's always good to see you. What will you be having today?$1#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_spring_Tue4": "I have not always been in Pelican Town, you know. I traveled around the world, as a cook! Learning under some truly great cooks.$1#$b#How I miss that life sometimes. But I love what I do now!#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_spring_Wed4": "I learned how to cook many of things I sell here in the saloon in faraway places. But my pizza? That's something different.#$b#That pizza is my father's recipe, which he got from his mother, and down the line it goes.#$b#What do you think? Do you like it?$1#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_spring_Thu4": "Hello @! I've been thinking about my travels around the world lately. Want to hear one of the worst?#$b#I was stuck in the snow-covered mountains, at a resort, cooking for the rich and famous. I shivered in my bunk, with no thanks.$2#$b#Never again, @! I tell you! Never again!$3#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_spring_Fri4": "Nothing is greater than seeing the face of someone who tastes your cooking and likes it. It can transform the soul.$1#$b#But at the same time, when someone hates your cooking, it can break your heart!#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_spring_Sat4": "As a bartender, I have to make sure no one drinks too much! It can be difficult, however.#$b#Sometimes people don't want to stop, and the money can be good...$2#$b#When your honor is at stake, you must do what is right!$3#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_spring_Sun4": "What a week. I look forward to hanging out tonight, drinking some wine...#$b#Maybe two glasses of wine. Dare I spoil myself, @?$1#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_spring_Mon6": "I have a cousin who is a plumber. I haven't heard from him in a long time.#$b#I should send him something in the mail. I wonder how these days? Down the drain?$1#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_spring_Tue6": "The first time I cooked for someone, it was by accident. My mother needed to make some cookies, but she fell asleep.#$b#I picked up where she left off, and she was so proud. She bit into them, and was stunned.$3#$b#'These are all burnt!' she said. Then she patted my head and showed me how. Marvelous!$1#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_spring_Wed6": "I really wish you could have tried Pelican Pale Ale, @. It was wonderful.$2#$b#I get people from other towns who stop by and ask for it. I have to say no one makes it anymore. If only someone could find the recipe...#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_spring_Thu6": "I dream about cooking dishes sometimes, @. It's true! But I don't use normal ingredients.#$b#I use cloud-flowers and moon-tears, sunset fruit and daydreams...$3#$b#Be careful what people offer you at parties when you're young, @!$1#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_spring_Fri6": "I couldn't sleep last night, but my tiredness didn't stop me from making everything here perfect.#$b#I may go to bed early tonight, though. We'll have to see.$2#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_spring_Sat6": "Clogging the drain can ruin a restaurant, @, just ruin it! I've called my plumber cousin to help fix it many times.#$b#If not for him, so many nights would have been ruined!$3#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_spring_Sun6": "If someone cut off my arms, I would cook with my teeth. If they took out my teeth, I'd cook with my nose!#$b#And if they cut off my nose? I'd give up cooking and seek vengeance, @! Vengeance!$3#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_spring_Mon8": "Spring is a season of love for me, @. All of my greatest loves were in spring.$1#$b#I had one spring that was spent with my lover, drinking wine and each other.#$b#You don't think I could do it? I was the best!$1#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_spring_Tue8": "With love in the air, I get excited, @, I really do. Today I made everything with a spring in my step.#$b#To be young enough to love as freely as I did then! But it is not to be. I've had my fun, @!$1#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_spring_Wed8": "Love can surprise you, @, it can. One of my craziest loves came from a fellow cook, who told me my own cooking was awful.#$b#I dared them to try and out-cook me, and what started at their house, ended in their bed!$1#$b#I don't remember who won, in the end...#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_spring_Thu8": "Heartbreak is the worst in spring because it is so nice outside and you just want to be sad inside. It's important to get out there!$2#$b#Drink and cry when you come home, at night. But during the day? Celebrate your new potential!#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_spring_Fri8": "I have seen many people fall in and out of love here in Pelican Town. It makes me happy, and sad.#$b#I like to imagine there is someone out there for everyone, just waiting to be found. Is a happy thought, no?#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_spring_Sat8": "Sometimes coffee can be more wonderful than beer, and today is one of those days! I've had three cups already, I barely slept.$3#$b#It's good to see you though, @, so thanks for waking me up with your being here!$1#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_spring_Sun8": "Let me tell you, @, that if you ever experience heartbreak, that it will make you stronger. It will hurt, but never give in to the pain.$3#$b#I speak from experience. Never give in to the feelings of despair!$2#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_spring_Mon10": "When I discovered this place, @, this Saloon, I was heartbroken. I had lost the love of my life.$2#$b#I thought we would be together forever, cooking and being in love. We would have.$3#$b#But sometimes people get sick, @! Then, they are gone, and with them, my heart.$2#$e#Pardon me! Have a good night, @!",
"Gus_spring_Tue10": "I was once a patron here, @. Drinking my sorrows away. It was a problem. Then the former owner asked if I wanted to work in the kitchen, and eventually, own the place.#$b#I said yes. It had been the dream of my lover and I to own a restaurant. I do it for their memory.$1#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_spring_Wed10": "I learned this when I took over the place: pain is temporary. I have gotten better, smiled more, and found the reason to live.$1#$b#I live for the joys of seeing you, @, and my other patrons. I live for the memory of my lover, for as long as I am alive, they will never die!#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_spring_Thu10": "@, when you walked through those doors, I never thought you'd keep coming in. But you have!$1#$b#I am a better person for having known you, @, believe me! Thank you for coming.#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_spring_Fri10": "When the owner asked if I would change the name of the Saloon, I said no. The stardrop is a beautiful thing, why remove something beautiful from the sign?#$b#Am I wrong? The name is catchy, as well!$1#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_spring_Sat10": "My lover passed away in a faraway land, and I'm still not sure if being so far away helped the pain, or made it worse.$2#$b#Such thoughts on a night like this!? Let us be merry in each other's company, @!#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_spring_Sun10": "@! I was hoping you'd come here tonight, for I made the food with you in mind. Especially the beer! Brewed with love!$1#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_spring_Mon8_inlaw_Emily": "I hope you're keeping Emily happy, @! If you make her unhappy, you'll have to answer to me!#$b#I know you, though. I can't imagine that happening.",
"Gus_summer_1": "Bring out the ice-cold beverages and turn up the air, summer is here, @! Are you ready?#$e#Have a good day, @, but don't go overboard!",
"Gus_summer_Mon": "When it's hot outside the best thing to do is cool off with a nice drink. I have all sorts, @, take your pick!#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_summer_Tue": "Are you one of those people that can drink hot coffee even if it's hot outside? I have a few of those people come in sometimes.#$b#I don't understand them, but I love their passion!$1#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_summer_Wed": "The Saloon is the coldest place in all of Pelican Town during summer. It must be the way they designed the building. Can you feel it, @?#$b#You can't get that refreshing air anywhere else!$1#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_summer_Thu": "Summer is a great time for alcohol. Summer brews from all over the world come in, and it's a pleasure to drink them.#$b#The taste of the sun, truly inspiring!$1#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_summer_Fri": "I've been getting up extra early to beat the heat to cook everything. I don't even need a clock, I know what time it is by how hot it gets!#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_summer_Sat": "Ice is a hard thing to keep up on for one person. I have my methods, but they have been crafted over many years.#$b#Telling a customer you've run out of ice, it hurts the soul!$3#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_summer_Sun": "I clean every glass by hand. It means that no matter what, I was there for each part of the experience.#$b#It is a matter of my pride, @! I enjoy doing it.$1#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_summer_Mon2": "Over the years, I've had some pretty interesting characters come through the Saloon doors. Some good, some downright bad!#$b#What are you, @? We shall see!$1#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_summer_Tue2": "This is a story I was told by the previous owner. In the old days, this was the frequent hang-out for the outlaw Seven Finger Jim.$3#$b#He'd drink here and cause all sorts of trouble. He was finally put down in a duel out in the forest. Crazy, no?#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_summer_Wed2": "I was told that one famous celebrity was a bartender in this saloon during the golden age of movies. She went on to be a star.#$b#Maybe Emily is destined for such greatness? I hope so!$1#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_summer_Thu2": "It's always busy during summer, which is why I'm happy to have Emily. We always just make the rush!$1#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_summer_Fri2": "Wouldn't it be nice to have more dances in here? I could relive my old days. Put up lights, turn up the jukebox, that sort of thing.#$b#It would be an interesting change in the looks of this place, though!$1#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_summer_Sat2": "Another unsavory character that frequented this place was a woman called the Dark Warlock Magnifica. She could drink her fill, I hear.#$b#She fell in love with a patron, and one night went off with him. He was never seen again!#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_summer_Sun2": "I love being a barkeep because I meet people at different points of their lives. Happy, sad, angry, all sorts of people come in.#$b#I just hope I can make them feel a little bit of extra joy!$1#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_summer_Mon4": "Oh, @, let me tell you of my travels around the world during summer. Some places, it was beautiful, inspiring.#$b#In other places, it was unbearable, humid, and depressing. But you make do!$3#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_summer_Tue4": "There was a summer I had a lot like this one, far away, in a coastal town. Cool beaches, hot winds, stunning clouds.#$b#I'd cook with the windows open, and dream of flying, @!$1#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_summer_Wed4": "I've cooked for royalty, @! Can you believe that? The great kings and queens of faraway places. They requested me by name!$1#$b#My hands were shaking, I was sweating, it was insane. The food though? How did it taste?$3#$b#Like it was made by a god, @. I'll never cook that good again!$1#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_summer_Thu4": "I was stuck in a desert resort one summer. I didn't know things could get so hot. I don't remember much of it, @!#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_summer_Fri4": "When you're as weathered as I am, it means a lot to have a summer surrounded by friends, drinking good brew.#$b#There were a lot of summers spent cooking with people I didn't like, @! I don't plan on doing that again.$3#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_summer_Sat4": "When a member of royalty asks you to cook their favorite dish, how should you cook it? There's only one answer.$3#$b#The way they want it! If you cook it the way you want it, your head will be off and rolling down the street!$1#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_summer_Sun4": "I may have had a few drinks before my shift today, @. Don't tell anyone, it will be our secret!$1#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_summer_Mon6": "I have failed horribly as a cook, @. Ruined entire dinners, had mobs of people come after me because of a bad plate.$2#$b#It's always discouraging, but if you stop at a bad plate, you can't redeem yourself.$3#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_summer_Tue6": "One of my worst times as a cook was on a train. Small kitchen, no beer to drink, no windows. I got depressed, and could not find it in me to cook.$3#$b#They were trying to break down the door to the kitchen, but I held them off, @! I gave them crackers and called it quits.$3#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_summer_Wed6": "During a summer when I was young, I was in love and my rival was a better cook than me. I couldn't let that happen, so I mastered how to make French omelets.#$b#I made the best omelet one could have, but my rival was still better looking, so I lost. Strange how it all works out!$3#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_summer_Thu6": "You know your passion and your purpose when you try to do something else and it burns your heart. I tried to be a writer once, of poetry.#$b#I hated it! It's not like cooking, and my poems were awful. I ran back into the kitchen, @, and haven't left since!$3#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_summer_Fri6": "Never disrespect your dishwasher! The number one rule of any cook. Without the dishwasher, the dishes don't get washed, the restaurant falls apart.#$b#The door slamming when a dishwasher quits is a sound that reverbs through your whole body.$2#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_summer_Sat6": "Today I had to throw out an entire batch of pizza. It was awful, in no way I was going to serve it to people!$3#$b#As a cook, you must have respect for your own reputation. I don't serve garbage, so into the garbage it went!#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_summer_Sun6": "When I realized I would cook for the rest of my life, it was freeing, inspiring. No more wondering, no more second guesses. I would cook!#$b#It's lead me here, and I am very happy, @, this I tell you.$1#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_summer_Mon8": "Here's some gossip, @. Sebastian and Demetrius do not get along! At all! Isn't that a shame?#$b#Stepfather and Stepson at arms, it breaks my heart. But there's nothing that I can do.$2#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_summer_Tue8": "You see Clint? He comes in here quite often, but not to drink. I think he likes Emily!$1#$b#True love, isn't it grand? If only he'd make a move!#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_summer_Wed8": "I tell this to you in confidence, @. The Pam situation is a bit awkward for me. I'm not sure what is right for me to do.$3#$b#I can only hope it plays out in a positive way.$3#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_summer_Thu8": "Lewis and Marnie, have you seen them together? They try to hide their feelings. I do not understand why.$3#$b#Do not hide your love! Yell on the highest mountain your feelings!$1#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_summer_Fri8": "The Wizard came in the other day. I was surprised to see him. He had coffee, then left. Maybe he's just shy?#$b#I don't ask questions of people like him!#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_summer_Sat8": "I wonder if the creatures in the caves have saloons they go to. Monster brew, wouldn't that have an interesting taste?#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_summer_Sun8": "I've been thinking on making this place more kid friendly. That way, Jas and Vincent could hang out and have something to do!$1#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_summer_Mon10": "Hello @! Good to see you! It makes me happy when you show up. Stay awhile, play some games, have a night!$1#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_summer_Tue10": "I hope you are taking care of yourself this summer, @! Heat is a dangerous thing. If you were to die, I don't know what I'd do!$3#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_summer_Wed10": "I've been thinking about a new item for the menu. How about, Potatoes au @? Or maybe, scrambled @?#$b#No? The look on your face says it all!$1#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_summer_Thu10": "Nothing can make the day go bad when you show up, @. I feel nothing but love for you! Let us drink to your health!$1#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_summer_Fri10": "What a day! I will reveal to you, @, that I am beat. I just want to relax, but yet, the fire in my heart keeps me going.$2#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_summer_Sat10": "@! You belong here, pull up a chair, play some games, and have a drink! Today is your day, @!$1#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_summer_Sun10": "I hope to live out many years in Pelican Town, especially with friends like you, @!$1#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_summer_Tue8_inlaw_Emily": "Clint would come in here for Emily. He loved her, you know! But now it's different. Now he can't look at her.$2#$b#A broken heart, how sad, @!$3#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_fall_1": "It's that wonderful time of year, @! Celebrations, nice weather, good brew! Good to have you here today.$1#$e#Happy fall! Now let's get to work and have a good time.",
"Gus_fall_Mon": "One of the previous owners of the Saloon told me the legend of the Pinky Lemon. It's a terrible thing.$2#$b#No one knows what it is for sure. Oversized rat? A mutant person? It scares me, @!$2#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_fall_Tue": "I think I've seen the Pinky Lemon before, late at night. I heard a noise and came out here to check it.$3#$b#I saw something move too fast, and then disappear. I couldn't sleep that night!$2#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_fall_Wed": "Every bar has its ghost stories, @. The Stardrop Saloon is so old, it has plenty of them.#$b#They say the man who built this place appears on certain fall nights, looking for his wife.#$b#Can you feel the chill in the air? I can!$1#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_fall_Thu": "When this bar was young, they said that the spirit of those in the graveyard would come have a drink together on a random night in fall.#$b#They called it 'Spirits and Spirits.' I've yet to serve any ghosts, though!$1#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_fall_Fri": "This Pinky Lemon, if it ever shows it's face again, I want to capture it. I want to see what it is!$3#$b#I wonder what it likes? Mayonnaise? Bread? Such a disgusting idea.$2#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_fall_Sat": "When I die, I don't want to haunt this place, @. Maybe return every now and then, but I want this place to stay full of joy!$3#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_fall_Sun": "This morning when I opened the doors, I saw a cup floating around! I couldn't believe it.#$b#I thought I may be hung-over still, but I swear it moved about!$3#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_fall_Mon2": "Let me ask you, @, how is your farm? Are you prospering? I hope so!$1#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_fall_Tue2": "I'm glad you haven't given up the farm, @. I've seen a lot of people come to Pelican Town, then leave.$3#$b#It's hard work, which is proud work, I say!#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_fall_Wed2": "Believe it or not, @, I've used some of the crops you've grown in the food I cook here.#$b#When I do, people say it's the best, so I must thank you!$1#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_fall_Thu2": "If you grew bad crops and didn't take care of them, it would affect me here. I buy local!#$b#Thank you for not being lazy, @! It means a lot to cooks like me.$1#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_fall_Fri2": "There was one person who came here with stars in their eyes, @. They thought they would get rich quick.$3#$b#After a couple of seasons, they came in here, dead in the face, and said goodbye.$2#$b#Don't be like them, @! Keep going!$3#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_fall_Sat2": "I knew your grandfather, @. A good man! The fact he gave you the farm shows he trusted you.#$b#Don't let down his memory! His ghost might haunt you forever.$3#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_fall_Sun2": "Hello, @! What will you be having tonight on this wonderful fall evening? It will be a good one tonight, I can feel it!#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_fall_Mon4": "I would love to hold a Pelican Town beer festival. Pelic-tober-fest! It would be a wonderful time.#$b#Drink, be merry, and eat good food. It makes me excited to think about.$1#$b#The Fair comes close, but this would be even larger!#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_fall_Tue4": "I spent a lot of time in my travels around the world at festivals. Experiencing other cultures, their beliefs, and food.#$b#Some I miss more than others, but it always excites me when we hold festivals here in town!$1#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_fall_Wed4": "When I cooked for thousands at a festival in a forest, during the middle of fall, it was then I knew I had what it takes.#$b#The hungry faces never stopped coming! My partner and I held them off for as long as we could.#$b#You learn things about yourself when faced with impossible odds, @!$3#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_fall_Thu4": "At one far away festival, they set up a giant dog made of nothing but sticks. They listen to music all day, and go crazy.#$b#At the end of the festival, once everyone has contributed their own sticks, they catch it on fire.#$b#This giant dog of hell, barking to a mass of dancing people, truly a sight to see.$1#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_fall_Fri4": "Just because there's food at a fair or a festival doesn't make it bad or trashy, @! You'd be surprised how often people say that.#$b#To master a fryer is an art in itself. Especially cooking for so many people, all day long, with no bathroom breaks!$1#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_fall_Sat4": "Saturday is here, which means it's time to party! Fall is a great time for that, which is why so many festivals are held during this time of year!$1#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_fall_Sun4": "I should start making pretzels. This time of year demands for salt and beer, don't you think?#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_fall_Mon6": "This time of year, I start thinking about the friends I've lost. The life of a cook is a rollercoaster!$3#$b#In order to get through the day, cooks are known to take 'enhancers,' but when they become addicted, it ruins everything.$2#$b#Too many friends, lost! It makes me sad, @.$2#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_fall_Tue6": "One of the most promising cooks I ever worked with got addicted to bad stuff. What started out small, became an everyday thing.$3#$b#He lost his job, his house, everything. He died in the streets! He was a better cook than I, and he died for nothing.$2#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_fall_Wed6": "As a young cook, you work all week for other people, then on the weekend you want to indulge in yourself.#$b#It's so easy to go overboard, @. To become lost in the haze of what feels like a good time. I don't miss it!$3#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_fall_Thu6": "During some parties as a young cook, nothing was off limits. Imagine that freedom! Without thinking about the choices you're making!#$b#I've done things I regret, @, but I'm glad I'm alive to feel the shame, unlike so many others.$3#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_fall_Fri6": "When I finally stopped chasing parties and focused more on my craft was when I woke up in a stranger's house.#$b#Dirty, nasty, run down, and with people everywhere. I left and resolved to never do it again. I haven't, @, so there is hope!$3#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_fall_Sat6": "People say spring is the time for changes, but you can change any day, any moment of the year. Mine took place in fall.#$b#If you have the courage to challenge what you think is right, you may find there's a better way.#$b#That's what makes all the difference, @. It can save your life!$1#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_fall_Sun6": "Do you want to know what happened to the person who made the Pelican Pale Ale?#$b#They went into investment banking. An odd twist, eh?$1#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_fall_Mon8": "Did you know that Demetrius used to have a drinking problem? I was stunned to find out.$2#$b#It makes me feel a little guilty as a bartender, to be honest.$3#$b#Especially when there's Pam I have to deal with...$3#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_fall_Tue8": "What happened to cause Jas and Shane to be orphaned? It is such a sad situation.$2#$b#Marnie is a great person for taking on the kids!#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_fall_Wed8": "Clint suffers from depression, did you know that, @? When I don't see him for a few days, I tend to go over and check on him.$3#$b#I'd hate for anything to happen to Clint! He's a nice guy.#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_fall_Thu8": "I had a great pleasure the other day, @. I went and shared some drinks with Willy, and we swapped stories of our youth.#$b#He was an actor, can you believe that? It's amazing to think about.$1#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_fall_Fri8": "I've been thinking about Kent lately. He's been through a lot. I wish there was a way I could help.$2#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_fall_Sat8": "Have you had luck making friends with people in Pelican Town, @? I've had a great time getting to know you!$1#$b#Learning more about people is an interesting feeling, but I love it!#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_fall_Sun8": "Here's a secret about me, @. You might not believe it possible, but I assure you it is true!#$b#I collect diamonds of all kinds! I keep them in a secret spot, but it's my hobby. I have them from around the world.$1#$b#I can't tell you how I got all of them, however. That would make a problem!$3#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_fall_Mon10": "The Legend of the Pinky Lemon, I will tell you now. Once there was a man in love. The woman he fancied demanded he wear a costume.#$b#In order to prove his love, it had to be the most hideous costume ever made. He put it all together, and showed her.#$b#But she was a witch, who turned him into the costume he wore! Transformed into a creature, he left the world, and somehow ended up in this bar!$2#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_fall_Tue10": "One time, during fall, I was cooking in a castle for a few weeks. During my days off, I drank too much.#$b#I became close friends with the Prince, I'll tell you that! We went on adventures through the catacombs, climbed the towers, it was madness.$1#$b#I don't remember much of it, but the pictures are scandalous!$1#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_fall_Wed10": "Castles, in fall, are cold. The stone doesn't keep heat very well, unless you're in the kitchens.#$b#It was an honor to cook where many famous cooks had done their craft, but I don't miss it!#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_fall_Thu10": "The Prince of the Castle and I shared escargot in the bed of the king and queen, can you believe that?$1#$b#I will never forget him! He was a beautiful sort, but he died young. Such a shame.$3#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_fall_Fri10": "@! I was afraid I wasn't going to see you today. Let me tell you this: you are amazing!$1#$b#I may have been drinking some today, but that doesn't mean I'm lying! You are great!$1#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_fall_Sat10": "It will be a sad day when we see each other for the last time. Neither of us will know it when it happens until years later.$3#$b#Now, I treat every time like the last, and it's always a party! Cheers to you, @!$1#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_fall_Sun10": "Fall is the time for friends and family. I don't have any family here, @, but I consider you a part of my life!#$b#Thank you for this year, @. It has been wonderful.$1#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_fall_Mon6_inlaw_Emily": "I hear that you're a great person to be married to, @! Emily gushes about how wonderful you are.$1#$b#This makes me very happy! If anyone made her sad, I would deal with them!$3#$e#Have a great rest of your day, @!",
"Gus_winter_1": "The time of year when ice is everywhere, and the warmth comes from within! Crank up the fire, it's winter! Let's have a good one this year, @.$1#$e#This will be a great winter, I'm sure of it! Have a good one, @!",
"Gus_winter_Mon": "I make it my mission to have the fireplace being the warmest in town all season. At any time, you can come and relax here!$1#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_winter_Tue": "It's a good thing there's so much wood for the fire, or else people might get cold. Not on my watch!#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_winter_Wed": "I welcome all kinds to this saloon. The cold, the hungry, the lonely and sad. I want no one to be left out during winter.#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_winter_Thu": "I can't even feel the cold when I'm working at the pizza oven. I just feel the warmth of the season, with all of my love.$1#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_winter_Fri": "Hungry, @? It must be hard on you, working in the cold. Have some food, enjoy the fire, relax! It's good to have you.#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_winter_Sat": "The crackle of the fireplace is hypnotic. Before anyone comes in, I have to make sure I don't drift off to sleep!#$b#Can you hear it, @? The siren of fire calls us!$1#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_winter_Sun": "Today's special pizza is one I cut in the shape of a snowflake. Also, I have one shaped like a dog.#$b#I was trying to make one shaped like a snowman, but it didn't turn out right.$3#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_winter_Mon2": "Have you come in contact with a Stardrop yet? They are so rare, not many people have seen them.#$b#A couple are left in this valley, this I know from what I've overheard.#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_winter_Tue2": "Only those who earn the right can taste the true flavor of a Stardrop. If you give it to someone, it tastes like...$3#$b#Whatever you think the worst taste ever is, it's worse than that, times ten! Do not eat unearned fruit!$3#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_winter_Wed2": "One of the previous owners told me the reason it's called the Stardrop Saloon.#$b#One of the last Stardrop trees were cut down and its wood was used in building this place.#$b#They say the Stardrop increases vitality, and since this place has survived so long, it shows!#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_winter_Thu2": "It's a shame that I can't use the Stardrop for cooking. I wonder what kind of unique tastes could be made with it?$3#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_winter_Fri2": "With winter, the snow gets me excited to make food of the season. Got ideas for this year, @?#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_winter_Sat2": "I've made coffee for kings and queens, @. I've perfected it. Yet, no matter how hard I try, I'm terrible at making hot cocoa.#$b#Too much milk, too little chocolate, I can't get it right. What kind of cook am I?$2#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_winter_22": "I'm going to be up late this week, getting things ready for the Feast of the Winter Star.#$b#A great festival! My favorite of all the festivals we have here in town. Maybe I'll get you something, @!$1#$e#Have a nice night, @!",
"Gus_winter_Sun2": "I'm so sleepy today, @! It won't affect my work, but I'm fighting the snow fairy of sleep with a full hand, and losing!$2#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_winter_Mon4": "I once volunteered to make pies for the homeless one winter.#$b#I remember having to cook so many pies, the smell burned my tongue! Imagine that!$1#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_winter_Tue4": "I'm not a fan of ice sculptures. So much work put into something so fleeting.$3#$b#All to make the punch bowl pretty? It's not worth it. A waste!#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_winter_Wed4": "When it's frozen out, and it starts to rain, it's like drinking from the cup of madness.$3#$b#You wonder what you could have done wrong to be put in that situation.$2#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_winter_Thu4": "The fire burns today like my passion for cooking, my love of people, and my desire to be the best bartender!$1#$b#Feel the warmth! Spread good feelings to all, @!#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_winter_Fri4": "I appreciate seasonal foods as a cook. Without them, people would want the same thing, all year long.#$b#You can only make pizza so many times in a year before going crazy. Bring on the mashed potatoes!$1#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_winter_Sat4": "I once knocked over an ice sculpture at a fancy party during my youth. I was serving snacks, and was transfixed on the most beautiful people I'd ever seen.#$b#I backed into it, and it would have been quiet if not for the silverware that dropped as well. It crashed!$2#$b#Very embarrassing, and I was never invited back.$3#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_winter_Sun4": "Cold, hot, it's what the world makes us, @. But if we can stay true to the fire within, we will never shiver!#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_winter_Mon6": "I found this interesting newspaper clip in an old book recently. It talked about this Saloon!#$b#It was called the 'Great Winter Gunfight at Stardrop Saloon.' Crazy, eh?#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_winter_Tue6": "During the gunfight that took place here so long ago, a man believed his wife was cheating on him.#$b#He confronted the man, who swore he wasn't. They got into a fight!$3#$b#The man was convinced, and he drew his gun, as did everyone else. Imagine seeing that, in this humble place!#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_winter_Wed6": "At the 'Great Winter Gunfight at Stardrop Saloon,' two were dead by the end of it.#$b#Turns out the man's wife wasn't cheating on him after all, but he was cheating on her. It always comes out in the wash.$3#$b#Such a waste of life, for someone trying to dodge the blame.$2#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_winter_Thu6": "Craziest thing that's ever happened in this Saloon that I've been around for was the lost blue dog named Sam.#$b#One day, I came in and saw this blue dog just sitting down, hungry and sad. His name was Sam.$2#$b#I took him in and fed him up. He was a good dog!$1#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_winter_Fri6": "When that blue dog named Sam was here, he was a helpful watchdog and earned his keep, that's for sure!#$b#Eventually his owner came in, sick with worry at the fact she thought she lost him.#$b#She was happy, but we were sad to lose Sam! That was a long time ago.$2#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_winter_Sat6": "Winter is a good time to reflect on the choices you've made, and wonder about going in a new direction next year.#$b#I'll tell you this, @, I'm doing pretty good right now!$1#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_winter_Sun6": "As a kid, I was a trickster. Always starting snowball fights.#$b#I crave that feeling again, @! Let's get one together. We'll have a few drinks first!$1#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_winter_Mon8": "My father was the cook of the family, @. He made the most wonderful food. I'm still trying to recreate some of his recipes.#$b#He would cook, and I would taste and smell. It was wonderful!$1#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_winter_Tue8": "My mother was a dancer, and my father would always cook these big meals and surprise her when she got home.#$b#They would dance together to the sound of music and the smell of potatoes. It was beautiful.$1#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_winter_Wed8": "I remember when I told my father I was going to be a cook. He wouldn't have it!#$b#'Get rich as a doctor or banker, and take care of me and your mother!'$3#$b#Instead, I followed my dream, and he was very proud of me all the same.#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_winter_Thu8": "I found dancing boring for the longest time, but my mother would give me lessons. I learned to express myself through cooking and dance.#$b#Those two things are the best at impressing people, I tell you that, @!$1#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_winter_Fri8": "It was so long ago I started cooking and dancing. I've never stopped, you know.#$b#My parents are long asleep, but their passion lives on in me! They will never truly die.$1#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_winter_Sat8": "I should make a dance happen here at the Saloon. It'd be a party! Cook some of my parents' recipes, dance to the music on the jukebox...#$b#I'll think about putting it together!$1#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_winter_Sun8": "Good to see you, @! I hope you're having a great winter. Stay here, get warm, and eat something!$1#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",
"Gus_winter_Mon10": "What a year we've had, @. Getting to know you has been the best surprise of my life!$1#$e#See you around, @! The door is always open for you!",
"Gus_winter_Tue10": "I wonder what new characters we'll meet in the new year, @? It's been quite the year already.#$e#See you soon, @! Keep doing wonderfully!",
"Gus_winter_Wed10": "I had a lot of fun this year, but I hope for even more excitement next year.#$b#It keeps it interesting, and I'm always looking forward to getting up in the morning.#$e#Anyway, halfway to the weekend. Have a good one!",
"Gus_winter_Thu10": "Today is the kind of day for a long winter's nap. Just sleep, be warm, and think of positive things.#$e#Have a wonderful night tonight, @!",
"Gus_winter_Fri10": "Here's the truth, I wouldn't trade any of my adventures for anything. It's made me who I am!#$b#All those winters freezing in kitchens, all those times dancing with lovers, they are precious to me!$1#$e#It's the weekend! Have a good one.",
"Gus_winter_Sat10": "I'll let you in on this, @. I'm glad we can get together like this.$b#I may be a bartender, but I am also your friend! It is a great pleasure to be so.$1#$e#See you again, @! I look forward to it.",
"Gus_winter_Sun10": "To many more years together, and many happy memories, @! Let's make forever a party!$1#$e#Get some good rest, @! The week starts again tomorrow.",



//Linus (working)
"Linus_Introduction": "Greetings. You new in town?#$e#I haven't seen you around.#$e#If you want to know more about this land, feel free to ask me.$2#$e#I know a lot about it.$1",
"Linus_spring_Mon": "Breathe in the harmony, feel the way the world speaks to us.#$b#What does it say to you, @?$1#$e#Now time to meditate.",
"Linus_spring_Tue": "The bugs are plentiful in spring. It's nice to see such life.#$b#Be like the bugs, and be free!$1#$e#I feel one with everything. Not a bad feeling if you ask me.",
"Linus_spring_Wed": "What a day!#$b#I woke up. I wandered. I wondered. Such is my life.$1#$b#To be humble is to know such peace.#$e#...might go take a nap now.$1",
"Linus_spring_Thu": "People are quick to judge. It is a shame!#$b#It's hard to change that perception once it's taken root.#$b#How do you view me?$1#$e#Find joy in the small things, farmer.",
"Linus_spring_Fri": "I've been around all over in my travels.#$b#I've seen many different lives pass me by.#$b#It's an amazing thing.$1#$e#Enjoy today!",
"Linus_spring_Sat": "Can you feel it? The spirit of spring. It calls to us.#$b#Embrace her song, @.#$e#Laugh more, farmer, because why not?",
"Linus_spring_Sun": "How'd I get like this? I chose this life.#$b#My previous life was full of stress. Not worth it, so I took another path.$2#$e#See you soon, farmer. Have a great day today.",
"Linus_spring_Mon2": "You're kind. I can feel it.#$b#Full of curiosity.#$b#It's a refreshing thing to see around here!$1#$e#See you soon, farmer. Have a great day today.",
"Linus_spring_Tue2": "To stay happy, you must learn to want the right things.#$b#For me, it's every sunrise. For to see a sunrise means I am still alive.#$b#And that is a wonderful thing.$1#$e#Now time to meditate.",
"Linus_spring_Wed2": "Today I went for a walk through the valley.#$b#A bird came and kept me company!$3#$b#Then, he flew again. A beauty to behold.#$e#I feel one with everything. Not a bad feeling if you ask me.",
"Linus_spring_Thu2": "Money is fleeting, but joy is eternal.#$b#Yet sometimes money can solve some very tough problems.#$b#It's all about balance.#$b#That's how I look at it.$1#$e#...might go take a nap now.",
"Linus_spring_Fri2": "Spring nights are still a bit cold. Trying to find ways to stay warm can be difficult.#$b#Yet the mornings are so wonderful.$1#$e#Find joy in the small things, farmer.",
"Linus_spring_Sat2": "Some people let their past experiences run them so much, they are never the same.#$b#It's important to move past such circumstances and stand tall.#$b#I've learned that from experience.$1#$e#Enjoy today!",
"Linus_spring_Sun2": "Hear that? No? Maybe it's nothing.#$b#Then again, maybe it's everything. How are we to know?$1#$e#Laugh more, farmer, because why not?",
"Linus_spring_Mon4": "Spring is my favorite season. It's full of hope.$1#$b#Every new bud is a new life, waiting to find itself.#$e#See you soon, farmer. Have a great day today.",
"Linus_spring_Tue4": "I eat off the land when I can.#$b#I have to be careful, as some plants can be poison.$3#$b#...I've had close calls before.$1#$e#Now time to meditate.",
"Linus_spring_Wed4": "I've learned to communicate with animals.#$b#I sit and talk to them, trying to understand them#$b#It takes patience, but it's well worth it.$1#$e#I feel one with everything. Not a bad feeling if you ask me.",
"Linus_spring_Thu4": "I know that all of life is a series of cycles.#$b#Spring is the start of a new cycle for many things.#$b#It's wonderous to see.$1#$e#...might go take a nap now.",
"Linus_spring_Fri4": "I call to birds, and listen to their songs. I speak to mice, and they bring me cheese...#$b#I ask the ants, and they whisper secrets. That was just this morning.#$b#A magical life, indeed.$1#$e#Find joy in the small things, farmer.",
"Linus_spring_Sat4": "We're friends. I'll tell you a secret...#$b#I'm raising a family of mice in my beard.$1#$e#Enjoy today!",
"Linus_spring_Sun4": "I once found nature's bounty. Honey, berries, and a glass of milk.$1#$b#I enjoyed them, until a bear came. It wasn't happy.#$b#I shared my bounty with the bear, and now we're good friends.$1#$e#Laugh more, farmer, because why not?",
"Linus_spring_Mon6": "Hello, @! I'm glad to see you today.#$b#Despite this peaceful life, it can get lonely from time to time.$1#$b#But with people like you around, and the animals, I feel so accepted.#$e#See you soon, farmer. Have a great day today.",
"Linus_spring_Tue6": "I used to have a dog. A good dog, silver in color.#$b#Got me through some difficult times, I'll tell you that!$3#$b#Then, like all things, we parted ways along the journey.$2#$e#Such is the way it goes.$1#$e#...$2",
"Linus_spring_Wed6": "My dog was really a jumper. If he met you, he'd jump up and try to lick your face.$1#$b#He was a good boy.$1#$e#I feel one with everything. Not a bad feeling if you ask me.",
"Linus_spring_Thu6": "Never take animals for granted, of any shape or size.#$b#They deserve the same respect as anyone else!$1#$b#...might go take a nap now.",
"Linus_spring_Fri6": "Been thinking about past friends. Animals long gone.$2#$b#To some they might just be creatures of the earth, but to me, they were more than that.$2#$b#I'm sure you feel the same way about your animals.$1#$b#Find joy in the small things, farmer.",
"Linus_spring_Sat6": "I saw a cat the other day I hadn't seen before.#$b#It sat on a fence and looked at me like it knew me.#$b#I wonder...#$b#I hope I'll see it again.$1#$b#Enjoy today!",
"Linus_spring_Sun6": "A nice day we're having, isn't it?$1#$b#I hope you are doing well with all your work!$1#$e#Laugh more, farmer, because why not?",
"Linus_spring_Mon8": "I've been very introspective lately. Looking back on my life and many adventures.#$b#It can be hard to find happiness sometimes. It's all about attitude...$1#$b#It took me a long time to realize that.#$b#See you soon, farmer. Have a great day today.",
"Linus_spring_Tue8": "#I wonder if I would have been happier if I did things differently...or worse off?$1#$b#It's hard to know...maybe it's bad to wonder?#$b#Now time to meditate.",
"Linus_spring_Wed8": "Feel that breeze, take in the sun.#$b#Today, my spirit soars. What a day to be alive.$3#$b#I feel one with everything. Not a bad feeling if you ask me.",
"Linus_spring_Thu8": "Opportunity comes, and it doesn't wait!$3#$b#If you do not take the offering, it will go on.#$b#Know when to grasp it with your whole heart!#$b#...might go take a nap now.",
"Linus_spring_Fri8": "I once saw a rich man leave his office building.#$b#He went into a nearby alley, and didn't see me.#$b#He was crying.$2#$b#He got a phone call, then wiped his face.#$b#I wonder what became of that man?#$b#Find joy in the small things, farmer.",
"Linus_spring_Sat8": "With so much in the world, good and bad, one must find a sense of peace.$2#$b#To achieve it means to come to the end of a long journey, and the start of a great life.#$b#Enjoy today!",
"Linus_spring_Sun8": "People often wonder how I can be so happy, despite being so poor.#$b#I say to them, I feel very rich!#$b#I can enjoy today, and smell the air, free of worry.$1#$b#Laugh more, farmer, because why not?",
"Linus_spring_Mon10": "Some people will never accept my lifestyle, and I'm okay with that.#$b#I don't need their pity, but they do have mine!$1#$b#Life is what you make of it.#$b#You keep going, no matter what.#$e#See you, farmer.",
"Linus_spring_Tue10": "Farmer, good to see you. Grow anything tasty?$1#$b#I'm not asking because I'm hungry.#$b#I mean, I am hungry, but I am curious.$3#$b#Is this awkward?$1#$b#Grow tasty veggies.$3#$e#...$1",
"Linus_spring_Wed10": "Today, I am full and in high spirits.#$b#I know things will work out.#$b#Isn't that wonderful?$1#$e#Bye, Farmer.",
"Linus_spring_Thu10": "...$1#$b#...$1#$b#...#$b#Oh!$3#$b#Hello, Farmer. I nodded off there for a bit.#$e#...$1",
"Linus_spring_Fri10": "I sum it up like this. It's only hunger pain if you let it hurt you.#$b#Otherwise, it's just my stomach singing.#$b#Get it?...$1#$b#Did I get too real?$2#$e#Sorry, Farmer.",
"Linus_spring_Sat10": "I'm glad we continue to meet, @.#$b#When I see you coming, I am filled with such happiness.#$b#You listen to me, and I appreciate it.#$e#Thank you.$1",
"Linus_spring_Sun10": "I hope I can give you a gift as great as what you have given me.#$b#True friendship.$1#$b#Maybe I'll throw you a party.#$b#Invite the whole forest.$1#$e#It will be a night to remember.$1",
"Linus_summer_Mon": "Feel that heat!#$b#Is it the sun, or my passion of life itself?#$b#It's summer, after all.#$e#See you soon, farmer. Have a great day today.",
"Linus_summer_Tue": "I'm a bit smelly today. Don't mind it one bit.#$b#It makes my dive into the river all the more satisfying!$1#$e#Now time to meditate.",
"Linus_summer_Wed": "The stream is cold and wonderful.#$b#As is the ocean.#$b#Dive in with your happy heart!$1#$e#I feel one with everything. Not a bad feeling if you ask me.",
"Linus_summer_Thu": "I wake up earlier in the summer to try and beat the heat.#$b#The best way is to wrestle the sun itself.$1#$e#...might go take a nap now.",
"Linus_summer_Fri": "It's so humid today, I bet I could through the air itself.#$b#Imagine seeing that!$3#$e#Find joy in the small things, farmer.",
"Linus_summer_Sat": "I've been enjoying the foods of the wilds during summer.#$b#You can get a lot of water that way.#$e#Enjoy today!",
"Linus_summer_Sun": "Someone thought I was a bear last night...#$b#What a wonderful compliment for an old man like me.$1#$b#Ferocious, powerful...#$b#...handsome?$1#$e#Laugh more, farmer, because why not?",
"Linus_summer_Mon2": "Sometimes people have on drink too many and come vandalize my tent.#$b#It takes a lot to fix it, but I'm just glad they don't attack me.#$e#See you soon, farmer. Have a great day today.",
"Linus_summer_Tue2": "I've met many farmers in my day, most were kind enough to give me some food for my journey.#$b#It's a rough life, but honest work.#$b#Thanks, Farmer.#$e#Now time to meditate.",
"Linus_summer_Wed2": "You aren't just buttering me up so you can take my tent, are you, Farmer?#$b#I'm kidding!$1#$b#If you ever want a tour of it, just let me know.#$e#I feel one with everything. Not a bad feeling if you ask me.",
"Linus_summer_Thu2": "It's dangerous to get hurt when you live in the wilderness as I do.#$b#I've learned many healing techniques from doctors, healers, and witches.#$b#You won't believe what a good toad can do for you.$3#$b#Right, Farmer?$1#$e#...might go take a nap now.",
"Linus_summer_Fri2": "Today is a day to focus on good thoughts to beat the heat.#$b#I am the ice cube.#$e#Find joy in the small things, farmer.",
"Linus_summer_Sat2": "Smell that? It's me.#$b#I rubbed a nice plant all over my body.$1#$b#Now, I'm quite itchy...$2#$b#Should have thought that one through.$1#$e#Enjoy today!",
"Linus_summer_Sun2": "@! You've come around again.$1#$b#Have you seen my tent? Do you like it?$3#$b#Don't take my tent.$1#$e#Laugh more, farmer, because why not?",
"Linus_summer_Mon4": "Summer can be very difficult, depending on where you live.#$b#Luckily I have a stream to swim in, and an ocean to surf on.$1#$b#I consider myself lucky.#$e#See you soon, farmer. Have a great day today.",
"Linus_summer_Tue4": "I've been trying to catch fish in the river with my bare hands.#$b#Some people were scared, they thought I was a bear.$1#$b#I may have been roaring a bit...#$e#Now time to meditate.",
"Linus_summer_Wed4": "In my previous life, they had given me a nickname.#$b#Thing is, I don't remember what it was.$3#$b#Must not have been a very good nickname.#$e#I feel one with everything. Not a bad feeling if you ask me.",
"Linus_summer_Thu4": "Respect the wilderness, respect the outdoors, and you will be safer than those that don't.#$b#Believe it or not, I've found the remains of some who were a bit too reckless...$2#$e#...might go take a nap now.",
"Linus_summer_Fri4": "People like to party in summer. Drink. Get lost in the woods.#$b#Sometimes it can scary, only because they are so loud!$3#$e#Find joy in the small things, farmer.",
"Linus_summer_Sat4": "I think I will find some shade to sleep in today.#$b#Listen to the sounds of the valley.#$b#Such joy.$1#$e#Enjoy today!",
"Linus_summer_Sun4": "Next time I go into the river, I'll catch every fish I see.#$b#Then I will turn into a fish, and swim out into the ocean!#3#$b#I'll wave at you if I see you, @.$1#$e#Laugh more, farmer, because why not?",
"Linus_summer_Mon6": "Last night I had a nightmare.#$b#I had a large house, with a large yard, and gates.$3#$b#I had a pool, a kitchen, and a large bed.#$b#I was sobbing! So unhappy!$3#$e#See you soon, farmer. Have a great day today.",
"Linus_summer_Tue6": "Another dream last night. This time I was a rock, sitting on a mountainside.#$b#The days passed, yet I remained. Soon, people came and built a city around me.$3#$b#Then I was but a sidewalk.#$b#I wonder if it's true?#$e#Now time to meditate.",
"Linus_summer_Wed6": "The older I get, the more I forget things.#$b#The birds are always happy to remind me, though, so that's nice.#$b#However, sometimes there are things I don't want to remember.$2#$e#I feel one with everything. Not a bad feeling if you ask me.",
"Linus_summer_Thu6": "My dreams are filled with what feels like memories. Times when I was a child...#$b#A suburb, maybe? People gathering. Drinking. Celebrating.#$b#It's all so fuzzy...#$e#...might go take a nap now.",
"Linus_summer_Fri6": "I've seen a town. Far, far away.#$b#It calls to me.#$b#I see myself as a young child...$3#$b#I want to go back there.#$b#Maybe I will someday.$1#$e#Find joy in the small things, farmer.",
"Linus_summer_Sat6": "Rich, poor. Old, young. Did you enjoy life?#$b#Those who have everything are often miserable. Those with little, happy.#$b#Myself, I'm happy to be here in the now, talking with you, @!$1#$e#Enjoy today!",
"Linus_summer_Sun6": "Summer nights. Young love, lost. I see it from time to time.$2#$b#If I see a young couple out here, I try not to disturb them.#$b#Though usually end up disturbing me...#$e#Laugh more, farmer, because why not?",
"Linus_summer_Mon8": "I've been blamed for the problems of others. Perhaps because I am one with the outdoors, people attack me.#$b#Not much I can do to help them, which almost makes them angrier.#$b#At least I have my own heart to smile about.$1#$e#See you soon, farmer. Have a great day today.",
"Linus_summer_Tue8": "There were times I was worried you might not like me, @.#$b#I'd see you go by, and wonder if I scared you...#$b#I'm glad to know that's not the case.$1#$e#Now time to meditate.",
"Linus_summer_Wed8": "Treat people the way you want to be treated. You'll never actually get treated that way...#$b#But, by being kind, you'll be remembered.#$b#And what can be better than that?$1#$e#I feel one with everything. Not a bad feeling if you ask me.",
"Linus_summer_Thu8": "Once I found a young woman crying in the forest.#$b#She had been dumped by her boyfriend of seven years, and didn't know where to go.$2#$b#I let her cry on my shoulder. Sometimes that is what someone really needs.#$b#I hope she is doing well now.$1#$e#...might go take a nap now.",
"Linus_summer_Fri8": "Gus came by and offered me some drink.#$b#We swapped stories. He's quite the character.$1#$b#Got a bit of a headache, though...$2#$e#Find joy in the small things, farmer.",
"Linus_summer_Sat8": "The only wish I have is that others can find peace.#$b#Some get close, but only glance it, and it breaks my heart.$2#$b#I hope you have found some peace talking with me, @.$1#$e#Enjoy today!",
"Linus_summer_Sun8": "Some people tried to mess with my tent last night...$2#$b#I scared them off by roaring like a bear.$1#$b#It actually worked.$3#$e#Laugh more, farmer, because why not?",
"Linus_summer_Mon10": "I will tell you a story.#$b#Once there was a farmer who came to town, knowing nobody.#$b#They met a strange old man, and became friends with him.#$b#...$1#$b#The end!$3#$e#...the old man was happy the rest of his days.$1",
"Linus_summer_Tue10": "I won't be around forever. I am happy I could spend my time the way I wanted to.#$b#Such is a cherished gift not everyone gets to have.#$b#I hope you get to do such a thing, @!$3#$e#Because you deserve it.$1",
"Linus_summer_Wed10": "I'd like to have a proper cabin someday.#$b#I'd have beautiful views, and a patio for my animal friends.#$b#...$2#$b#You can come too, of course!$3#$e#It would be wonderful.$1",
"Linus_summer_Thu10": "Summer nights. What a feeling.#$b#I hope your summer has been eventful.#$b#Mine has been better for having known you!$1#$e#Bye for now, Farmer @.",
"Linus_summer_Fri10": "I smell so bad today, it's making me laugh.#$b#Hahahahahaha.$1#$b#Time to dive first into that water.#$e#Join me sometime, @!",
"Linus_summer_Sat10": "At night I hear the crickets. I smell the bonfires. I hear the wind in the trees.#$b#There is beauty in it.#$e#It's a beauty I hope you can embrace, @!",
"Linus_summer_Sun10": "Sometime soon, things will change. I'm not sure how, or when, but they will.$3#$b#It's changed for me, it'll change for you. For  the better.#$b#It will be wonderful.$1",
"Linus_fall_Mon": "Fall is a unique time.$1#$b#All these trees creating beds of leaves for me to sleep in.#$b#A unique comfort.$1#$e#See you soon, farmer. Have a great day today.",
"Linus_fall_Tue": "I like some mushrooms, but really hate the red ones.#$b#I ate one of the red mushrooms once...#$b#Instead of growing bigger, I just got sick.$2#$e#Now time to meditate.",
"Linus_fall_Wed": "I've been trapped in a pile of leaves before.$3#$b#I was covered when I was sleeping, and woke up to people surrounding me, not knowing I'm there.#$b#I didn't want to scare them, so I waited till they went away.$1#$e#I feel one with everything. Not a bad feeling if you ask me.",
"Linus_fall_Thu": "The slumber song of the trees fills the air today.#$b#A mournful melody, for sure.#$b#Yet also, filled with hope.#$e#...might go take a nap now.",
"Linus_fall_Fri": "It's the time of the harvest, which makes me really hungry!$3#$b#It's time to eat some good bounty.#$e#Find joy in the small things, farmer.",
"Linus_fall_Sat": "So cold at night now. Last night was a bit rough.#$b#I better go get the forest animals to surround me for warmth.$1#$e#Enjoy today!",
"Linus_fall_Sun": "Avoid the forest mushrooms.#$b#At least, unless you know which are good.#$b#There are some I like.#$b#Share them if you find them, would you?$3#$e#Laugh more, farmer, because why not?",
"Linus_fall_Mon2": "Fall is the time for spirits, @! Ghosts, in particular.#$b#I've seen them. Shimmering for a moment, late at night when the town has gone to bed.#$b#Who were they, I wonder? They don't talk to me.#$e#See you soon, farmer. Have a great day today.",
"Linus_fall_Tue2": "If you were a ghost, I'd be fine with that. I wouldn't try to run.#$b#I might get a little scared, though.#$b#...you're not a ghost now, are you?$3#$e#Now time to meditate.",
"Linus_fall_Wed2": "I've tried to talk with the spirits I've seen. At least, I think I do.#$b#It can get pretty creepy at night sometimes.#$b#Do you believe me?$3#$e#I feel one with everything. Not a bad feeling if you ask me.",
"Linus_fall_Thu2": "During this time of year people mistake me for some sort of monster.#$b#I can't blame them, though I don't mean to scare anyone.#$e#...might go take a nap now.",
"Linus_fall_Fri2": "If I become a ghost, I wouldn't haunt this area. I'd travel, see the world as best I can.#$b#Maybe get a ghost house to live in.#$b#I don't want to be undead and homeless.$3#$e#Find joy in the small things, farmer.",
"Linus_fall_Sat2": "I used to like scary stories when I was a kid.#$b#Monsters, heroes, that sort of thing.#$b#Now, it's different. I try to stay positive. Focus on things that are good.#$b#Life can get dark too quickly...$1#$e#Enjoy today!",
"Linus_fall_Sun2": "Last night, when I was asleep...$3#$b#I heard something. I'm not sure what it was...$3#$b#But, when I leaned outside my tent...#$b#It was nothing at all...$1#$e#Laugh more, farmer, because why not?",
"Linus_fall_Mon4": "Been thinking about what I love most. Yams, for one thing.#$b#A well prepared yam is something everyone should have at least once in their life.#$b#I used to cook them often.$1#$e#See you soon, farmer. Have a great day today.",
"Linus_fall_Tue4": "I love coconuts. There are so many uses for them.#$b#They are hard to get, but when I do find one, it's always special.#$b#However, never open a rotted one.#$b#...trust me.$2#$e#Now time to meditate.",
"Linus_fall_Wed4": "Blueberry tarts, coconuts, and yams.#$b#My dream meal would be all of them, as many as I could eat.#$b#That would be something.$1#$e#I feel one with everything. Not a bad feeling if you ask me.",
"Linus_fall_Thu4": "I dreamt I was on an island, far away, covered in yams and coconuts.#$b#The everything was perfect.#$b#Maybe I'll make that dream a reality!$1#$e#...might go take a nap now.",
"Linus_fall_Fri4": "Been searching for yams lately. Can't get enough of them.#$b#Finding a good yam that I can roast is an amazing feeling.#$b#Pure happiness for me.$1#$e#Find joy in the small things, farmer.",
"Linus_fall_Sat4": "There's nothing wrong with wishing for better things.#$b#But it can be a dangerous fantasy. Look too long and you can be swallowed up.#$b#It's scary sometimes...#$e#Enjoy today!",
"Linus_fall_Sun4": "Cherish the things you love, for they are your own. It makes you unique.#$b#That is a wonderful thing.$1#$e#Laugh more, farmer, because why not?",
"Linus_fall_Mon6": "Fall reminds me...of someone I once loved.#$b#Me? In love?$3#$b#It was a very long time ago...#$e#See you soon, farmer. Have a great day today.",
"Linus_fall_Tue6": "At night, in my dreams, the image of someone I used to love, who loved me, haunts me.$2#$b#What's strange is, I don't remember their name...#$b#I wish you could help me, Farmer...#$e#Now time to meditate.",
"Linus_fall_Wed6": "It's strange. This feeling of a lost love is...#$b#I feel like it's calling to me.$2#$b#I don't know what to do...#$e#I feel one with everything. Not a bad feeling if you ask me.",
"Linus_fall_Thu6": "My lost love...is someone who cared deeply for me.#$b#When they left, they created a vacuum in my heart.#$e#...might go take a nap now.",
"Linus_fall_Fri6": "Love is delicate. It must be treated with respect.#$b#It can break so easily...$2#$b#Feelings persist...even through different lives.$2#$e#Find joy in the small things, farmer.",
"Linus_fall_Sat6": "All week I've been remembering things about my lost love.#$b#The feeling is like that of a nice dream.$1#$e#Enjoy today!",
"Linus_fall_Sun6": "I remembered something! My lost love said something to me, I think it was the last thing they said...$3#$b#It was...'free'...#$e#Laugh more, farmer, because why not?",
"Linus_fall_Mon8": "Winter is coming, and I must prepare to fight whatever awaits.#$b#Wolves...or something worse.#$b#Every year, there's at least one or two that try to take me on.$3#$e#See you soon, farmer. Have a great day today.",
"Linus_fall_Tue8": "I have a feeling this winter is going to be difficult.#$b#Then again, you'll be around, won't you, Farmer?#$b#Maybe I have nothing to fear after all.$1#$e#Now time to meditate.",
"Linus_fall_Wed8": "I shouldn't tell you this, but I've actually befriended my fair share of 'monsters.'#$b#They don't take me for a human.$1#$e#I feel one with everything. Not a bad feeling if you ask me.",
"Linus_fall_Thu8": "The 'monsters' I've met don't like to talk about much. They enjoy sitting, and watching the scenery.#$b#I think they can understand me...it's mostly grunts.$1#$b#It's nice to be wanted.$1#$e#...might go take a nap now.",
"Linus_fall_Fri8": "I once had to scare off a wolf from a family of baby slimes. They were defenseless, so I did what I had to do.#$b#Their mother returned the next day, but for a night, we were a family.$1#$e#Find joy in the small things, farmer.",
"Linus_fall_Sat8": "There's a strange monster I see sometimes, either in the early morning or late at night.#$b#A being of pure shadow.$3#$b#It waves at me. I wave back. I think we're friends.$1#$e#Enjoy today!",
"Linus_fall_Sun8": "Maybe I should try to befriend more monsters...$2#$b#Maybe then I could have my own army of them!$3#$b#Did I say 'army?' I meant family.#$b#...what?$3#$e#Laugh more, farmer, because why not?",
"Linus_fall_Mon10": "I'm very happy to call you friend, Farmer.#$b#I never thought it would happen, but it has, and I am thankful.$1#$b#It keeps me warm at night.#$e#Did I get too sappy? It's true! Stay good, @.$3",
"Linus_fall_Tue10": "If I had to be honest with my feelings today, it would be that I am content. With you as a friend, I feel...#$b#I feel I could do anything.$3#$b#But what to do? That's the question...#$e#So many choices. Bye, Farmer.",
"Linus_fall_Wed10": "My goal...is to continue to find peace.#$b#I hope that I can achieve true peace, and then help others.#$b#It's a long journey, but I'm glad to take it.#$e#You'll be the first I tell! Bye, @.",
"Linus_fall_Thu10": "The leaves are falling, yet I am happy. I am confident that winter will be tolerable.#$b#I'll melt the snow with my passion and our friendship, @!#$e#Hopefully it doesn't burn too hot.$3",
"Linus_fall_Fri10": "Everyone goes through a tough time, don't they?#$b#That doesn't mean it will last forever, though, or they are stuck.#$b#There is always hope. I stand among these trees and say to you, have hope!#$e#Embrace the good things.$1",
"Linus_fall_Sat10": "The colors of the trees continue to change.#$b#Yet here I remain.#$b#For spring will come and all will renew.$3#$b#This is my hope, from me to you.#$e#Poetry, maybe? It's from the heart.$1",
"Linus_fall_Sun10": "So wonderful, this year of all years. We have much to celebrate.$1#$b#I hope your harvest has been one to remember, @!#$e#I might have to stop by one of these days.",
"Linus_winter_Mon": "...it's too cold.#$b#I've felt cold before, but...this is new.$2#$b#I don't like it...$2#$e#See you soon, farmer. Have a great day today.",
"Linus_winter_Tue": "Imagine if one could survive on a diet of ice...#$b#It wouldn't look like winter anymore.$3#$e#Now time to meditate.",
"Linus_winter_Wed": "The bears have gone into hibernation, and have claimed all the good caves...#$b#Next year, maybe I'll do as the bears do, and just sleep till spring.$1#$e#I feel one with everything. Not a bad feeling if you ask me.",
"Linus_winter_Thu": "At night, when the snow falls, it's nice and quiet.#$b#A wolf howls in the distance.#$e#...might go take a nap now.",
"Linus_winter_Fri": "In truth, I find snowpeople to be good company.#$b#Carrot nose, coal eyes, the works.#$b#They get me.#$e#Find joy in the small things, farmer.",
"Linus_winter_Sat": "It's a bit warmer today.#$b#...maybe it'll be warmer tomorrow.#$e#Enjoy today!",
"Linus_winter_Sun": "Saw a fish in the river and went to catch it.#$b#My hands hit the ice, hard.$3#$b#I now see why bears sleep like they do...$2#$e#Laugh more, farmer, because why not?",
"Linus_winter_Mon2": "Do you like winter? Does it make you happy?#$b#Maybe it's your favorite season?#$b#It's not mine. Even though my Birthday happens in winter. My favorite is spring.$1#$e#See you soon, farmer. Have a great day today.",
"Linus_winter_Tue2": "Have you had any interesting dreams this winter? Such as of a blue fairy?#$b#An old legend in Stardew Valley. If you see a blue fairy in your winter dreams, it means good luck.$1#$e#Now time to meditate.",
"Linus_winter_Wed2": "During the 'Dream of the Winter Fairy,' sometimes you can ask for a wish.$3#$b#If it's a wish from a your heart, the blue fairy will grant it.$1#$b#If from your mind, bad luck will follow!$1#$e#I feel one with everything. Not a bad feeling if you ask me.",
"Linus_winter_Thu2": "Have you seen any deer around? They are my favorite animal.#$b#They are so skittish, but if you can earn their trust...#$b#It's a magical feeling.$1#$e#...might go take a nap now.",
"Linus_winter_Fri2": "Once, I had a dream about a monster that was looking for me in the snow.#$b#I couldn't move, and it got closer, and closer.$3#$b#When it found me, I woke up. I was sweating.$3#$b#It's stuck with me. I wonder what it meant.#$e#Find joy in the small things, farmer.",
"Linus_winter_Sat2": "Is winter tough on you? It's tough on me.#$b#You seem like someone who can make it through anything.#$b#It's nice to see someone with such spirit.$1#$e#Enjoy today!",
"Linus_winter_Sun2": "The days are shorter, and the nights are longer.#$b#I use my time to gather as much food as I can.$1#$b#With the holidays, there's a lot of food around...#$e#Laugh more, farmer, because why not?",
"Linus_winter_Mon4": "It might surprise you, but in my searches I've found quite a few weapons and tools left over from ancient times.#$b#Rusted swords from battles long forgotten, axes in the middle of the forest.#$b#It's always exciting.#$e#See you soon, farmer. Have a great day today.",
"Linus_winter_Tue4": "I once found a sword in the bushes next to a box...#$b#There was a note inside, but over the years, the words had faded away.#$b#What was so important? Why was it there? Who wrote it?#$b#I wonder about it from time to time...$2#$e#Now time to meditate.",
"Linus_winter_Wed4": "Have you heard the legend of the Great Wolf? Most people have forgotten it, but I still remember.#$b#A giant wolf used to protect these lands from people who would do it wrong.#$b#People celebrated the wolf until, one day, they feared it and drove it off.$3#$b#I hear it still shows up sometimes.#$e#I feel one with everything. Not a bad feeling if you ask me.",
"Linus_winter_Thu4": "The Great Wolf that protected the valley...I wonder what became of it.#$b#It's possible it was never real....$2#$b#But I like to imagine it was, at some point.$1#$e#...might go take a nap now.",
"Linus_winter_Fri4": "What's great about finding old weapons is, I can sell them and get some money.#$b#I'd donate them but...$2#$b#Well, I need to eat.#$b#Hopefully I'm not cursed now, or something.$1#$e#Find joy in the small things, farmer.",
"Linus_winter_Sat4": "I didn't used to like folklore. I thought it was all just made up tales.$3#$b#But live on the land for long enough, and you start to see things...#$b#Your own stories, which you know are true, become fantastical to others.#$b#I understand it a lot more now.$1#$e#Enjoy today!",
"Linus_winter_Sun4": "Maybe someday, I will become a part of Pelican Town's folklore.#$b#Once, there was a man, who lived in the wilderness...#$b#I hope it will be a tale with a happy ending.$1#$e#Laugh more, farmer, because why not?",
"Linus_winter_Mon6": "The cold has been affecting my spirit today...#$b#Almost supernatural....$2#$b#I need to warm up.#$e#See you soon, farmer. Have a great day today.",
"Linus_winter_Tue6": "The trees have the right idea. Become one with the season.#$b#Avoid the heartache that winter can bring.$1#$b#Is it too late to become a tree?$3#$e#Now time to meditate.",
"Linus_winter_Wed6": "In an effort to stay warm, and positive, I've started to learn the way of the hedgehog.#$b#It is difficult, but I think it's coming along.#$b#I just don't have the whole spine-thing down yet.#$e#I feel one with everything. Not a bad feeling if you ask me.",
"Linus_winter_Thu6": "It's easy to let winter get me down, so I look to the positive.#$b#It's cold, at least we're not covered in...#$b#Lava?#$e#...might go take a nap now.",
"Linus_winter_Fri6": "What a calm day.#$b#The silence of the world at peace.#$b#I can get used to this.$3#$e#Find joy in the small things, farmer.",
"Linus_winter_Sat6": "I've been thinking a lot about the snow.#$b#It's white. Did it have a choice of color? Did it pick that color?$2#$b#Imagine if it was polka dotted.$3#$e#Enjoy today!",
"Linus_winter_Sun6": "I've made up a new mantra. It helps me focus despite the weather.#$b#Free focus, free foresight, free willed.#$b#It's actually been working pretty well!$3#$e#Laugh more, farmer, because why not?",
"Linus_winter_Mon8": "This winter has been a bit rough on me, @.$2#$b#Everything is cold and unforgiving. Nothing I do seems to help...#$b#Yet, there's that feeling that spring is coming, and everything will blossom.#$e#See you soon, farmer. Have a great day today.",
"Linus_winter_Tue8": "The mind, body, and soul are united. Without one, the others die.#$b#Despite all I've been through, all three are intact. Yet, they are often challenged...#$b#Sorry, I don't mean to worry you, @.$3#$e#Now time to meditate.",
"Linus_winter_Wed8": "My mind gets lost sometimes, in the memories of my past.#$b#My body persists, yet I am older, and the aches...#$b#My soul? My soul soars.$1#$e#I feel one with everything. Not a bad feeling if you ask me.",
"Linus_winter_Thu8": "Serenity and peace is a state of being...#$b#I read that in a fortune cookie once.#$b#I'm not sure why it's come back to me now...#$e#...might go take a nap now.",
"Linus_winter_Fri8": "@! Good to see you today.#$b#I had a good sleep last night. Stayed warm, had good dreams.#$b#Today is cold, but not as cold.#$b#It's a happy day!$1#$e#Find joy in the small things, farmer.",
"Linus_winter_Sat8": "This year has had some rough patches, but things are a bit better, having talked with you.#$b#It's helped me.#$b#Thank you, Farmer.#$e#Enjoy today!",
"Linus_winter_Sun8": "This morning I smelled someone cooking something wonderful...$3#$b#I wanted so badly to just knock and try some, but got a too nervous and went away.#$b#Maybe next time.$1#$e#Laugh more, farmer, because why not?",
"Linus_winter_Mon10": "You've surprised me, @. Not many people come back to see me time and time again.#$b#Yet here you are, and I am better for it.$1#$b#Bye, Farmer.",
"Linus_winter_Tue10": "Seeing you here today puts a smile on my face, @.#$b#Your grandfather would have been happy to know how well you've done.#$e#I'm very happy you're around, @. Bye.",
"Linus_winter_Wed10": "I used to have a couch. A real couch. It was...red, I think.#$b#It was wonderful to rest on.#$b#I wonder where it is now?#$e#If you find a red couch, let me know, okay? Bye.",
"Linus_winter_Thu10": "Winter comes, but it also goes.#$b#Spring is here, but for a moment.#$b#The cycle continues.#$b#That's what's been on my mind lately.#$e#...$1",
"Linus_winter_Fri10": "Recently, some people asked if I was the gift giver of winter...#$b#I have no idea where they got that idea.#$b#If I was a gift-giver spirit, my beard would be longer!#$e#I'm serious!",
"Linus_winter_Sat10": "The day I left my stressful job was a huge step.#$b#Selling everything I owned was another.#$b#Then, the day I left to see the world...#$b#Such a wonderful thing.#$e#It was a long time ago, though.$3",
"Linus_winter_Sun10": "I hope we can continue to talk with each other.#$b#You've shown me that there are still young people who want to learn from people like me.#$e#It's a nice feeling. See you, @.",


//Marnie
"Marnie_Introduction": "Hello there, sunshine! Are you the new farmer?#$b#My name's Marnie! It's a pleasure to meet you. If you ever need animals or animal supplies, come see me!$1",
"Marnie_spring_1": "A new year! I'm excited for it. It's going to be a lot of fun. Let's make it positive!$1",
"Marnie_spring_Mon": "Animals need a lot of love, and they deserve it. They are so innocent.#$b#People who are mean to animals make me sick!$4#$e#See you again soon, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Tue": "Cows, chickens, and sheep. Every farm needs them. They can provide so much!#$b#However, rabbits, ducks, and goats can be just as lucrative! It's all up to you, @$1.#$e#Have a great day, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Wed": "Don't purchase an animal if you know you can't care for it if it gets hurt. There's so much uncertainty with animals.$2#$b#You need to be ready to support them, no matter what.#$e#I hope you have a great night tonight, @! See you!",
"Marnie_spring_Thu": "Pigs are really cute, don't you think? It's a shame people use them as an insult.#$b#They really will eat anything, though. They are good at digging up truffles!$1#$e#Enjoy the rest of your day!",
"Marnie_spring_Fri": "Some people think it's best to start a farm growing chickens. Everyone needs eggs, and they are regular.#$b#Others save up and buy cows. Milk sells for a good amount. Personally, I say pick which one you want to love more!#$e#Stay positive! I'll see you soon, okay?$1",
"Marnie_spring_Sat": "It's hard to get attached to farm animals sometimes, especially if they are going to become food.$2#$b#It's important to try and not think of them as pets. Sometimes, though, it's just too hard not to.$1#$e#What a week! Hope you have a great weekend, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Sun": "Have you ever met someone who hates all kinds of animals? Sometimes they have bad experiences with them, but other times, well, they creep me out!$2#$e#I'm so tired! I'm glad the week is over now. See you, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Mon2": "I work hard on the ranch, getting all the chores done, and then I stand up all day. You'd think I'd have a model figure, yet I don't.$2#$b#Everyone says not to worry about it, but sometimes it gets the better of me.$3#$e#See you again soon, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Tue2": "Today is the day I exercise with the girls. It's a lot of fun, and helps keep my spirits up.#$b#Focused exercise in a group can be a blast! I always look forward to Tuesday.$1#$e#Have a great day, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Wed2": "It's thanks to animals we get ice cream, cheeses, mayonnaise, and so much more!$1#$b#I'm not the best cook, but I do my best. I eat a lot of Gus' food, though!#$e#I hope you have a great night tonight, @! See you!",
"Marnie_spring_Thu2": "There's being a healthy person in body, and being one in mind. It's hard enough to keep one balanced.#$b#I'm doing my best though. I know I at least have a healthy mind!$1#$e#Enjoy the rest of your day!",
"Marnie_spring_Fri2": "It was hard enough staying focused on my own life, but with Jas and Shane here now, I have to care three times as much.$2#$b#They are my family, and I don't want anything to happen to them.#$e#Stay positive! I'll see you soon, okay?",
"Marnie_spring_Sat2": "There have been times in my life where I had to rely on my inner strength to survive. It's hard, but it's possible.$3#$b#Now, my inner strength can lift buildings! If you ever need help, I'm here for you, @!$1#$e#What a week! Hope you have a great weekend, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Sun2": "What a great week it's been so far. How's it been with you, @?#$b#Let's keep striving for peace and happiness. We can do it!$1#$e#I'm so tired! I'm glad the week is over now. See you, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Mon4": "I hope you're doing your best on the farm, @. A lot of people couldn't do what you're doing.#$b#It's a heavy responsibility, but you're taking it in stride. Good job!$1#$e#See you again soon, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Tue4": "Working hard on the farm, @? I bet you are! There's so much opportunity, it's a really exciting time for you, isn't it?#$b#I hope it all works out well! Keep me updated.$1#$e#Have a great day, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Wed4": "I just want you to know, @, I'm rooting for you. There's no competitor spirit here. We can support each other!#$b#It makes me proud to know we both care, you know?$1#$e#I hope you have a great night tonight, @! See you!",
"Marnie_spring_Thu4": "Sometimes the work can be lonely. It's important to be social, you know?$2#$b#I'm always going into town and saying hello to everyone. It inspires me to keep doing my best.#$e#Enjoy the rest of your day!",
"Marnie_spring_Fri4": "You ever get into a staring contest with a cow? Sometimes I can't help but try and guess what they are thinking about.$2#$b#I have a feeling my cows are thinking, 'stop staring at me, lady.'#$e#Stay positive! I'll see you soon, okay?",
"Marnie_spring_Sat4": "I dropped some eggs today. When you buy eggs from the store, and you drop them, it doesn't hurt too bad. But when they are from your own animals...$3#$b#I felt so guilty. I'll be extra careful next time!$2#$e#What a week! Hope you have a great weekend, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Sun4": "Spring's a difficult time for me, because there is so much I'd like to do! But responsibilities, lately, come first.$3#$b#I still make as much time as I can for some me time, though, so all hope is not lost.#$e#I'm so tired! I'm glad the week is over now. See you, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Mon6": "I worry about Jas. She's been through so much, and she's so quiet. I wish she'd make more friends, but all in good time.$3#$e#See you again soon, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Tue6": "Shane's a great guy. He can be a bit stuck-up to people he doesn't know, but get to know him and he's a real sweet heart.#$b#He's always there for Jas, which is great. I appreciate him.$1#$e#Have a great day, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Wed6": "When it's so beautiful out, and things are at peace, when I see Jas just staring, it breaks my heart. She has a tough time ahead of her.$3#$b#I will always be there for her. No matter what. She's family.#$e#I hope you have a great night tonight, @! See you!",
"Marnie_spring_Thu6": "Despite all they've been through, Shane and Jas are still good. I'm proud to be their aunt. I just hope I can make them happy!#$e#Enjoy the rest of your day!",
"Marnie_spring_Fri6": "It's been an emotional week for sure. Thankfully I've been so busy, I can out run my feelings.$3#$b#Is that healthy? Maybe? It's hard to tell sometimes.$2#$e#Stay positive! I'll see you soon, okay?",
"Marnie_spring_Sat6": "The Saloon is a great place to unwind. Gus is a great guy, and hearing his stories of his travels is one of my favorite things to do.$1#$b#Seeing Lewis is great too...$2#$e#What a week! Hope you have a great weekend, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Sun6": "It's been a bit quiet today. I'll tell you this, @, my heart aches for a special someone.$3#$b#Why does life have to be so needlessly complicated sometimes?$4#$e#I'm so tired! I'm glad the week is over now. See you, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Mon8": "Spring is the time for lovers, so it's hard to not be honest about my relationship with Lewis. It's strange. Why is it so difficult?$3#$b#It's like we're both afraid to commit. Like something will happen to us if we do.$2#$b#Worst kept secret in Pelican Town.$3#$e#See you again soon, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Tue8": "Lewis doesn't realize that trying to be so secretive isn't fun. It hurts. I'm not ashamed of him.$3#$b#One of these days he'll see my way. Until then, I'll try to convince him. At least I can talk about it with you, @!$3#$e#Have a great day, @.$3",
"Marnie_spring_Wed8": "I see a lot of couples out and about in spring. I wish I could be like that. I don't want to hide what's so important to me.$3#$b#It can be so annoying to be in this situation. But when Lewis and I are together, all is right in the world.#$e#I hope you have a great night tonight, @! See you!",
"Marnie_spring_Thu8": "Thanks for always being there to talk to me, @. You're a genuine person. I always try to be honest myself, but sometimes, it's hard.$2#$b#Am I too trusting? I may be. I wonder if I come on too strong?$2#$e#Enjoy the rest of your day!",
"Marnie_spring_Fri8": "My favorite song came on the radio today. It made me stop and think about my life, and you came to my mind, @. I'm so glad we're friends!$1#$e#Stay positive! I'll see you soon, okay?",
"Marnie_spring_Sat8": "If someone is sad, is it better to try to make them happy, or be sad with them? It's so hard to know.$3#$b#I try my best to be there for people, but sometimes I wonder if I'm overstepping my boundaries. What do you think, @?$2#$e#What a week! Hope you have a great weekend, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Sun8": "It's been an emotional day so far. Been thinking a lot about my life, where I've been, where I could be.$3#$b#Life is so complicated, for better and worse. I'm glad I can talk about it openly with you, @.#$e#I'm so tired! I'm glad the week is over now. See you, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Mon10": "My sister, Jas's mother, was strong. Far stronger than me. I looked up to her.$3#$b#Seeing her face in Jas...it's eerie sometimes. I try not to think about it, or else it's overpowering to me.$3#$e#Have a good day, @. I'll see you soon.$3",
"Marnie_spring_Tue10": "When I got the call about my sister's accident, I was stunned. A lot of people cry, but I just turned inward. It wasn't until I saw Jas that I snapped back.$3#$b#I have to be strong, for myself, for Jas, and for my sister's memory. It's what she would have wanted.$3#$e#See you later, @.$3",
"Marnie_spring_Wed10": "I was able to get Jas to smile today. It was beautiful, we really bonded. Over milk of all things!$1#$b#Even when things feel hopeless, sometimes hope can peak through. Isn't that wonderful, @?$1#$e#I hope you have a great night, @! See you soon.",
"Marnie_spring_Thu10": "I stayed up late last night, just thinking about my life. I wonder how everything will end up for me.$2#$b#I can only hope things end up well. All this work for nothing? I can't think about that. I must stay strong.#$e#Lots to think about! Have a great day all the same, @.",
"Marnie_spring_Fri10": "There's a lot on my plate lately, @. You've seen it. Thank you for taking the time to bring me things. It really cheers me up.$1#$b#Sometimes I slip and fall into depression, but talking with you really helps. Thank you.#$e#You're great, @. See you later!",
"Marnie_spring_Sat10": "I think my cows look forward to seeing you, @. I could have sworn I could see them talking with each other.#$b#You're cow famous. Can you believe that?$1#$b#I'm not crazy! It's moo! I mean true.$4#$e#Have a nice night tonight, okay? See you, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Sun10": "Cheers to you, @. We farm and ranch folk need to stick together. Let's have many more years together!#$e#True friendship. It's wonderful. See you, @!$1",
"Marnie_spring_Mon2_inlaw_Shane": "Shane loves chickens! He was always such a good help with them. They really seemed to trust him.#$b#Or maybe he always brought them food! It's hard to know sometimes.#$e#See you later, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Sat2_inlaw_Shane": "Jas misses Shane. I tell her he's not far, but you know kids. He's really good with her.#$b#Tell him to stop by sometime soon!#$e#See you later, @.",
"Marnie_spring_Mon4_inlaw_Shane": "I'm glad Shane has you, @. He may not seem like it, but I can tell he's happy.#$b#Finding true happiness, isn't that wonderful? It makes me excited for him.#$e#Have a great day, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Sat4_inlaw_Shane": "Shane was telling me some secrets about you, @! I told him to keep his mouth shut.#$b#However, what he told me was pretty interesting. That's all I'll say.$4#$e#Have a good day, okay, @?",
"Marnie_spring_Mon6_inlaw_Shane": "For the longest time, I thought Shane was doomed in the world of love. He can come across so passive and uncaring.#$b#He hides his heart well, but when he's around chickens, or you, his warmth really shows.#$e#Have a great rest of your day, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Sat6_inlaw_Shane": "Before you were married, Shane was really nervous. He didn't want to mess it up, and I had a lot of talks with him.#$b#He has the confidence to make it work, and that's what counts. You're really lucky, @!$1#$e#Enjoy yourself today, @!",
"Marnie_spring_Mon8_inlaw_Shane": "You can't judge a book by its cover. A lot of people would tell me how awful Shane was. I was always so shocked they said that.$2#$b#If they had only taken the time to really get to know him, they would have found a really sweet, loving man.#$b#People can be so rude sometimes, @!$2#$e#Have a great day, okay? See you!",
"Marnie_spring_Sat8_inlaw_Shane": "I'm so glad you and Shane worked out, @. I didn't know for a long time there if it would.#$b#It's hard to get excited about relationships sometimes. Cheering for people who end up breaking up is so awkward!$2#$e#Have a great day, @. Enjoy yourself!",
"Marnie_summer_1": "It's so hot out today. It must be summer. I hope all the animals will survive okay! You too, @. Stay cool.$4#$e#Let's do our best this season!",
"Marnie_summer_Mon": "The summer heat can really be tough on animals. It's important to have shade for them, or else it might cost them their life.$2#$b#However, some animals love the heat. Like snakes. Scary thought!$4#$e#See you again soon, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Tue": "I've been getting up earlier to try and take care of my chores before it gets too hot. I don't do well in the heat.#$b#I've tried all sorts of methods to stay cool, but it never works for me. It's frustrating!$2#$e#Have a great day, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Wed": "I splurged today and had some ice cream. It was so good. Have you tried homemade ice cream before?#$b#It's just so delicious. I'll have to make some for you sometime!$1#$e#I hope you have a great night tonight, @! See you!",
"Marnie_summer_Thu": "Summer is my least favorite season. It's hot, and I get all sticky. I end up taking a lot of showers.$2#$b#I try not to smell, I swear! I'm too self-conscious...$3#$e#Enjoy the rest of your day!",
"Marnie_summer_Fri": "I've been working pretty hard this week. There's just so much that needs to get done. Sometimes I wish I had some extra help.$3#$b#I've had a few employees before, but it just didn't work out. Everything must be just right.#$e#Stay positive! I'll see you soon, okay?",
"Marnie_summer_Sat": "I'm a big fan of summer nights, especially walking home from the Stardrop Saloon. When I'm with that special someone, and the stars are out, and the wind blows...$1#$b#Am I turning red? I shouldn't be. Am I? Oh no!$4#$e#What a week! Hope you have a great weekend, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Sun": "Summer will be over, and then we get to my favorite season, fall! Did you know it's Clint's favorite season as well?$1#$b#We don't talk too often, but we have shared that. It's nice to know I'm not the only one!#$e#I'm so tired! I'm glad the week is over now. See you, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Mon2": "I used to be a swimmer in high school. I was pretty good. Everyone said I had great stamina.#$b#I never got in first, but I also never got in last. I'm proud of that time.$2#$e#See you again soon, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Tue2": "I wish I could go to the beach and walk around in a swimsuit without feeling so embarrassed. Everyone says they don't judge, but I can't help it.$3#$b#There's always work to do, so I just put it off. One of these days, though...$2#$e#Have a great day, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Wed2": "It's the perfect day to swim outside, don't you think? Hop in the water and drink cold lemonade, that would be wonderful.#$e#I hope you have a great night tonight, @! See you!",
"Marnie_summer_Thu2": "I'm so nervous about how people view me. All my friends say I shouldn't worry about it, but I can't help it.$2#$b#I'm a hard workin' rancher! Who cares about looks? Yet, I do!$4#$e#Enjoy the rest of your day!",
"Marnie_summer_Fri2": "Staying cool today, @? I bet you are. You're a cool person just to look at. An aura of cool surrounds you.#$b#Am I being too cheesy? Sorry. I overdo it sometimes.$4#$e#Stay positive! I'll see you soon, okay?",
"Marnie_summer_Sat2": "It's so hot today, I bet I could make fried eggs on the ground. Not that I would do that, of course.#$b#No reason to waste good eggs on trying to prove a point!$1#$e#What a week! Hope you have a great weekend, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Sun2": "Jas has been home a lot lately, so I'm trying to cheer her up with summer activities. Some have worked better than others.$2#$e#I'm so tired! I'm glad the week is over now. See you, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Mon4": "Has anyone ever told you that you have great eyes? It's true! I don't like the color of my eyes.#$b#I wish I could have blue eyes, like the ocean. It would dazzle the cows, I bet!$1#$e#See you again soon, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Tue4": "Tell me about your history, @. What were you doing before all this?#$b#You worked for Joja? That's crazy. Your life pretty different now.$2#$b#It's amazing the twists and turns life can take, isn't it?$1#$e#Have a great day, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Wed4": "I knew someone that looked like you, @. They were very nice, and went to my high school.#$b#I wonder how they are doing now. I haven't thought about them in years.$2#$e#I hope you have a great night tonight, @! See you!",
"Marnie_summer_Thu4": "Business is all over the place during summer. Some years, I do really well. Others, I struggle to get by and keep the animals fed.$3#$b#This summer is a bit in between. At least I don't have to worry too much about it this year!#$e#Enjoy the rest of your day!",
"Marnie_summer_Fri4": "How's the farm, @? You farming hard and fast? Are you farming your face off?#$b#Sorry, I thought that would be funny. I still think it's funny. Is this awkward?$4#$e#Stay positive! I'll see you soon, okay?",
"Marnie_summer_Sat4": "I have a terrible headache today. I overdid it. I'll just take it easy, I think. Yikes.$3#$e#What a week! Hope you have a great weekend, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Sun4": "Today is the kind of day to enjoy a nice cold glass of milk, some ice cream, and the shade. Let's do that sometime, @!#$e#I'm so tired! I'm glad the week is over now. See you, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Mon6": "Jas is terribly afraid of swimming. I've been meaning to take her to the beach, but can't find the time.$2#$b#I feel really guilty about it. Hopefully I'll find time before the end of summer.$3#$e#See you again soon, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Tue6": "Lately I've been having a hard time connecting with people. A lot on my mind, I guess.$3#$b#Hopefully it's just a phase. Everyone goes through portions of their life like this, right?$2#$e#Have a great day, @.",
"Marnie_summer_Wed6": "The beach is calling me today. I need to go, but I probably won't. We can't get everything we want in life, right?$3#$b#Sometimes it's hard to convince myself to be content.$2#$e#I hope you have a great night tonight, @! See you!",
"Marnie_summer_Thu6": "Shane hates working retail. He'd avoid it all cost if he could. I don't blame him, they always treat him terribly.$3#$b#However, I can't have him work in my shop. He gets so depressed, so quickly. It's hard for him, I guess.$3#$e#Enjoy the rest of your day!",
"Marnie_summer_Fri6": "Today's going by so quickly, I wonder if I'll have any time for myself. We'll see.$3#$b#When things are slow, I want to be busy. When things are busy, I want them to be slow. It's all over the place.#$e#Stay positive! I'll see you soon, okay?",
"Marnie_summer_Sat6": "Feeling a bit nostalgic today. Summer has good and bad memories for me, but today, I'm thinking about the positive ones.#$b#How about you, @? How's the day been so far?$1#$e#What a week! Hope you have a great weekend, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Sun6": "This summer has been full of ups and downs. Maybe next week will be better? One can only hope.$3#$b#Nice of you to come by so often though, @. Let's do it all again next week!$1#$e#I'm so tired! I'm glad the week is over now. See you, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Mon8": "It bothers me that Lewis and I can't do the things lovers do during Summer. All this secretive stuff is getting me down.$3#$b#I want to lounge on the beach with him, watch the stars! Instead, we creep around in the shadows.$2#$b#Which has its own fun, I suppose.#$e#See you again soon, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Tue8": "Between the animals, Jas, and Shane, it's really hard to find concrete, guaranteed private time.#$b#Sometimes you just need to be alone, especially when it's with your love...Don't you agree?$2#$e#Have a great day, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Wed8": "Today has been pretty good, actually. A rare happy summer day! Want to know why?#$b#I have a special date tonight! Keep it out little secret though.$1#$e#I hope you have a great night tonight, @! See you!",
"Marnie_summer_Thu8": "I'm really feeling the heat today. Lewis and I had a fight, over something ridiculous...$3#$b#I don't want to say I overstepped my boundaries, but things are a bit tense.$2#$e#Enjoy the rest of your day, though, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Fri8": "Can I just tell you this, @? You're a great person. I always have fun talking with you, and think about our conversations later.$1#$b#I may have had a few to drink today, but that doesn't matter. This is honesty. Should I shut up? You're great.$4#$e#Stay positive! I'll see you soon, okay?",
"Marnie_summer_Sat8": "One of my favorite beers is one that you can't get anymore. It's called Pelican Pale Ale. Gus had me try some a long time ago, and it was wonderful.#$b#The person who made it doesn't make it anymore, which is a shame. I'd love to have you try some, @!$2#$e#What a week! Hope you have a great weekend, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Sun8": "What a summer. This is not one I'll remember too fondly, @. I know fall will be better, I can feel it in my bones. Cheers to that!$2#$e#I'm so tired! I'm glad the week is over now. See you, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Mon10": "I've never been skinny, or at least what I consider skinny. I've always been a large gal.$3#$b#When I was a little girl, I was teased relentlessly about it. It still stings to this day, if I'm being honest.$3#$e#See you soon, @.$3",
"Marnie_summer_Tue10": "Weight is a big issue for some people, and I never thought I'd get roped into being so self-conscious. I try my best not think about it...$3#$b#I've cried myself to sleep some nights. It's so hard for me to not feel guilty.$3#$e#Have a good day, @.",
"Marnie_summer_Wed10": "It's important not to be your own enemy, or else you can go down some dark paths. I know this from experience.$2#$b#Before I became a rancher, I was depressed and ate a lot. I'd gain weight, then hate myself for it. It was a vicious cycle.$3#$e#Have a great night tonight, okay, @?$3",
"Marnie_summer_Thu10": "I just want to say, thank you for not judging me, @. You've never mentioned my weight, or made me feel disgusting. You're a great person.#$b#I'm so glad we're friends. I will always cherish you!$1#$e#Have a wonderful rest of your day, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Fri10": "People who attack others because of their weight, I'll never understand. How is it supposed help them by making them feel ashamed?$3#$b#I try my best to defend people when I can, but sometimes, people are vicious.$2#$e#Stay positive, @! Have a good one.",
"Marnie_summer_Sat10": "This season has been a bit rough emotionally, but I want you to know that you've helped a lot. Thank you for caring and coming to see me, @. You're awesome.$1#$e#Enjoy tonight, it should be a cool one. Bye, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Sun10": "Lewis appreciates me for who I am. I never once feel any shame when I'm with him. That's how I know he's the one for me.$1#$e#But let's keep that our secret, @!$4#$e#See you soon, okay, @?",
"Marnie_summer_Mon2_inlaw_Shane": "Enjoying the heat with your lover, @? Shane's a good swimmer, you know.#$b#It's always good to spend some time in the water, in private, with the love of your life.#$b#Did I say that out loud? Don't mind me!$4#$e#Have a good one, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Sat2_inlaw_Shane": "Spending time with your loved one on a summer night, that's truly living.#$b#I'm glad you are that person for Shane, @. You're family!#$e#Have a great rest of your day, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Mon4_inlaw_Shane": "Shane was never sure he'd find anyone except maybe the chickens. He used to get really depressed about it.#$b#You two getting together has done him a lot of good!$1#$e#See you later, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Sat4_inlaw_Shane": "I'm actually surprised Shane didn't give up, you know? He always puts a lot of pressure on himself.#$b#I'd been worried he'd not give you a shot, but I'm glad he did.#$e#Have a wonderful one, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Mon6_inlaw_Shane": "Jas misses Shane, you know, but I'm surprised she doesn't go over to your farm! One of these days I'll convince her. It's not scary!#$e#See you later, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Sat6_inlaw_Shane": "When Shane worked for Joja, it crushed him. Now, things are a lot better. He has a purpose with you!#$b#You're one of a kind, you know that? I'm so glad you're together.#$e#See you later, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Mon8_inlaw_Shane": "The chickens miss Shane so much. He was always so good with them!#$b#How can I tell they miss him? The way they look at him when he does come by, of course.#$b#I know he hugs them, and they love it!#$e#Have a great day, @!",
"Marnie_summer_Sat8_inlaw_Shane": "Make this a special summer, @. You and Shane together, make it one to be remembered!#$b#Run through the woods, fall in each other's arms...#$b#I'm running away in my head again. Sorry, @!$4#$e#Have a good one. See you!",
"Marnie_fall_1": "It's fall! I'm so happy! It's my favorite season, and it means my birthday is coming soon!$1#$b#Let's make this fall extra special for everyone.#$e#Take a deep breath, peace is here!$1",
"Marnie_fall_17": "My birthday is tomorrow. I'm afraid no one will remember, but I don't want to say anything, you know?$2#$b#I guess I've told you now. Keep it a secret! Or don't.$4#$e#Maybe I should have been quiet...$2",
"Marnie_fall_Mon": "I'm so inspired during fall. There's so much I want to get done, and with the cooler temperatures, I can do them.#$b#I plan on making this fall extra productive as well.$1#$e#See you again soon, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Tue": "The falling of the leaves, the sounds of animals, it's so serene.$1#$b#I've tried to draw it a few times, but I'm not the best artist. It just ends up looking nasty.$2#$e#Have a great day, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Wed": "I start working in the shop on Wednesday, so it's technically the beginning of my week. Some people are bothered by not having a proper weekend.#$b#I just chop my weekend up, and spread it around at the Stardrop Saloon!$1#$e#I hope you have a great night tonight, @! See you!",
"Marnie_fall_Thu": "It's the time of the harvest. Winter is coming, and for some, it's a season of vacation. Me? The work never ends!#$e#Enjoy the rest of your day!",
"Marnie_fall_Fri": "Can you imagine how terrifying it would be if all animals died during fall? Some go and hibernate, but that's not quite death.$2#$b#A whole field of cows, gone every year! I couldn't take it.$2#$e#Stay positive! I'll see you soon, okay?",
"Marnie_fall_Sat": "I woke up today after having a great dream, all my chores were done early, and the animals seemed happy.#$b#Fall brings good feelings, @! I hope you're having a good time too.$1#$e#What a week! Hope you have a great weekend, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Sun": "Cows go 'moo,' ducks go 'quack,' and chickens go 'cluck.' These are known noises.#$b#Yet, not matter what noise I make to some of my animals, they don't respond. One of these days, I'll have a conversation with them.$2#$e#I'm so tired! I'm glad the week is over now. See you, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Mon2": "I've been getting all wrapped up in town gossip lately. I feel sort of bad, but knowing secrets is so fun.#$b#I heard this one about Demetrius. He hasn't gotten a breakthrough in quite some time! I hope it works out for him.$2#$e#See you again soon, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Tue2": "When people start talking about gossip, I used to excuse myself. Now, I can't help but overhear.$2#$b#Here's one. I hear Willy used to be an actor, but gave it all up. Can you believe that?$4#$e#Have a great day, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Wed2": "I heard some hurtful gossip about me the other day. I didn't think anyone could think that way about me, but I overheard it, and I wish I didn't.$3#$b#Better to take today and cool off. It can really hurt sometimes, you know?$3#$e#I hope you have a great night tonight, @! See you!",
"Marnie_fall_Thu2": "Gus is a great guy. I've spent so much money at the Saloon, especially when he starts talking about his adventures.#$b#I'm surprised he's still single. He'd be quite the catch for anyone!$1#$e#Enjoy the rest of your day!",
"Marnie_fall_Fri2": "There was some gossip going around about you, @. They said that you're a work-a-holic. Is that true?#$b#Maybe they are just jealous of your work ethic!$1#$e#Stay positive! I'll see you soon, okay?",
"Marnie_fall_Sat2": "I'm a rancher of animals. I love what I do, and take great pride in it. If I were to get a bunch of monsters together...#$b#And I put all those monsters on a ranch...$2#$b#I guess I'd be a monster rancher, wouldn't I?$1#$e#What a week! Hope you have a great weekend, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Sun2": "When people start talking gossip, and you're trying to keep a secret, it's stressful if people start guessing it.$3#$b#The wrong secret at the wrong time can ruin lives!$2#$e#I'm so tired! I'm glad the week is over now. See you, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Mon4": "I used to be a waitress. Not for a very long time, but before I became a rancher. It was interesting, to say the least.$2#$b#I'm just glad I'm not in that kind of work anymore.#$e#See you again soon, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Tue4": "When you're a waitress, people tip you based on all sorts of wild reasons. The good people tip you because of how hard you worked.#$b#Some tip based on your looks. It's a deflating feeling, for sure.$2#$e#Have a great day, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Wed4": "When I was a waitress, I was either the lowest tipped waitress, or the highest, depending on if this one girl was working or not. Her name was Tiffany.$3#$b#Tiffany flirted and went a bit too far for the guests. It was disturbing, but she walked out practically rich.$3#$e#I hope you have a great night tonight, @! See you!",
"Marnie_fall_Thu4": "I learned that you could make a lot of money if you sold your soul, working at the diner. I realized I wanted something more out of life.#$b#Taking that jump away from what you're doing into what you want to do is crazy! I'm sure you know what that's like now, @.$1#$e#Enjoy the rest of your day!",
"Marnie_fall_Fri4": "On one of my last shifts as a waitress, a woman came in dressed like a cowgirl. She had the hat, the boots, everything.#$b#She asked me why I was so down. For some reason, I told her. I spilled everything out.$2#$b#She gave me a job on her ranch. I thought about it, and then, took it. Now here I am.#$e#Stay positive! I'll see you soon, okay?",
"Marnie_fall_Sat4": "Been thinking a lot about how my life would have been if I stayed a waitress. I wouldn't have been able to care for Jas, that's for sure.$2#$b#I'm glad things have turned out as they have. Truly.$1#$e#What a week! Hope you have a great weekend, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Sun4": "I always tip Emily. I know how much a waitress comes to count on those tips, so I spoil her.$1#$b#Let that be our secret though, @!#$e#I'm so tired! I'm glad the week is over now. See you, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Mon6": "Some people resent their birthdays, some ignore them, but I celebrate mine! A birthday is a special thing.$1#$b#When people throw you a birthday party, it means you can be as cheesy as you want and not worry about being awkward!#$e#See you again soon, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Tue6": "I've had some great birthday parties, and some really bad ones. When I was a little girl, it felt like only bad ones.$3#$b#Once year, no one came. My mother had rented out three tables at a pizza restaurant! So embarrassing.$2#$e#Have a great day, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Wed6": "Age is something some people can't deal with, which I find strange. Unless you haven't learned from your years and gotten wise, there's nothing wrong with aging.$2#$b#However, I will say that I never volunteer to say my age...$3",
"Marnie_fall_Thu6": "I hope I can throw Jas a lot of great birthday parties. Little bits of joy for a girl who is as great as her.$3#$b#I just wish her parents could be there...$3#$e#See you, @.$3",
"Marnie_fall_Fri6": "Birthdays in fall are fun because you know it will never be hot. However, it's risky to throw one outside...#$e#Rain, early snow, sudden winds, lots of things can ruin a good party. But when it works? It's magic.$1#$e#Stay positive! I'll see you soon, okay?",
"Marnie_fall_Sat6": "Do you respect old people, or do they annoy you? For me, each person I meet is unique.#$b#However, I will say that there are some people who just can't let go of the old ways, for better or for worse.$2#$e#What a week! Hope you have a great weekend, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Sun6": "When I get old and grey, I hope I can keep my mind and stay positive. I've seen bitterness and anger rot people before their time.$2#$e#I'm so tired! I'm glad the week is over now. See you, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Mon8": "I'd love to expand my ranch, really make it something extra special. Can you imagine becoming world famous?#$b#There's a lot of work from there to here, though, I'll tell you that!$1#$e#See you again soon, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Tue8": "I'll tell you this, @, I hope I'm lucky enough to live out the rest of my days here. I don't want to leave.#$b#However, I'd much prefer to spend the rest of my days with Lewis than alone...$3#$e#Have a great day, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Wed8": "Are you happy with your work so far this year, @? I can hope so. You've done so much.#$b#It's been great seeing your farm grow this past year. Keep it up!$1#$e#I hope you have a great night tonight, @! See you!",
"Marnie_fall_Thu8": "The previous owner of this ranch built it with his own hands. His wife helped, and chose the colors.#$b#I bought it shortly after they died. I honor them from time to time. Without their hard work, who knows if this place would still be standing!$1#$e#Enjoy the rest of your day!",
"Marnie_fall_Fri8": "Are you a fan of scary stories, @? I found a page from a journal in one of the old drawers once.$3#$b#It talked about ghosts that had been seen wandering the ranch in fall. It was a question that was never answered. Isn't that strange?$2#$e#Stay positive! I'll see you soon, okay?",
"Marnie_fall_Sat8": "I learned early in life that ambition is a good thing, but don't let it ruin your life. Start small!#$b#If I had bought a ranch this size when I started out, it would have swallowed me whole.$4#$e#What a week! Hope you have a great weekend, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Sun8": "To be with friends and loved ones till the end of my days, that's what I hope to accomplish.#$b#It's going to be a lot of work, but it's my dream!$1#$e#I'm so tired! I'm glad the week is over now. See you, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Mon10": "I've had a lot on my mind lately. Can I tell this to you in confidence, @? I'm thinking about leaving Lewis.$3#$b#I can't hide our relationship anymore. If he continues to protest, that's it. I'm done.$3#$e#Lot's to think about. See you later, @.$3",
"Marnie_fall_Tue10": "Love shouldn't mean hiding it away. It should be something free of shame. Yet, why does Lewis still persist in having us be like this?$3#$b#It's sick, I think. I can't take it anymore.$3#$e#I'm shaking just thinking about it.$2",
"Marnie_fall_Wed10": "It's painful to have a choice like the one I'm about to make. It's like, what's the point of being together if there has to be such crazy pressure, over nothing?$3#$e#I'm not sure what to do...$3",
"Marnie_fall_Thu10": "I know I won't leave Lewis. I can't. I love him too much. But I need to find the strength to talk about this with him.$3#$b#I can't keep hiding it, you know? @, you've been with me through so much. I know you understand.$3#$e#We'll see what I do...see you, @.$3",
"Marnie_fall_Fri10": "Someday, everything will be truly peaceful. I look forward to that time, because right now, I can't see it.$2#$b#Sorry, @. Just really getting down today.$3#$e#Thanks for coming by. You've made me smile.",
"Marnie_fall_Sat10": "What a year so far, @! I can't tell you enough what your visits mean to me. You're a great friend!$1#$e#Have a wonderful day. I'll see you soon!",
"Marnie_fall_Sun10": "I'll never know exactly if what Lewis and I are doing is right or wrong. I just know that I love him.$3#$b#I hope that, someday, we can just move past this insanity.#$e#See you, @! Thanks for stopping by.",
"Marnie_fall_Mon2_inlaw_Shane": "Shane can really hold his beer. Once, we had a contest to see who could drink more.#$b#We were both losers in that one. Makes me sick just to think about.$3#$e#Have a good one, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Sat2_inlaw_Shane": "When Pelican Pale Ale stopped getting made, no one took it harder than Shane. It was one of his favorite drinks.#$b#Such a shame, you know? It really was the best.#$e#Have a good one, okay, @?",
"Marnie_fall_Mon4_inlaw_Shane": "Shane loves pizza, and his favorite is the pizza Gus makes at the Stardrop Saloon!#$b#It really is good pizza. Have you had the chance to try it?#$e#Have a great one, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Sat4_inlaw_Shane": "How great it is to be in love. It's a wonderful feeling. I'm so glad you have Shane to be there for you!#$b#It fills me with such happiness. It really does.#$e#Have a good one, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Mon6_inlaw_Shane": "Shane's love of chickens is so great, I once called him, for a time, Mr. Clucks. He didn't like it very much.#$b#He preferred Sir Cluckington the Third! What a guy.$4#$e#Have a good day, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Sat6_inlaw_Shane": "Crazy, how life works out. I never thought, when you first came to town, you'd end up with Shane, and yet, you have!#$b#Life can be truly amazing. Very romantic!#$e#Have a great one, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Mon8_inlaw_Shane": "The chickens trust Shane, it's nice to see. When they would get excited and rough, I'd have Shane help out.#$b#They'd calm down almost instantly, can you believe that? Crazy.$1#$e#Have a wonderful time today, @!",
"Marnie_fall_Sat8_inlaw_Shane": "Shane and I drank ourselves to your marriage, @. It was a wonderful time.#$b#I'll be honest, I do miss him. I'm just glad it's you he's with, and not someone else!$2#$e#Have a great day, okay, @?",
"Marnie_winter_1": "The chill of the air, the white of the snow, it's winter! I'm excited for this winter. I think it will be wonderful.$1#$e#Happy winter! Make it a great one!$1",
"Marnie_winter_Mon": "Winter is a great time to give animals a lot of love. Cuddle up with them, keep them warm, and you might be surprised!#$e#See you again soon, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Tue": "What would you rather cuddle with, a lot of rabbits, or a couple of cows?#$b#Either could keep you warm, but the rabbits wouldn't stay still for very long.#$e#Have a great day, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Wed": "The snow is so peaceful, I love it. I used to light candles and just watch the snow.#$e#Now, I keep the windows open all season, and enjoy the sight!$1#$e#I hope you have a great night tonight, @! See you!",
"Marnie_winter_Thu": "Not all animals can brave the cold like rabbits. Others need some extra help to stay warm.$2#$b#A little extra work is a small cost for a happy animal!#$e#Enjoy the rest of your day!",
"Marnie_winter_Fri": "Nothing breaks my heart faster than a shivering animal. I do my best to make sure all of my animals have the best comfort.$3#$b#They aren't just beasts. They are living beings!#$e#Stay positive! I'll see you soon, okay?",
"Marnie_winter_Sat": "This is the best time of year to enjoy a good time at the Stardrop Saloon. Delicious drinks, warm atmosphere, and great friends.$1#$b#I look forward to it every day! It's my home away from home.#$e#What a week! Hope you have a great weekend, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Sun": "It's been extra cold lately. I hope all the woodland creatures are staying warm.$2#$b#It's a shame foxes aren't domesticated. Imagine having foxes protect your farm, as opposed to stealing chickens.$4#$e#I'm so tired! I'm glad the week is over now. See you, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Mon2": "When I was a kid, I didn't have a pet dog or cat. Instead I had a pet rabbit!#$b#Her name was Lucy Fidgets, and like her name, she could never stay still for very long.$1#$e#See you again soon, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Tue2": "My pet rabbit, Lucy Fidgets, was a lover. She loved to be pet, but don't pick her up!#$b#If you dared pick her up, you would incur her wrath! I learned quickly where her boundaries were.$4#$e#Have a great day, @!",
"Marnie_Marnie_winter_Wed2": "Owning a rabbit is a lot of work, despite what most people think. I wish they were considered an exotic pet.$2#$b#So many things can cause a rabbit to die. They are so fragile!$3#$e#I hope you have a great night tonight, @! See you!",
"Marnie_winter_Thu2": "Luckily the rabbits I have here on the farm are made of sterner stuff than pet rabbits. My rabbits aren't afraid of other livestock.#$b#Rest assured, my rabbits are iron clad bunnies!$1#$e#Enjoy the rest of your day!",
"Marnie_winter_Fri2": "My rabbit lived for a very long time, which I consider myself lucky for. She died when I was in high school.#$b#I still miss her, little Lucy Fidgets. I bet she'd like you, @!$3#$e#Stay positive! I'll see you soon, okay?",
"Marnie_winter_Sat2": "There's animals as pets, then there's animals for livestock. Pet animals are important because they can bring such joy!#$b#I'm glad I've had the pets I've had. I count myself lucky for not having too many issues with them.$1#$e#What a week! Hope you have a great weekend, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Sun2": "I had a friend in high school who had a pet snake. That was an interesting animal.#$b#It liked to be worn as a necklace, and enjoyed long walks outside.$1#$b#Just because a pet may seem scary, it could hide a big heart!#$e#I'm so tired! I'm glad the week is over now. See you, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Mon4": "How's this year been treating you, @? You've been so busy. I'm glad you're keeping it up.$1#$b#It's awkward to support people who lose motivation so easily. You're a tough one!$2#$e#See you again soon, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Tue4": "Do you like winter? It must be hard to not be able to grow too many crops outside. That's why there's animals, I suppose.$2#$e#Have a great day, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Wed4": "Time goes by so fast. The older you get, the more it seems to speed up. I wonder how fast it will be for me in the future?$2#$b#Let's try to stay sane and calm, right, @?#$e#I hope you have a great night tonight, @! See you!",
"Marnie_winter_Thu4": "If you could go back in time, would you? It's a difficult question for some people.#$b#I would, for one particular reason. Who knows how that would change my future, though?$3#$b#It's definitely interesting to think about. Especially on a snow-covered day like today.#$e#Enjoy the rest of your day!",
"Marnie_winter_Fri4": "I'm feeling sick. I hope I don't catch something serious! Who could do my work for me?$3#$b#I'll have to turn in early. Send me good wishes, @!$2#$e#Stay positive! I'll see you soon, okay?",
"Marnie_winter_Sat4": "Tonight is a night for the fireplace. Maybe drink some of the good stuff!#$b#I better get everything done in time. It's going to be a night to remember.$1#$e#What a week! Hope you have a great weekend, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Sun4": "I may have overdone it last night. I'm paying for it today, though. In spades.$2#$e#Have a good one, @. Drink in moderation.$3",
"Marnie_winter_Mon6": "I enjoy watching movies with Jas. She's always so quiet during them, but sometimes, she smiles.#$b#Cartoon classics, action movies, she's a big fan of scary movies, but I'm not.$4#$b#I'm just glad we can connect, in some way.$1#$e#See you again soon, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Tue6": "If Jas grows up to be a good person, I will be relieved. I worry about her.$3#$b#She's been through too much, more than any kid should.$3#$e#Have a great day, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Wed6": "I've been working on a side project lately, @. It's nothing too crazy, but I hope it can make Jas smile.#$b#They are little dolls! Various animals and things. I seem to have knack for knitting!$1#$e#I hope you have a great night tonight, @! See you!",
"Marnie_winter_Thu6": "When I was a girl, I hated everything about fashion, especially knitting. My grandmother always tried to show me, but I wouldn't have it.$3#$b#Now, I'm helplessly addicted to it, and I wish she was still here to teach me!#$e#Enjoy the rest of your day!",
"Marnie_winter_Fri6": "I have idea for a whole line of knitted animal characters. Maybe I can get them sold at Pierre's? Wouldn't that be something?#$b#Not yet, though. I'm still new. Maybe someday!$2#$e#Stay positive! I'll see you soon, okay?",
"Marnie_winter_Sat6": "Jas requested something for me to knit! The pressure is on, @.#$b#Luckily, I'm all caught up, and can take a stab at it!#$b#Pun not intended, I hope...$2#$e#What a week! Hope you have a great weekend, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Sun6": "Hey, @. How have things been with you? Staying warm? You don't want to get sick!#$e#I'm so tired! I'm glad the week is over now. See you, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Mon8": "Haven't been able to sleep lately...been having terrible nightmares.$3#$b#Maybe tonight they will stop? It's hard to know. Trying to stay positive.$3#$e#See you again soon, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Tue8": "I've been enjoying warming up at night with my special lover! Is that wrong to say out loud? I can't help it!$1#$e#Have a great day, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Wed8": "The Stardrop Saloon has been rocking this season! It's been a lot of fun. I just love Gus so much.$1#$b#We should get drinks sometime there, @!#$e#I hope you have a great night tonight, @! See you!",
"Marnie_winter_Thu8": "I'm looking forward to this weekend, @. I plan on going all out. I've been saving up for a really good time at the Saloon!$1#$e#Enjoy the rest of your day!",
"Marnie_winter_Fri8": "This year has gone by so fast. I'm glad you're still hanging around, @! Some people were betting you wouldn't last till summer.#$b#You proved them wrong, and I made some cash! We all won.$1#$e#Stay positive! I'll see you soon, okay?",
"Marnie_winter_Sat8": "Warming our hearts, our bellies, and our souls. What a great time it's been lately!$1#$b#I'm so happy I can experience it with everyone, including you, @! Let's do it next year as well!#$e#What a week! Hope you have a great weekend, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Sun8": "Been so focused on having fun, I got behind in my chores! Luckily, the animals didn't seem to mind.$2#$b#I enjoy what I do so much, it never really feels like work. You understand, right @?$1#$e#I'm so tired! I'm glad the week is over now. See you, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Mon10": "In my nightmares, I see my sister. I see her before the accident, happy...$3#$b#It's so painful to think about...I haven't been able to sleep.$3#$e#Hopefully tonight is different. See you, @.$2",
"Marnie_winter_Tue10": "Woke up in a cold sweat. Just terrible dreams. Lewis tried to comfort me, but it didn't help.$2#$b#Why does life have to be so cruel sometimes, @? I try to stay positive, and yet...$3#$e#Hopefully I'll get some sleep tonight, and see you tomorrow.$2",
"Marnie_winter_Wed10": "I got some sleep last night, but it's almost worse. I can focus better now.$3#$b#In the nightmares, my sister is screaming for help, and no one is there. Oh, it's so horrible.$3#$e#I don't even know what to say. See you later, @.$2",
"Marnie_winter_Thu10": "In a lot of ways, I'm not over my sister's death. It's just not fair.$3#$b#I should probably see someone, get some help. It's ruining this time of the year for me.$2#$e#Sorry to be such a downer, @...$3",
"Marnie_winter_Fri10": "My sister's birthday was in winter. Every season, I think about her, and I get these terrible nightmares.$3#$b#She was prettier than me, more successful. Why'd she have to die?$3#$b#People tell me I shouldn't say things like that, but it's so hard sometimes...$2#$e#Thanks for letting me open up, @. You're great. See you tomorrow.",
"Marnie_winter_Sat10": "Feeling better today, @. I had to come to understand a few things, and I talked with Lewis late last night.#$b#My sister would want me to stay positive, stay strong. For her, for Jas, for me. I won't betray her.$1#$e#It may be hard, but it makes us better people. See you, @.",
"Marnie_winter_Sun10": "There's been a lot of ups and downs this year for me, @, but you're one of the good people I've met!$1#$b#I'm so happy we've gotten to know each other. I want you to know, I'll support you no matter what!#$e#I hope we have a great year next year!$1",
"Marnie_winter_Mon2_inlaw_Shane": "It's so cold out, it's a good thing you have one of the warmest people I know to heat you up, @!#$b#Don't tell Shane I said that though. He'd be so embarrassed.#$e#Have a nice day, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Sat2_inlaw_Shane": "The way Shane was with chickens could melt your heart. He loves them, and they love him.#$b#They miss him, they really do. They are so happy when he comes by!#$e#Have a great one, @!$1",
"Marnie_winter_Mon4_inlaw_Shane": "Shane has a hard time getting motivated, but I know someday he'll figure it all out. Especially with you around him, @!#$b#I'm so happy he found someone. Really, I am.$1#$e#Have a good one, okay, @?",
"Marnie_winter_Sat4_inlaw_Shane": "It's a great day out. I hope you are spending the winter with Shane in a joyful way!#$b#Winter is a great time for couples. I hope Shane is treating you right, if you know what I mean.#$e#See you, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Mon6_inlaw_Shane": "Shane and I used to have a yearly battle of the brews, where we'd taste test beer from around the world. It was a lot of fun.#$b#The hangovers were never fun, though, I'll tell you that!#$e#Have a good day, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Sat6_inlaw_Shane": "Jas sometimes wonders if Shane will ever come back and live with us. The innocence of a child.#$b#I haven't tried to explain to her why that's not actually a happy thought.$2#$e#See you, @! Have a good one.",
"Marnie_winter_Mon8_inlaw_Shane": "I'm so happy Shane and you got together. It would have been a much colder winter for him if you weren't there.$3#$b#I know he's thankful you entered his life. As am I!#$e#See you later, @!",
"Marnie_winter_Sat8_inlaw_Shane": "I hope you and Shane are happy for many years, @. It would please me greatly.#$b#I know Jas would be happy too! We're all cheering for you two.$1#$e#Have a wonderful day, @!",


//Pam
"Pam_Introduction": "Hmm?#$b#Name's Pam. What do you want?$4#$b#Typical city folk.$4#$e#See you around, I guess.",
"Pam_Saloon_Entry": "It's drinking time./Toss me a cold one./You know what I need, Gus./Home sweet home./Gimme what I need, Gus./I need the good stuff.",
"Pam_Trailer_Entry": "Penny, go make yourself useful./You disappoint me today, Penny?/I'm home! Blech./Is dinner made yet?",
"Pam_event_credit1": "Who do you think you are? You can't boss me around!$3",
"Pam_event_credit2": "...No? That's too bad...$s#$b#...$s",
"Pam_spring_Mon": "Always with the headaches...why can't I just drink as much as I want?$2#$b#Imagine that. Infinite bliss.#$b#I could really use that.$2#$e#...bye.",
"Pam_spring_Tue": "Mmm. Hmm? What? How long have you been there?#$b#Can't you see I'm busy?$3#$e#Mmm. Hmmm.$2",
"Pam_spring_Wed": "Thinking about the good times today.#$b#What there were, anyway. Not many of them.$2#$b#But when things were good, what a time to be alive.$1#$e#...back to the good stuff.",
"Pam_spring_Thu": "Bugs everywhere. Getting in my drink.#$b#If they want to drink, they can get their own.$3#$e#...or whatever.",
"Pam_spring_Fri": "What's the name of it called? You know. The thing.#$b#No, not that thing. Come on. You know it.$3#$b#What was it? $2#$b#*Pam seems lost in her thoughts...*#$e#...yeah.",
"Pam_spring_Sat": "Thing is, people don't want the truth. If they wanted the truth, they wouldn't need brew.#$b#And I need a lot of it.$2#$e#...Mmm.",
"Pam_spring_Sun": "People talk about wanting a better life, but they never want to do what it takes, you know?$2#$b#Gus knows. It's why I trust him.#$b#I'm his best customer.$1#$e#...hmm?",
"Pam_spring_Mon2": "Hey, it's, you. Your name...#$b#@, that's right. I knew I'd remember it at some point.$2#$b#Now scram.$4#$e#...",
"Pam_spring_Tue2": "It's times like these that I could use another beer.$2#$b#You know what I mean? Then maybe another.#$b#Then...#$b#...another.$4#$e#...bye.",
"Pam_spring_Wed2": "I can outdrink a horse. I've done it.#$b#The full story of that day is complicated.#$b#But I won, fair and square.$1#$e#...see ya.",
"Pam_spring_Thu2": "There's more to life than drinking, you know.#$b#Like, bottle crafting. Or, transportation.#$b#All subjects I'm interested in.#$e#...back to the good stuff.",
"Pam_spring_Fri2": "Being a bus driver is difficult. You never know just who is going to get on.#$b#What they are going to bring with them.$2#$b#It can get scary sometimes.#$e#...or whatever.",
"Pam_spring_Sat2": "Nothing better than a day off well deserved.#$b#In my case, that's every day.#$b#Cheers!$1#$e#...Mmm.",
"Pam_spring_Sun2": "I had too much last night. It just didn't stop.#$b#I might have another to clear my head.#$b#Then we'll see how it goes from there...#$e#...hmm?",
"Pam_spring_Mon4": "You going to stick around tonight, @? Or are you too busy with your chores?#$b#At least you have a direction, right? Or unless you don't?#$b#It don't matter. Let's drink.#$e#...bye.",
"Pam_spring_Tue4": "Penny just doesn't get it. It's not that I'm addicted to the stuff. That's ridiculous.#$b#I just love to drink it. I'm an artist in that way.#$b#Don't judge me.$3#$e#...see ya.",
"Pam_spring_Wed4": "Penny called me scary today.$3#$b#I'm not scary. I'm perfectly fine. She just needs to stop judging me.$3#$b#She just doesn't understand...$2#$e#...back to the good stuff.",
"Pam_spring_Thu4": "Friendship...mmm...$4#$b#I got...Gus. I got...this bottle.$2#$b#Heh...*burp*$1#$e#Mmm...beership? Mm...$4",
"Pam_spring_Fri4": "I could stop at anytime, you know. It's just that, why would I?#$b#I like feeling this way.#$b#I need to feel this way.#$e#...yeah.",
"Pam_spring_Sat4": "I have my regrets. Sure. Doesn't everybody?#$b#I just don't know why me drinking means people can just unleash into me.#$b#Unrelated? What do you know?$3#$e#...Mmm.",
"Pam_spring_Sun4": "It's the end of the week. It all starts over again tomorrow.#$b#I don't look forward to this coming week.#$b#Time for a good luck beer.$1#$e#...hmm?",
"Pam_spring_Mon6": "You know I grew up in a desert? A long way from here. It was a stressful time.#$b#I'm glad I could get out of that place.#$b#Though, sometimes I miss it...$2#$e#...bye.",
"Pam_spring_Tue6": "Growing up in a desert means you're inside during the day, and go out at night.#$b#Spring, it was beautiful.$1#$b#I'm not drunk enough for this talk...$2#$e#...see ya.",
"Pam_spring_Wed6": "Takes one to know one, that's all I'm saying.$4#$b#What? You got a problem with me?$3#$b#Mmm...Whatever your name is.$4#$b#...$2#$e#My head is pounding...$2",
"Pam_spring_Thu6": "Spring in the desert is truly the best. Not too hot, not too cold.#$b#No bugs yet. It's just serene.$1#$b#Imagine that.$2#$e#...or whatever.",
"Pam_spring_Fri6": "You should see my collection of vintage bottles.#$b#Penny tries to get me to throw them out.$4#$b#That's not going to happen.$1#$e#...yeah.",
"Pam_spring_Sat6": "Happy Saturday! Drinks all around!$1#$b#No? There's still work that needs to be done?$4#$b#Yeah, right.#$e#...Mmm.",
"Pam_spring_Sun6": "You'd think I'd get used to hangovers...$2#$b#That maybe my body would get used to them...#$b#But, no. It just hurts.#$e#...hmm?",
"Pam_spring_Mon8": "Hey, it's @, everybody!$1#$b#Kick up a chair and talk with me, @.#$b#Let's share some time together, you and I!#$b#Sorry, I may have had a couple already.$1#$e#...bye.",
"Pam_spring_Tue8": "If you ever brew your own stuff, let me know, @.$1#$b#I could use some brew on the cheap.#$b#I'm not made of money, you know.$3#$e#...see ya.",
"Pam_spring_Wed8": "When I grew up in the desert, I learned something very important.#$b#Try not...$4#$b#...to grow up in the desert.$4#$e#...back to the good stuff.",
"Pam_spring_Thu8": "You come by often, @. Do you have a problem?$4#$b#Just kidding. No judgement here.$1#$b#None at all.$4#$e#...or whatever.",
"Pam_spring_Fri8": "It's almost the weekend. You know what that means, right?#$b#It means it's Saturday and Sunday. Expecting a different answer?#$b#Not from me. *Pam takes a long sip.*#$e#...yeah.",
"Pam_spring_Sat8": "A beautiful day out there, and yet all I want to do is talk to Gus, drink some beer, and then some more.#$b#It's not a pretty life, but it's mine.#$e#...Mmm.",
"Pam_spring_Sun8": "Before coming here, I drove buses all over. It was quite the experience.#$b#It actually paid quite well, so I was able to buy the GOOD booze.#$b#Now look at me!$1#$e#...hmm?",
"Pam_spring_Mon10": "You've come around so often, @. You really care.$1#$b#It's got me thinking about making some changes in my life. Healthy ones, you know?#$b#Like maybe try giving something up for awhile.#$e#...just after this next beer.$1",
"Pam_spring_Tue10": "Penny and Gus say they are starting to get worried about me. I tell them they are crazy. I'm fine.#$b#...but sometimes, I don't feel so fine.$2#$b#I'm glad you're here today, @.#$e#You're a good face.",
"Pam_spring_Wed10": "I worry about my life sometimes, @. I have so much regret.$2#$b#I don't even know where I can begin fixing it all.$2#$b#Maybe I could give it another shot? I just don't know.#$b#You'll be my first positive change, @.$1#$e#Let's drink to that.",
"Pam_spring_Thu10": "I think, once it's all said and done, maybe I can find some peace with it all.#$b#There's so much I've yet to tell you, @.$4#$b#Maybe someday.#$e#It'd be quite the tale...$2",
"Pam_spring_Fri10": "Secret time. I used to look great dressed up as a cat.#$b#What and how, you ask? Well, I'll tell you.#$b#It was a dark night and...#$b#I better stop myself. Just know I used to be a real looker.#$e#Meyow.$1",
"Pam_spring_Sat10": "I just wish I knew how to tell Penny how proud I am of her.$2#$b#I get so angry, so quickly. My emotions run away with me.#$b#Seeing her hurt face...it breaks my heart.$2#$e#I wish I could...*sniff*...fix it all...$2",
"Pam_spring_Sun10": "In the end, I'm happy to have you near, @. You're a positive person in my life.#$b#You also know how to hold your brew, so you have my respect.$1#$e#Let's drink to better times!$1",
"Pam_summer_Mon": "People who stink coming onto my bus are the worse.$4#$b#They get off, but their smell lingers.$3#$b#Just thinking about it makes me sick.$4#$e#...bye.",
"Pam_summer_Tue": "Mmm. Have to drink to cool off from this weather.$4#$b#Then have a little more, and if that doesn't work...$4#$b#...a little more after that.$4#$e#...see ya.",
"Pam_summer_Wed": "Gus understands me. Gus is the best.#$b#Yay for Gus. Yay for me.$1#$b#...what are you staring at?$4#$b#...whatever.$2#$e#...back to the good stuff.",
"Pam_summer_Thu": "People have a hard time respecting me. I don't know why.$2#$b#I'm a hard worker, like the rest of them.$4#$b#I just like to enjoy myself, that's all.$2#$e#...or whatever.",
"Pam_summer_Fri": "Have you met my daughter Penny?#$b#She could really use someone in her life.#$b#She's just so lazy...#$e#...yeah.",
"Pam_summer_Sat": "...so I tell him, get off of my bus!$3#$b#He looks right at me. I stare back at him.#$b#Then, he gets off.$4#$b#What a *burp* loser.#$e#...Mmm.",
"Pam_summer_Sun": "Mmm? What? Can I help you with something?$4#$b#I thought not.$3#$b#Just let me be in peace.$3#$e#...hmm?",
"Pam_summer_Mon2": "Who would ever want to be a farmer? I guess you, @. I just don't get it.#$b#It's hot outside. Who wants to be out there?#$b#I don't get you.$4#$e#...bye.",
"Pam_summer_Tue2": "You want to know heat? This is nothing. I grew up in a far away desert.$3#$b#It was so hot during the day, we could cook an egg on the ground.#$b#At night, it was freezing.$2#$b#Don't complain to me about the heat!$3#$e#...see ya.",
"Pam_summer_Wed2": "People come in all the time and try to say their life is the worst. I laugh.#$b#They don't know what it's really like. They haven't been crushed yet.$1#$b#Not like me.$3#$e#...back to the good stuff.",
"Pam_summer_Thu2": "I'll tell you this, kid. Life isn't going to work out the way you expect it.$4#$b#That's all I've learned. I had dreams and hopes, too, like anyone else.$4#$b#It just doesn't work out sometimes.$4#$e#...or whatever.",
"Pam_summer_Fri2": "I've lived in that trailer awhile now. It's a pretty good place.#$b#Wish Penny wasn't so useless...#$b#*Pam sips her beer.*#$e#...yeah.",
"Pam_summer_Sat2": "Maybe just a water today, Gus. Not really feeling it.$2#$b#Just kidding. Give me a tall one.$1#$b#The tallest you got.$4#$e#...Mmm.",
"Pam_summer_Sun2": "Oh, it's that day of the week again. Which is it?$4#$b#*burp* You know the one. It has the star in its name.$4#$b#...Twinkleday?#$b#Sunday. That's right. I'm...mmm.$4#$e#...hmm?",
"Pam_summer_Mon4": "Hey, it's @! You coming around again? Let's play catch up.#$b#I have the best story to tell you.$1#$b#It goes like this...#$b#...the end. Now scram.$4#$e#...bye.",
"Pam_summer_Tue4": "Penny's around more when it's summer. I give her chores, which she ignores.#$b#She says she doesn't want to clean up my stuff. I say, too bad. It's my house, now clean.#$b#Kids, eh, @?#$e#...see ya.",
"Pam_summer_Wed4": "Raising a child by yourself is tough. I've had to do plenty of things I don't like.$3#$b#You think I enjoy driving the bus?#$b#Actually, I do enjoy driving the bus. Bad example.$1#$e#...back to the good stuff.",
"Pam_summer_Thu4": "Mood swings brought on by alcohol? I have no idea what you mean.$1#$b#I said I have no idea what you mean!$3#$e#...or whatever.",
"Pam_summer_Fri4": "I've lost plenty of friends. They come and go.#$b#The only ones I need in my life is Gus, this glass of beer, and Penny.#$e#...yeah.",
"Pam_summer_Sat4": "Dream big, fall hard. Dream small, stand tall. That's the motto I should have followed.#$b#Instead, I went with, get tossed, get lost.$4#$b#So it goes, I guess.$2#$e#...Mmm.",
"Pam_summer_Sun4": "Oh, boy. The week is ending, and it starts all over again.#$b#Here's hoping next week is better.#$b#*Pam finishes her beer and slams it on the table*#$e#...hmm?",
"Pam_summer_Mon6": "I didn't intend to be a bus driver, you know. I wanted to be a pilot.#$b#Imagine me, soaring through the skies. It would have been wonderful.#$b#I just couldn't pass the tests. I also have bad eyes.$2#$b#I flunked out. Now here we are.$1#$e#...bye.",
"Pam_summer_Tue6": "When I wanted to be a pilot, things were good. It's nice to have a direction.#$b#I fell in love...#$b#Then that became a thing.#$b#Why am I telling you this, @?#$e#...see ya.",
"Pam_summer_Wed6": "I still remember the greatest day of my life. I hold it close.$1#$b#Maybe I'll tell you about it someday, @.#$b#It's a pretty good one.$1#$e#...back to the good stuff.",
"Pam_summer_Thu6": "A friend of mine who lives far away became a pilot. Every so often we'll go flying.#$b#Don't hear much of them lately, though.$2#$b#Can't imagine why. *burp*#$e#...or whatever.",
"Pam_summer_Fri6": "When I got the results of the test that decided my fate as a pilot, I remember the moment I opened the letter.#$b#I ripped it open, and then, it ripped my heart in half.$2#$b#I...$2#$e#...$2",
"Pam_summer_Sat6": "I've done a lot of reflecting this week.#$b#Not anymore, though.$3#$b#Another one for me, Gus.#$b#Make that two!$3#$e#...Mmm.",
"Pam_summer_Sun6": "Maybe someday I'll get the chance to fly.#$b#Who knows.#$b#I'll always want to be a pilot. Deep down.#$b#I guess a bus driver is close enough.$1#$e#...hmm?",
"Pam_summer_Mon8": "I became so focused on getting out of where I was growing up, I let my life slip by a bit.#$b#I worked odd jobs to pay the bills, but never got anywhere.#$b#It wasn't until the bus job that I could get out, for real.$2#$b#And I did.#$e#...bye.",
"Pam_summer_Tue8": "Nothing is worse than being in a place where you feel like you don't belong.$2#$b#It took me a long time to feel okay to be me.#$b#It's why I'm here so often.$2#$e#...see ya.",
"Pam_summer_Wed8": "Penny can't look at me sometimes.#$b#It kills me.#$b#I just don't know what to do.$2#$b#I hate being such a failure.$4#$e#...back to the good stuff.",
"Pam_summer_Thu8": "You meet all kinds of people on the bus. Some better than others.#$b#The friends you make, however? A cherished thing.$1#$e#...or whatever.",
"Pam_summer_Fri8": "The bus is nice during summer, because it has air conditioning. Some people ride the bus to escape the heat.#$b#...but imagine when that AC breaks down$3?#$b#Gus, give me a tall one, quick!$1",
"Pam_summer_Sat8": "I haven't been back to where I grew up in a long time.#$b#Lots of problems still waiting there.#$b#Yet, I do get homesick from time to time.#$b#I crave one more blissful night.#$e#...Mmm.",
"Pam_summer_Sun8": "When I think back to everything, I can say that Penny has been a great joy.$1#$b#Just wish I knew how to talk to her, and tell her that.$2#$b#I'd like to do it before...$4#$b#Nevermind.#$e#...hmm?",
"Pam_summer_Mon10": "@, it's always good to see you. What crazy story do you have for us today?#$b#I still can't believe you took on your grandfather's farm.#$b#I knew him you know. What a guy.#$e#Handsome, too.$1",
"Pam_summer_Tue10": "Who knew you'd stick around so long, @?#$b#Crazy to think about, but I'm happy for it.#$b#Drinks all around! Cheers to @!$1#$e#We'll make this a night to remember.",
"Pam_summer_Wed10": "I never thought I'd meet someone like you, @. You're quite the catch.#$b#If I'm being honest, it gives me some hope that I can change my life around.#$b#Just have to take that first step.#$e#Someday I'll do it.",
"Pam_summer_Thu10": "What? What do you want?$3#$b#Oh. It's you. $4#$b#Don't mind me right now.#$e#I said don't mind me!$3",
"Pam_summer_Fri10": "Yesterday was a day I did not want to remember.#$b#I drank a bit too much, and so, don't remember it.#$b#Sorry if I was mean to you at all, @.#$e#At least I'm through it now.",
"Pam_summer_Sat10": "Someone called me beautiful today.#$b#I'm not sure if they were joking or not.#$b#It felt...nice. Hadn't been called that in a long time.#$e#A long time...$2",
"Pam_summer_Sun10": "Let me tell you about the greatest day of my life.#$b#It was on a date with the man I loved, at sunset, the day before I took the test that failed me out of being a pilot.#$b#The sky was orange.#$b#All was peaceful.#$b#I knew happiness then.#$e#I'll hold that moment with me forever.",
"Pam_fall_Mon": "Mmm. Fall beverages taste best.#$b#I could drink these all year long, but there's something about fall.#$b#...what are you staring at?#$e#...bye.",
"Pam_fall_Tue": "You going to keep coming around often? What was your name again?#$b#@? Knew someone called that once.#$b#Didn't like them.#$e#...see ya.",
"Pam_fall_Wed": "The cold is coming. Which means there's only one solution.$2#$b#Give me another, Gus. Just keep them coming.#$b#After this week, I'm going to need it.#$e#...back to the good stuff.",
"Pam_fall_Thu": "People who ride the bus think that I'm lesser than them.#$b#I can see it in their eyes.#$b#How dare they? It gets me so mad.$3#$e#...or whatever.",
"Pam_fall_Fri": "I've seen many things in my life, but nothing as crazy as your face.$1#$b#*burp* Just kidding. Wait, I got a better one.$4#$b#What if...you were a cat?#$b#*burp*#$e#...yeah.",
"Pam_fall_Sat": "I'm tired of all this. I need to get away.#$b#But to where? Now that I think about it...#$b#I think I'll just have another.#$e#...Mmm.",
"Pam_fall_Sun": "Hear that? It's the sound of my respect for you.#$b#...#$b#Get it? Scram.#$e#...hmm?",
"Pam_fall_Mon2": "@ is here. Everyone be on your best behavior.$4#$b#Just kidding, do what you want.#$b#Isn't that right, @? You're pretty open.#$e#...bye.",
"Pam_fall_Tue2": "Penny's so busy with teaching she's never around.$2#$b#Who else is going to clean up?#$b#Certainly not me, that's for sure! It's my house! $3#$e#...see ya.",
"Pam_fall_Wed2": "When the brew is this good, I can't help myself.#$b#Give it a try, @. You might like it.#$b#Or not. Whatever.#$e#...back to the good stuff.",
"Pam_fall_Thu2": "...$4#$b#Just realized...$4#$b#That, with all my heart...$4#$b#I really like beer.$1#$e#...or whatever.",
"Pam_fall_Fri2": "Sunsets in fall are interesting. They happen earlier, and it gets so cold.#$b#Walking home at night really sucks.#$b#Better order one more to warm myself up.#$e#...yeah.",
"Pam_fall_Sat2": "I smell something...earthy.#$b#Is that you, @? Do you smell earthy?#$b#No, maybe it isn't you...$2#$b#I wonder what it could be.#$e#...Mmm.",
"Pam_fall_Sun2": "I do love seeing the planes in fall. It's much easier to spot them.#$b#I'd explain why but...it gets a bit complicated.$2#$b#You wouldn't understand, city person.#$e#...hmm?",
"Pam_fall_Mon4": "We've been getting along for some time now, haven't we?#$b#Pull up a seat and have a drink with me.#$b#I could use the company.#$e#...bye.",
"Pam_fall_Tue4": "Wanna know something about me? I used to want to be a pilot.$1#$b#I still do, but it didn't work out.#$b#Now, it really wouldn't work out.$2#$e#...see ya.",
"Pam_fall_Wed4": "What do you want? Can I help you?$4#$b#You keep coming around here and I don't know why. Do you have a problem with me?$3#$b#Just go away already.#$e#...back to the good stuff.",
"Pam_fall_Thu4": "I really drank hard yesterday. I think I was mean to you.#$b#I apologize, @.$2#$b#I'm not like that all the time, I swear.#$e#...or whatever.",
"Pam_fall_Fri4": "I wonder if Penny...no. I shouldn't even say it.#$b#Not like it matters anyway.$2#$b#She just does what she does, I guess.$4#$e#...yeah.",
"Pam_fall_Sat4": "It's a Saturday in Fall, so let's all drink to our health.$1#$b#Or maybe drink to our unhealth.#$b#Get it? Cause ghosts and stuff.$1#$b#Whatever. *Pam downs her drink.*$4#$e#...Mmm.",
"Pam_fall_Sun4": "Gus really knows how to make food that hits the spot.#$b#Not even my own mother could cook this good.#$e#...hmm?",
"Pam_fall_Mon6": "This time of year reminds me of a good friend of mine I lost, years ago.#$b#Her name was Bev. We had some wild adventures together.$1#$b#What happened to Bev? Why can't she be here now? It's a long story.#$e#...bye.",
"Pam_fall_Tue6": "My dear friend Bev got me into lots of trouble.#$b#One time, she hotwired a car, and we drove through the desert with it.#$b#Turns out it was her boyfriend's car.$1#$b#I guy I had a crush on.$3#$b#Good ol' Bev.$1#$e#...see ya.",
"Pam_fall_Wed6": "When I think back to the times I spent with Bev, I just get so sad.#$b#Losing a friend is difficult for anyone. But this was different.#$b#With her, I lost a part of myself.#$e#...back to the good stuff.",
"Pam_fall_Thu6": "I remember when I got the news that Bev was gone.#$b#I walked into another room, closed the door, and collapsed. It was the last straw of my life.#$b#Then I took up this.#$b#*Pam waves her glass around.*#$b#Bottoms up.#$e#...or whatever.",
"Pam_fall_Fri6": "Is friendship really worth it, if there's always an ending?$4#$b#Like with you, @. Will you leave me too?$4#$b#What if I beat you to it, huh? Just go!$3#$e#...mmm.$4",
"Pam_fall_Sat6": "I'm sorry, @, if I snapped at you yesterday. I'm not the best at controlling my emotions.$2#$b#Been thinking a lot about old friends and...it'd be a shame to lose you, too.$1#$e#...Mmm.",
"Pam_fall_Sun6": "Here's hoping we can become proper friends, @. And maybe you can become friends with my Penny, too.#$b#Then we could all be *burp* friends.#$e#...hmm?",
"Pam_fall_Mon8": "Why do I drink so much? Do I need any one reason?$4#$b#Gets me through the day.$4#$b#It lets me be me again.$4#$b#People say I have a problem, and I say, no, I have a solution.$3#$b#A very expensive solution.$2#$e#...bye.",
"Pam_fall_Tue8": "I've tried to go sober before. I just thought about everything too much.$2#$b#This is better. I feel like me again.#$b#It just takes awhile to get there.$2#$e#...see ya.",
"Pam_fall_Wed8": "Penny wants me to go clean, but it's not that simple.#$b#I've seen the disappoint in her eyes...I don't know how to heal that.$2#$b#I wouldn't even know where to start.$2#$e#...back to the good stuff.",
"Pam_fall_Thu8": "Sometimes things go clear, and I make a plan for myself, and I know I can stop all this.#$b#Then it goes away.#$b#Good riddance.#$e#...or whatever.",
"Pam_fall_Fri8": "Nothing stings more than knowing you are disappointing people.$2#$b#Luckily, we have this to make that sting go away.#$b#Like a shield of gold.$1#$e#...yeah.",
"Pam_fall_Sat8": "Drink up, @. It's the weekend.$1#$b#What better time than to kick back, relax, and swap stories?#$b#...so got any?$1#$e#...Mmm.",
"Pam_fall_Sun8": "Nothing else to do today but have a good time and exist in the moment.#$b#So why not do that?$1#$e#...hmm?",
"Pam_fall_Mon10": "This time of year reminds me of when I lost my fiance.#$b#We were never married. He went off to war.$4#$b#Then, he was gone.$2#$e#...gone so fast.",
"Pam_fall_Tue10": "We had all these plans. I'd become a pilot, he'd become a professor.#$b#He learned he loved to teach while training for the war.$1#$b#...it's where Penny gets it from.$2#$e#...I see so much of him in her.$2",
"Pam_fall_Wed10": "Penny never met her father, as he was gone before she was born.#$b#You wouldn't believe how much alike they are, though, @. It's almost scary.$2#$e#And at times, too painful.",
"Pam_fall_Thu10": "You know when you've found the one. I used to make fun of that cliche, but it's true.#$b#Which makes losing that person all the more harder.#$b#There's just no one else like them.#$e#...and there won't be again.$2",
"Pam_fall_Fri10": "It takes a lot for me to become comfortable with people, @. I know I'm standoffish. I can't help it.#$b#But you, you're different. It's like you actually care.#$b#Thank you, @.$1#$e#*sniff.*$1",
"Pam_fall_Sat10": "In the end, we only have our friends and family to rely on.#$b#I've been horrible to many people.$2#$b#Maybe there's a chance to change all that?#$b#What do you think, @?$1#$e#I think I have a shot.",
"Pam_fall_Sun10": "Maybe it's too late for me. Maybe it isn't. I never thought I'd have another person I'd care about in my life.#$b#Then, you came along, @. So I suppose it's not impossible.#$e#Funny how it all works out, isn't it?",
"Pam_winter_Mon": "Oh, it's you, @.$4#$b#I've just been here.$4#$b#Doing my usual.#$b#Anything else I can help you with?#$e#...bye.",
"Pam_winter_Tue": "Driving a bus during winter can get scary.#$b#Especially if it has snowed.$2#$b#I don't like it one bit.#$e#...see ya.",
"Pam_winter_Wed": "Things are getting a bit tiring. It's all the snow we've had.#$b#It's freezing when I walk home at night. I don't like it.$3#$e#...back to the good stuff.",
"Pam_winter_Thu": "There's just too much snow. I grew up in the desert, we rarely had snow.#$b#Now, look. It's everywhere.$3#$e#...see ya.",
"Pam_winter_Fri": "Sometimes, when I see a snowman...#$b#*burp* I'll push it over.#$b#Hahahahaha. *burp*$1#$e#...back to the good stuff.",
"Pam_winter_Sat": "What's my problem? What's YOUR problem?$3#$b#I was just sitting here. You came up to me.#$b#Get lost.$4#$e#...$4",
"Pam_winter_Sun": "So glad Gus has the fireplace.#$b#It's very relaxing.#$b#Almost...too much so.$4#$b#*Pam drifts off into her own thoughts.*$4",
"Pam_winter_Mon2": "Cold. Wet. Whatever.$4#$b#Give me another one, Gus, because I'm here till the snow melts.$1#$e#...bye.",
"Pam_winter_Tue2": "Sometimes, in the morning, you can see where people fell in the snow on their way home from the Saloon.#$b#Not mine, though. I never fall.#$b#...sometimes.$2#$e#...see ya.",
"Pam_winter_Wed2": "Penny tells me I should use winter as a time to read. Who wants to do that?#$b#Rather go to the Saloon and catch up on all the gossip.$1#$e#...back to the good stuff.",
"Pam_winter_Thu2": "Here's some gossip you might find interesting. Someone named Pam thinks you should scram.$3#$b#She told me herself.#$e#...or whatever.",
"Pam_winter_Fri2": "Must be hard to be a farmer during winter.#$b#Why not try being a bus driver?$4#$b#Then you can complain with me.$1#$e#...yeah.",
"Pam_winter_Sat2": "The world gets so quiet at night. I can't take it.#$b#I need noise to function.#$b#When it gets too quiet, I feel like I'm losing my mind.$2#$e#...Mmm.",
"Pam_Pam_winter_Sun2": "Mmmm. Hmmm? What?$4#$b#Was...who?$4#$b#Yeah. I'll just...$4#$b#Mmm?$4#$e#Mmm...$4",
"Pam_winter_Mon4": "I will admit, I still enjoy Cactus Fruit. None tasted as good as where I'm from, of course.#$b#But it's always a treat when I can get it.$1#$e#...bye.",
"Pam_winter_Tue4": "I also love parsnips. Odd, isn't it? But true.#$b#Can't beat a good parsnip soup.#$e#...see ya.",
"Pam_winter_Wed4": "I'm not a fan of octopus, of any size or kind.#$b#They creep me out.$2#$b#However, having eight hands wouldn't be so bad...$4#$e#...back to the good stuff.",
"Pam_winter_Thu4": "I've had nightmares where all the beer in the world is controlled by octopus business owners.#$b#I try to fight back, but it's in vain.#$b#Such are my dreams.$4#$e#...or whatever.",
"Pam_winter_Fri4": "There's been a long standing belief in Pelican Town that Holly is cursed.#$b#I hate the stuff myself.#$b#So don't give me any.$3#$e#...yeah.",
"Pam_winter_Sat4": "Winter is a good time to reflect on things one likes.#$b#And also, things one doesn't like.$2#$b#However, for me, one thing is the best.#$b#Cheers.$1#$e#...Mmm.",
"Pam_winter_Sun4": "If an octopus appeared, wearing holly, but offered me beer?#$b#I'd have to say that's a fine octopus indeed.#$e#...hmm?",
"Pam_winter_Mon6": "You may not know this about me, but I love musicals.$1#$b#I can sit through any of them, no matter how bad.#$b#I'm a terrible singer, though...$1#$e#...bye.",
"Pam_winter_Tue6": "I love to dance, but I haven't done it in awhile.#$b#It's how I met my...#$b#Nevermind.$2#$e#...see ya.",
"Pam_winter_Wed6": "I've danced so hard I collapsed on the floor from exhaustion. Those were some times.#$b#Not so much these days.$2#$b#Nothing to dance to.#$e#...back to the good stuff.",
"Pam_winter_Thu6": "One of these days we're going to have to dance together, @.#$b#Just not today.#$b#Maybe...next year.#$e#...or whatever.",
"Pam_winter_Fri6": "I might tell you more about my favorite musicals someday.#$b#It's a bit embarrassing.$2#$b#I'm addicted, really.$1#$e#...yeah.",
"Pam_winter_Sat6": "No one would ever make a musical about my life.#$b#If they did, it would be about sad, disappointing things.#$b#One after another.#$b#No one would see it.$4#$e#...Mmm.",
"Pam_winter_Sun6": "...#$b#...Mmm? Oh.#$b#Sorry, @. I'm...feeling sick today.#$e#...hmm?",
"Pam_winter_Mon8": "Winter is way different in the desert I come from.#$b#It never got too cold, and the trees that we did have never lost their leaves.#$b#Living there was like what being preserved would feel like.#$e#...bye.",
"Pam_winter_Tue8": "Sometimes winter can be beautiful here in Pelican Town.#$b#It's just so cold.$2#$b#How can anyone stand it?$3#$b#Yet we get through it.#$e#...see ya.",
"Pam_winter_Wed8": "My favorite musical is about a young woman who is just trying to make it in life.#$b#She finds a stone that makes it all come true, and yet, somehow, it makes her very unhappy...$2#$b#I can sing it all by heart.$1#$e#...back to the good stuff.",
"Pam_winter_Thu8": "You need good music in a musical, obviously, but also good writing.#$b#While I enjoy bad musicals, sometimes...$2#$b#It can become unbearable.$4#$e#...or whatever.",
"Pam_winter_Fri8": "When I was a young girl, I got up to sing for a talent show.#$b#I had never sung in front of an audience before, or anyone really.#$b#I wish I had, because then they might have told me how bad I was at singing.$1#$b#I'm still embarrassed.$2#$e#...yeah.",
"Pam_winter_Sat8": "I should make a musical about someone from the desert who has to survive in the snow for a winter.#$b#I'd call it...#$b#Hmm...#$e#...",
"Pam_winter_Sun8": "Have you ever heard the musical about a star that dropped some dew into a valley?#$b#It has nothing to do with Stardew Valley, oddly enough.#$b#It's about stock-trading.$4#$e#...hmm?",
"Pam_winter_Mon10": "I've been searching for happy memories lately...$2#$b#I think about when Penny was born and I...#$b#...what have I done.$2#$e#...$2",
"Pam_winter_Tue10": "When my fiance died, I had to raise Penny by myself. I was so terrified. Still am.#$b#I know I could have done a better job but...#$b#I guess I'll never get that chance.$2#$e#...$2",
"Pam_winter_Wed10": "Penny is so much like her father that it became difficult to be around her sometimes.#$b#It would tear my heart out.#$b#Just thinking about it...$2#$e#...",
"Pam_winter_Thu10": "@, I'm glad you keep coming around. I need someone to vent to.#$b#Not today, though. Other days.#$e#Thanks for being you.",
"Pam_winter_Fri10": "I remember when I first met you, @. I didn't know what to think. I wrote you off.#$b#I realize now the mistake I made. I know I've done the same to others.$2#$b#Now it's time for some changes.#$e#All thanks to you! Imagine that.$1",
"Pam_winter_Sat10": "What a year it's been. Let's drink to new friends, and lasting joy.#$b#*Gulp.*#$e#Cheers!",
"Pam_winter_Sun10": "That's right. I wanted to tell you, @...#$b#...maybe I'll save that for another time.#$e#Sorry.$1",
"Pam_spring_Sat2_inlaw_Penny": "If you hurt Penny in anyway, you'll regret everything.$4#$b#Everything.$4#$b#EVERYTHING.$3#$e#...",
"Pam_spring_Sat4_inlaw_Penny": "I'm not surprised she went for someone like you.$4#$b#I just hope you'll be worth it.$4#$b#I'm not impressed.$2#$e#Just speaking my mind.",
"Pam_spring_Sat6_inlaw_Penny": "I suppose you're not too bad. Not that it matters.#$b#Try harder maybe?#$e#Then maybe you'll be something.",
"Pam_spring_Sat8_inlaw_Penny": "Penny was telling me you're pretty good, so, I'm glad.#$b#I worry, you know. All mothers do.#$e#Don't disappoint me.",
"Pam_spring_Sat10_inlaw_Penny": "I'm glad it was you, in the end. I just couldn't imagine Penny with anyone.#$b#But you're someone special.#$e#And I'm thankful for that.",
"Pam_summer_Sat2_inlaw_Penny": "It's not that I'm not impressed with you, it's just...#$b#I thought she could do better?$2#$e#Just speaking my mind...",
"Pam_summer_Sat4_inlaw_Penny": "You're not my first choice, or second, or third. But Penny likes you.#$b#Wonder how long that will last.$2#$e#*burp* Not long.",
"Pam_summer_Sat6_inlaw_Penny": "I can't say I'm happy about the arrangement, but you're starting to win me over.#$b#But this war is long from over.$3#$e#Be on your guard.",
"Pam_summer_Sat8_inlaw_Penny": "Penny has a lot of faith and trust in you. Don't waste that.#$b#Not like I did...$2#$e#...$2",
"Pam_summer_Sat10_inlaw_Penny": "Hey, @. So glad you came to see me. How are things?#$b#It's always a pleasure to talk with you.$1#$e#I hope it's a pleasure to talk to me!",
"Pam_fall_Sat2_inlaw_Penny": "You may be a part of the family, but don't think you can tell me what to do.$3#$b#Mind your own business.$3#$e#*burp*",
"Pam_fall_Sat4_inlaw_Penny": "I was hoping maybe Penny would come to her senses, but she never did. Rarely does.#$b#You better not hurt her. I don't trust you not to.$3#$e#...",
"Pam_fall_Sat6_inlaw_Penny": "Things fall apart, sure. So if your marriage is crumbling, just send her home.#$b#It's getting a bit messy without her.$1#$e#What's with the look on your face?$4",
"Pam_fall_Sat8_inlaw_Penny": "Maybe things could be different now that you're with Penny. You're a part of the family now.#$b#So what do you want to know?#$e#Wait, let me have another round first...",
"Pam_fall_Sat10_inlaw_Penny": "If you keep coming in to the Saloon, you'll have to become my new drinking buddy.#$b#Imagine that. We've come a long way, haven't we?#$e#...haven't we?$2",
"Pam_winter_Sat2_inlaw_Penny": "You *burp* taking my girl away from me? You think you're so special?$3#$b#Whatever. Whatever.$4#$e#*burp* Whatever.$4",
"Pam_winter_Sat4_inlaw_Penny": "Hello @-in-law. I see you decided to show up.#$b#Don't you have some work to do?#$e#Even if you think you don't...you do.",
"Pam_winter_Sat6_inlaw_Penny": "You keeping her warm? Wait. Don't answer that.#$b#I already know the answer is...#$b#...not warm enough.#$e#...$4",
"Pam_winter_Sat8_inlaw_Penny": "How's Penny been treating you? Good?#$b#If not, I'm always available.#$b#Hahaha!$1#$e#But seriously, I hope she's doing good.",
"Pam_winter_Sat10_inlaw_Penny": "In the end, it's all about family, isn't it? I'm glad I have you, @.#$b#Imagine if you were another me!$1#$b#That'd be something.$3#$e#So just be yourself, forever. That'd be great.",

//Willy (working)
"Willy_Introduction": "It seems I've caught a new Farmer! Welcome, good to meet you! Nice to have new faces in the valley.#$e#Have a good day!",
"Willy_spring_1": "Another new year full of fishing adventures is ahead of us. Here's to good luck!$1#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_spring_Mon": "You can catch fish, but have you ever caught a treasure chest?#$b#I wonder if the fish keep their belongings in them.$2#$e#Stay focused, stay fishing. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_spring_Tue": "There are as many types of fish as there are people. Some come out in the rain, others at night.#$b#Some like the warm waters of summer, other the cold of winter.#$b#Myself? I like my water lukewarm.$1#$e#Keep it up, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_spring_Wed": "My ol' man was a fisherman, my grandfather a captain. I sailed between far away islands, learning the life.#$b#I learned fish hate it when they are tickled.#$e#Good to see you. Have a good one.",
"Willy_spring_Thu": "I met a Smallmouth Bass once who had an eye for art. It's true. How do I know this?#$b#The answer is a fisherman's secret.$3#$e#Keep the good work going. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_spring_Fri": "Sardines are popular the world over. I, personally, can't stand them.#$e#Enjoy today, and keep fishing. See you, @.",
"Willy_spring_Sat": "I have a halibut story for you.#$b#Just kidding, it was a red herring.$1#$e#Have a great day, @. See you soon.",
"Willy_spring_Sun": "Never throw your trash into the water.#$b#Think I'm kidding? Beware.#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_spring_Mon2": "This year, I'll catch it. The The Fish of Legend will be mine.#$b#They say it can appear anywhere. It bites down so hard, your bones break.#$b#It can't just be a legend, right?$#$e#Stay focused, stay fishing. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_spring_Tue2": "I thought I had the The Fish of Legend earlier, but it turned out to be just a bunch of trash.#$e#Keep it up, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_spring_Wed2": "I went to a carnival as a child, where a man said he had the The Fish of Legend on display.#$b#I believed it until my ol' Man said it was just a dried sea bass.#$e#Good to see you. Have a good one.",
"Willy_spring_Thu2": "One of my favorite birthday gifts was a book that list special fish that could be found around the world.#$b#I lost it somewhere. I wonder where it could be now?#$e#Keep the good work going. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_spring_Fri2": "The The Fish of Legend waits for no one. It stalks the night. It has red eyes, green scales, and a hankering for cheese.#$b#But what kind of cheese, I wonder?#$e#Enjoy today, and keep fishing. See you, @.",
"Willy_spring_Sat2": "I had a dream about the The Fish of Legend last night. It was playing cards, and it dealt me a bad hand.#$e#Have a great day, @. See you soon.",
"Willy_spring_Sun2": "If not this year, then next year. If not then, perhaps the year after that.#$b#The Fish of Legend, you'll be mine!$3#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_spring_Mon4": "Have you ever heard the song that comes during the rain? I wonder what it means#$e#Stay focused, stay fishing. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_spring_Tue4": "One spring when I was a child, I was out on my Grandfather's boat, and thought I saw a mermaid.#$b#I called out, and demanded we go to her. When we got close...$2#$b#Turns out it was just seaweed. I had fallen for kelp. I never let it down.$1#$e#Keep it up, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_spring_Wed4": "Waking up to nothing but the sea all around you is an odd feeling. The first night back on land, however, is even stranger#$e#Good to see you. Have a good one.",
"Willy_spring_Thu4": "Hey there, chum. How's it going?#$b#I hope life on the farm is treating you well. Tamers of nature, you and I#$e#Keep the good work going. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_spring_Fri4": "Do you know how to cook? Here's a tip. Fish go great with seaweed, and can be eaten raw. How's that for nature's bounty?#$e#Enjoy today, and keep fishing. See you, @.",
"Willy_spring_Sat4": "How do you feel about Merpeople? Think they could exist? Wandering the seas?#$e#Have a great day, @. See you soon.",
"Willy_spring_Sun4": "The ocean is large. I will never fish everywhere, which is why I have my favorite spots.#$b#Have you found places where you have more luck?$1#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_spring_Mon6": "'Thou art the best, to see the sea, if only I could know you...'$2#$b#Oh, sorry. Just reciting some lines from an old play#$e#Stay focused, stay fishing. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_spring_Tue6": "'The full moon rises, I turn to thee, forever more a monster.'$2#$b#Oh, hello, @. Been thinking about old plays a lot lately#$e#Keep it up, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_spring_Wed6": "There used to be a lot more plays during the spring when I was a child.#$b#I wonder if we could have some at the community center#$e#Good to see you. Have a good one.",
"Willy_spring_Thu6": "Once, for a time, I wasn't a fisherman. Maybe someday I'll tell you about it#$e#Keep the good work going. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_spring_Fri6": "I hope someday I can show more people the joy of fishing. It's peace, you know?#$b#Happy catches, @.$1#$e#Enjoy today, and keep fishing. See you, @.",
"Willy_spring_Sat6": "'Betrayed, to the highest court, by my own brother.'#$b#You ever see the play called the 'Golden Carp?' It's a classic#$e#Have a great day, @. See you soon.",
"Willy_spring_Sun6": "The The Fish of Legend's favorite day of the week is Sunday. Isn't that strange?#$b#What's it got against the other days?#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_spring_Mon8": "I was an actor, for a time. Went all the way to the land where movies are made. Was in some plays, all of them terrible.#$b#I had one starring role, in a play called 'The Tickled Salmon.' I went up on stage...and forgot my lines.#$b#All them, gone. I was so embarrassed. I didn't get much work after that.$2#$b#Funny how it goes sometimes, eh?$1#$e#Stay focused, stay fishing. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_spring_Tue8": "I spent a lot of time reading plays, when the day's fishing had come to a stop on my Grandfather's boat.#$b#I still remember a lot of the lines, but some are fading#$e#Keep it up, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_spring_Wed8": "When I was an actor, I had a good show during a Spring Festival. Everything went off without a hitch and the audience loved us.#$b#On certain spring nights, I recite some lines from it. To remember.$1#$e#Good to see you. Have a good one.",
"Willy_spring_Thu8": "I actually fell in love with an actress. We worked well together, would pass the nights learning the scripts in each other's arms.#$b#She got a big role and got famous, and I was left behind.$2#$b#A part of me still misses her#$e#Keep the good work going. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_spring_Fri8": "After failing as an actor, my Father welcomed me back to the fisherman's life with open arms.#$b#No questions, no judgements. We got right back to it.#$b#I'll always appreciate him for that.$1#$e#Enjoy today, and keep fishing. See you, @.",
"Willy_spring_Sat8": "Here's a line from the play I was most proud of being in. 'Do not wonder, or wish, but strive to be better, and always eat fish.#$b#It resonates with me just as it did all those years ago.$1#$e#Have a great day, @. See you soon.",
"Willy_spring_Sun8": "I learned a valuable lesson acting. Even when I am angry, or sad, I must be in control of my emotions.#$b#Advice that works for acting and for fishing, don't you think?$1#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_spring_Mon10": "It's always good to see you, @. I hope your fishing is going well.$1#$b#Have you caught any special fish yet? If there's anyone who can, it'd be you, @.$1#$e#Happy fishing, @! I'll see you later.",
"Willy_spring_Tue10": "The baby fishes are so cute, I feed them some bread when I see them.$1#$b#Spring makes me think a lot about new life#$e#If only I had the chance to have some little fishies of my own...",
"Willy_spring_Wed10": "Thanks for always coming and talking with me, @. Before you got here, I kept to myself. But your company has given me a little light in the day.#$e#I look forward to seeing you tomorrow!$1",
"Willy_spring_Thu10": "Here's some honesty for you, @. I hope to be buried at sea.#$b#It's a tough thing to think about, death, but to be sent to the place I love so much, that wouldn't be so bad#$e#If you ever catch a fish that looks like me in the future...don't eat me.",
"Willy_spring_Fri10": "Seeing you reminds me of a line from a play. 'The best of friends come from the strangest of places.'#$b#Perhaps I'm the strange one? Gladly!$1#$e#Have a good day, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_spring_Sat10": "I tell you this because I trust you, @. I don't want to die. If it was up to me, I'd fish forever.#$b#Whatever happens after, I would rather be fishing#$e#Unless, of course, in the world beyond, all they do is go fishing...",
"Willy_spring_Sun10": "I was having a bad day today, but now that you're here, @, I feel better. Thank you.$1#$e#To many more wild catches in this life! See you, @.",
"Willy_summer_1": "It must be summer, it's gotten so hot. At least the fish will be happy!#$e#Let's survive the heat together, @.",
"Willy_summer_Mon": "Here's a cooking tip about fish. If it smells really 'fishy,' that's not a good thing.#$b#You want fresh fish above all else. It's what makes living next to the ocean so great!#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_summer_Tue": "Always check for bones in your fish. You don't want to hurt yourself biting into a ribcage.#$b#Trust me from experience.$1#$e#Stay focused, stay fishing. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_summer_Wed": "Fish can be eaten raw, or cooked. Some fish taste hardy, others, almost sweet. Such a bountiful crop.#$b#I truly love fishing. Have you had any luck?$1#$e#Keep it up, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_summer_Thu": "Summer brings out certain kinds of fish, all of which are delicious.#$b#I wonder what we would taste like to a fish? Sorry, my mind is wandering.$1#$e#Good to see you. Have a good one.",
"Willy_summer_Fri": "Stay hydrated when you're out there fishing. You don't want to overheat and dehydrate. Trust me from experience#$e#Keep the good work going. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_summer_Sat": "I love watching the Rainbow Trout swim in the river. Their beauty is something to behold.#$b#They are also really good to eat!$1#$e#Enjoy today, and keep fishing. See you, @.",
"Willy_summer_Sun": "Summer means the Pufferfish are around. They are quite the characters, did you know each one has a special name?#$b#That's what I like to think, anyway.$1#$e#Have a great day, @. See you soon.",
"Willy_summer_Mon2": "The heat of summer makes me think about when I was a child. The cool waters of the oceans and rivers against the heat of the day.#$b#You never forget something like that, you know?#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_summer_Tue2": "It's so humid today. I expect the fish to get up on land and swim in the air soon.#$b#I'll have to exchange my fishing rod for a bug net.$1#$e#Stay focused, stay fishing. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_summer_Wed2": "I have to be careful during summer, or else the items in my shop overheat and go bad.#$b#You never get over that fishy smell, only ignore it best you can.$1#$e#Keep it up, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_summer_Thu2": "On nights like tonight, after such a hot day, nothing beats drinking a cold beverage and talking with friends.$1#$e#Good to see you. Have a good one.",
"Willy_summer_Fri2": "Have you been catching things lately? I haven't had any luck. It's like the fish have gone on a vacation.$2#$b#I wonder where they have gone off to?#$e#Keep the good work going. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_summer_Sat2": "When you're on a boat during summer, there's little escape from the heat. Jumping overboard is not a good idea, and the cabins don't help.#$b#We would hope the fish would bring some ice with them, but they never did.$1#$e#Enjoy today, and keep fishing. See you, @.",
"Willy_summer_Sun2": "Quiet summer nights, when all is peaceful and the air is cool, with the sound of the waves coming in...#$b#I'm glad I get to experience them again.$1#$e#Have a great day, @. See you soon.",
"Willy_summer_Mon4": "One summer, my Grandfather took me on his boat to the Fern Islands. They a collection of beautiful, tropical islands far away from here.#$b#It was a long journey getting there, but I spent a lot of that time learning from my Grandfather#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_summer_Tue4": "My Grandfather believed that the spirit of a person was at its strongest during summer, so he always worked extra hard.#$b#It was a sight to behold, an eighty year old man, hanging off the front of his boat, shouting at the sun for not burning hot enough.$1#$e#Stay focused, stay fishing. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_summer_Wed4": "During summer on the Fern Islands, we built great fires with the locals and ate roasted fish.#$b#My Grandfather would tell fisherman's tales, ghost stories full of half-truths. It was hard to sleep after those!$1#$e#Keep it up, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_summer_Thu4": "My Grandfather taught me his technique for catching fish that had fire in their belly. He told me to never let the fish think it had the upper hand.#$b#Confidence in all things, for no fish wants to be caught by a coward. Those words have stuck with me.$1#$e#Good to see you. Have a good one.",
"Willy_summer_Fri4": "The boat my Grandfather captained was called 'The Dare.' It was a small ship, barely enough room for my Father, Grandfather and I to squeeze into the cabin.#$b#Most people thought it would be destroyed by any storm at sea, but my Grandfather continued on for many years. He's still an inspiration of mine#$e#Keep the good work going. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_summer_Sat4": "On one summer boat trip, we saw a ghastly sight. It was a shipwreck, washed up on some coral. No survivors, and nothing around for miles.$2#$b#My Grandfather, ever curious, went aboard the vessel, and found the diary of the previous captain.#$b#It was full of their hopes and dreams. I've always wondered what happened to them.$1#$e#Enjoy today, and keep fishing. See you, @.",
"Willy_summer_Sun4": "On some days like today, when the sun is too hot, I like to remember my Grandfather#$e#Have a great day, @. See you soon.",
"Willy_summer_Mon6": "The hot waters of summer means that the Speckled Sunfish is wandering the seas. It's said that it can grant wishes.#$b#They say it's so brilliant that looking into it can cause one to go blind#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_summer_Tue6": "I've seen the Speckled Sunfish a few times, usually during sunset on the waves. Most people told me it's just the sun's reflection, but that's no fun.#$b#That's just what the Speckled Sunfish wants you to believe.$1#$e#Stay focused, stay fishing. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_summer_Wed6": "The Speckled Sunfish has an arch nemesis. It's called the Lunar Lariot, and it's the size of a shark. It only comes out at night.#$b#It's responsible for the feeling people get around dark water in the evening. Spooky stuff.$1#$e#Keep it up, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_summer_Thu6": "I'd love to catch a legendary fish. Just to meet it, shake it's fin. I'd throw it back into the water after taking a lot of pictures.$1#$e#Good to see you. Have a good one.",
"Willy_summer_Fri6": "I've been craving ice cream lately. I'm just not sure which flavor. Something sweet, I think, and delicious#$e#Keep the good work going. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_summer_Sat6": "There was a woman who believed she caught the Speckled Sunfish. Many years ago she received a lot of press and was in all the papers.#$b#Turns out it was all a scam, but she insisted it was real. I still believe her.$1#$e#Enjoy today, and keep fishing. See you, @.",
"Willy_summer_Sun6": "Hey there, @. I was hoping to see you come by today. I think you'll catch something good real soon, I can feel it.$1#$e#Have a great day, @. See you soon.",
"Willy_summer_Mon8": "For all his teachings, I never thanked my Grandfather. I didn't think to. Now, however, I wish I had.$2#$b#Talking with you, @, makes me hope that I can inspire you in some way. To learn from my mistakes#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_summer_Tue8": "This summer has been an emotional one for me. A lot of thinking back on the old days. I'm glad you have an open ear, @!#$e#Stay focused, stay fishing. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_summer_Wed8": "On days when it's raining, have you heard the strange noises? I wonder what they could be.#$b#Perhaps a monster of the deep is calling out? It gives me the shivers.$1#$e#Keep it up, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_summer_Thu8": "My model boat sank. I was trying to recreate my Grandfather's ship, and it just wouldn't float.#$b#In a way, I'm glad. Only my Grandfather could captain 'The Dare,' in any form.$1#$e#Good to see you. Have a good one.",
"Willy_summer_Fri8": "When my Grandfather passed away, I was beside myself. It was so sudden. He was so full of life, ready to take on the world, and then he was gone.#$b#It was a nice funeral, but somedays, like today, I realize I never got over his loss.$1#$e#Keep the good work going. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_summer_Sat8": "@! So good to see you. Can you believe how hot it's been? I'm a bit stunned myself.$1#$b#It'd be a shame if the oceans dried up!#$e#Enjoy today, and keep fishing. See you, @.",
"Willy_summer_Sun8": "You never realize when you're going to be doing something for the last time. When I got off my Grandfather's boat, on that final day of summer, I didn't know it'd be my last.#$b#I wish I could have just one more ride with him. Learn one more thing.$1#$e#Have a great day, @. See you soon.",
"Willy_summer_Mon10": "Parties on the beach can be wild. In my youth, I'd drink too much and run out into the water.#$b#I called myself King of the Sands. I'd hoot and holler all around. That was the life.$3#$e#If I tried doing that now, people would think I'm crazy!",
"Willy_summer_Tue10": "I love Watermelon. It was always a treat to eat it out on the sea, covering my face with seeds against the heat of the day.#$b#Summer is perfect for watermelon, don't you think?$1#$e#Just thinking about it has made me want some. See you later, @!",
"Willy_summer_Wed10": "Lately I've seen some couples show up on the beach. It's amazing to see no matter how bad life gets, love finds a way.#$b#Being in love, with the whole day ahead for the two of you, isn't that wonderful?$1#$e#Cherish love, @! I'll see you later.",
"Willy_summer_Thu10": "As an actor, one of my more disastrous plays was set on a beach retreat during the middle of summer. I did my best, but the audience hated us.#$b#I remember eating as much free shrimp as I could after my scene was done, and then running away. It was so awkward.$1#$e#I've never sweat so much in my life. Have a good day, @.",
"Willy_summer_Fri10": "I really hope you're having a good summer, @. It's great to see you thriving in this town.#$b#Don't forget to take time to enjoy relaxing on the beach. Best time of year for that.$1#$e#Unless you're too busy. Whatever works for you! See you around.",
"Willy_summer_Sat10": "I'm going to be real honest with you right now, @. I may have had too much to drink last night.$2#$b#I wish I could fish away this headache.$1#$e#That Stardrop Saloon can get real crazy. See you around, @.",
"Willy_summer_Sun10": "I'll be sad to see this summer go. It was a really great one. I'm glad I could share some of it with you, @.$1#$e#Maybe next year will be even better? I can only hope. See you around.",
"Willy_fall_1": "Fall is here, can you believe it? New fish, new adventures, and that wonderful feeling in the air.$1#$e#Like the trees, we will survive! See you soon.",
"Willy_fall_Mon": "Bears enjoy catching fish, I enjoy catching fish. To think we have something in common with a bear is quite wonderful, don't you think?$1#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_fall_Tue": "Leaves have started falling into the water, so fish have more places to hide#$e#Stay focused, stay fishing. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_fall_Wed": "The coolness of the air, the whisper of winter in the breeze. Fall is a magical time.#$b#Lots of good fishing, too!$1#$e#Keep it up, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_fall_Thu": "It's nice to fish all day and not break a sweat. Standing in the water can get cold, though#$e#Good to see you. Have a good one.",
"Willy_fall_Fri": "The Salmon have begun to make their journey upstream. I admire they dedication. So determined!#$b#Strive to be like the Salmon#$e#Keep the good work going. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_fall_Sat": "During this time of year, at night, there's a fish called the Walleye that lurks in the lakes and rivers. The rain summons it.#$b#If you catch one, hold onto it. It might be more special than you think#$e#Enjoy today, and keep fishing. See you, @.",
"Willy_fall_Sun": "Baked salmon is my least favorite kind of food. When I tell people this, they don't understand.#$b#It's not the taste that's the problem, it's eating something that inspires me that disturbs me.$1#$e#Have a great day, @. See you soon.",
"Willy_fall_Mon2": "Have I ever brought up the Fall Haul before? It was a big deal in my life.#$b#It was the most we had ever fished up, a ship load of fish. Prior to that, a Tsunami had wrecked the Fern Islands.$2#$b#We brought the fish for the hungry people and gave it all to them. I realized then I would fish the rest of my life#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_fall_Tue2": "I hope you're having a Fall Haul of your own this year. How's the farm been coming?#$b#It's good that things are working out. I hope you're preparing for winter!$1#$e#Stay focused, stay fishing. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_fall_Wed2": "It's a weird feeling, realizing what you want to do for the rest of your life. It's both stressful, and peaceful.#$b#Have you decided yet, @? Is this farm what you want to do?$1#$e#Keep it up, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_fall_Thu2": "I opened this shop in Pelican town because I liked what I saw. People from various walks of life, you know?#$b#It helped that they all love fish!$1#$e#Good to see you. Have a good one.",
"Willy_fall_Fri2": "Sometimes you're not prepared for the way life throws changes at you. I know I wasn't.#$b#It's best to stay on your toes, in life and in fishing. Never get caught...off guard!$1#$e#Keep the good work going. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_fall_Sat2": "I've never had a fishing season as large as I had during the Fall Haul. I might never again.#$b#That's what makes it so special!#$e#Enjoy today, and keep fishing. See you, @.",
"Willy_fall_Sun2": "How's the fall treating you, @? Are you empowered since it's cooled down?#$b#I'll cling to any warmth I can, especially with winter coming#$e#Have a great day, @. See you soon.",
"Willy_fall_Mon4": "I caught a fish once that was so interesting looking I just couldn't sell it. I called it Vibrato#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_fall_Tue4": "When I had my pet fish, Vibrato, I put him in a tank by the window, and on days like today, I noticed he had a longing look in his eyes.#$b#At least, that's what I thought anyway#$e#Stay focused, stay fishing. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_fall_Wed4": "Been thinking a lot about Vibrato lately. Best pet fish one could ask for, but I couldn't stand how sad he looked all the time.$2#$b#His heart, like mine, was for the sea. I let him go not long after. I wonder where he is now?#$e#Keep it up, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_fall_Thu4": "Sometimes, at twilight, I think I see my fish Vibrato, watching me from somewhere in the water. I hope he found happiness.#$b#As much happiness a fish can find, of course.$1#$e#Good to see you. Have a good one.",
"Willy_fall_Fri4": "Oh, it's good to see you, @. I had a weird dream about you. You and my old fish Vibrato were playing cards, and then he dealt me in, and I lost.#$b#I wonder what it could mean? Do dreams have meaning? Much to think about.$1#$e#Keep the good work going. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_fall_Sat4": "This is getting odd. Another dream about you, @. This time, you were planting seeds and growing fish that looked exactly like Vibrato!#$b#I offered to buy him off you, but you said, 'No Sale!' Isn't that strange?#$e#Enjoy today, and keep fishing. See you, @.",
"Willy_fall_Sun4": "Last night, in my dreams, I told my old fish Vibrato to stop with all the weirdness. He looked hurt, but I wanted no more of that nonsense.#$b#That was when I won a big hand, and said, 'Well, maybe one more round.'$1#$e#Have a great day, @. See you soon.",
"Willy_fall_Mon6": "We've gotten to know each other somewhat, eh, @? I guess I could let you in on one of my secrets.#$b#I'm a big fan of Soap Operas. Is that wrong? If it is, I don't want to be right.$1#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_fall_Tue6": "I started watching Soap Operas when I would stay with my Grandparents. Can you believe one of them is still going to this very day? It's called, 'The Arm of the Law.'#$b#It's about a hard-boiled detective named Rockstone who has been searching for his wife's murderer, for fifty-nine years!$3#$b#Why hasn't he given up already?$1#$e#Stay focused, stay fishing. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_fall_Wed6": "On the latest episode of 'The Arm of the Law,' it turns out his wife wasn't really dead all this time. That's fifty-nine years of lieing! I couldn't believe it.#$b#I wish my Grandfather could know that twist. It would have blown his mind. I fell out of my seat.$1#$e#Keep it up, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_fall_Thu6": "Another shocker! On 'The Arm of the Law' today, it turns out that Rockstone's wife is indeed dead, and that the woman who appeared was an evil robot!#$b#I try not to think deep about the show, or else it starts to get weird.$1#$e#Good to see you. Have a good one.",
"Willy_fall_Fri6": "When I was an actor, I auditioned for 'The Arm of the Law,' but was turned down because I just didn't have the look. Not soon after, a guy who looked a lot like me showed up.#$b#I must have inspired someone as I left in a huff. At least that's what I like to think, anyway#$e#Keep the good work going. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_fall_Sat6": "My favorite shows are 'The Arm of the Law,' of course, 'The Dragons who Dance at Midnight,' and a newer show, called 'Bad Enough to Die.'#$b#Have you had a chance to see any of them? If you do, we can talk about them as we fish.$1#$e#Enjoy today, and keep fishing. See you, @.",
"Willy_fall_Sun6": "'Freeze Rockstone, or I'll get you!'#$b#Oh, sorry, @. It was another crazy episode of 'The Long Arm of the Law' today. I've been saying the lines all day!$1#$e#Have a great day, @. See you soon.",
"Willy_fall_Mon8": "It might be hard for you to believe this, @, but I've actually never won a fishing tournament. I've got last place in each one I tried to be apart of.#$b#Some say 'those that can't, teach,' but I just don't have the heart to compete at something like that.$1#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_fall_Tue8": "The thing about fishing tournaments is that they don't judge by how peaceful you are when you fish, or if you find it stressful. They just want a big fish.#$b#That's not competition. That's just luck. Isn't it?$1#$e#Stay focused, stay fishing. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_fall_Wed8": "I know I'm a good fisherman. I don't need a trophy from a tournament to say that. The fish don't care.$2#$b#Sorry, @. I might still be a little bitter. I'm not sure how I feel about it, really#$e#Keep it up, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_fall_Thu8": "Here's an odd thing about me, @. I don't like aquariums. It's like Fish Prison.#$b#Sure they can swim around, but they are stuck with the other fish in those tanks forever. What if they don't get along?#$b#It's one thing to have bad neighbors, but fish can't just up and go from those places#$e#Good to see you. Have a good one.",
"Willy_fall_Fri8": "I went to an an aquarium once that had a shark in a tank across from schools of fish. I felt so bad for the creature.#$b#It's unnatural to put fish in places like that#$e#Keep the good work going. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_fall_Sat8": "When I was a boy, I went to a show that had multi-colored fish in it. They would do tricks, dance, and repeat poems. It was grand.#$b#I realized years later that they weren't fish on stage, just clever tricks of the light.#$b#Still, I wonder, who ate the food they fed them onstage?#$e#Enjoy today, and keep fishing. See you, @.",
"Willy_fall_Sun8": "Good to see you, @. Fall always makes me feel a bit out of the loop. The cold must effect my brain, that sort of thing.$1#$b#I'll just stick to fishing. You understand, right?$1#$e#Have a great day, @. See you soon.",
"Willy_fall_Mon10": "The dying trees always get to me during the fall. I know they will come back in spring, but ever year they go through this cycle.#$b#Do you think trees enjoy this? Do they dread it? I can never be sure.$1#$e#Have a wonderful fall day, @.",
"Willy_fall_Tue10": "Hello again, @. I hope everything has been working out for you during this harvest season.$1#$b#It's always good to know you're giving it your all. We've shared a lot of memories, you and I.$1#$e#I hope we make many more! See you, @.",
"Willy_fall_Wed10": "On days like today, I don't want to watch the shop. I want to go out there and have an adventure. Yet, here I am.$2#$b#At least I get to see you for a bit, @. That makes it better.$1#$e#Have a good adventure today, for me. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_fall_Thu10": "Today has not been my day. Woke up with a headache, dumped some chum into the ocean, and lost a ring.$2#$b#I hope you are having a better day, @. Also, have a good night#$e#See you around, @.",
"Willy_fall_Fri10": "I wonder if I should have been born a fish. Then I could travel the world, meet other fish, do that sort of thing.#$b#Then, I wonder, if I was a fish, who would be me? Would I catch myself? Throw myself back?#$b#Interesting indeed. Such thoughts on a beautiful fall day.$1#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_fall_Sat10": "I hope you're preparing for winter, @. This one is going to be like no other winter that has ever been before.#$b#Or, it will be a completely average winter with no surprises. Let's hope for the first option.$1#$e#Catch the breeze and have a great day, @.",
"Willy_fall_Sun10": "'Whistle the leaves away, for the winter is coming. Let it all be gone, for the winter is coming.'#$b#Lines from one of my favorite plays. It's hopeful to me, yet also sad#$e#Have a great one, @.",
"Willy_winter_1": "I always forget how cold it gets, once winter arrives. I hope the fish haven't frozen solid.$2#$b#I look forward to spring.$1#$e#Have a merry winter, @.",
"Willy_winter_15": "I suppose I should tell you why I've been in such a bad mood lately.$2#$b#Many years ago, I was in love with the most beautiful woman I had ever met. I knew she was the one the moment I met her.#$b#She was smart, funny, and understood what it meant to be a fisherman. We agreed to get married.$1#$b#Then, on this date, she left. No notes, no letters, she just disappeared.#$b#I've been heartbroken ever sense.$1#$e#I'll see you around, @.",
"Willy_winter_Mon": "The life of a Fisherman never stops. Even during winter, there's fish to be had, mouths that need to be fed.#$b#I don't miss freezing out on the ocean for shrimp, I'll tell you that!$1#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_winter_Tue": "This time of year makes me thankful for all the fishing I've done. The bleakness of winter really puts things in perspective.#$b#This spring, I'm going to come at it extra hard.$1#$e#Stay focused, stay fishing. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_winter_Wed": "I once went ice fishing, which is a crazy experience. It's so cold you stop feeling yourself, the only warmth coming from thinking about your loved ones.#$b#I didn't catch anything that day except the idea to never to do it agian#$e#Keep it up, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_winter_Thu": "As a fisherman, you find yourself in a lot of interesting situations. One winter, I found myself stranded on an oil barge. No fishing what so ever.#$b#I passed my time reading and getting to know the people on board. Though what they did was different, we were all sea folk.$1#$e#Good to see you. Have a good one.",
"Willy_winter_Fri": "Learning to read on a moving boat isn't for everyone, but luckily I was able to adapt. On stormy days, when the ocean is turbulent, it makes me want to open a good book#$e#Keep the good work going. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_winter_Sat": "Today feels extra cold. I think I'm going to warm up and think about spring. I hope you do the same.$1#$e#Enjoy today, and keep fishing. See you, @.",
"Willy_winter_Sun": "I wonder if fish have any holidays they like to celebrate? Maybe that's what schooling is really all about, fishing coming together and celebrating something#$e#Have a great day, @. See you soon.",
"Willy_winter_Mon2": "Do you think fish get too cold? Maybe they need something like, fishy sweaters or something?#$b#A fish in a turtle neck, staying warm and inspired. I'd like to see that.$1#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_winter_Tue2": "How's it going, @? Staying warm? This winter weather really gets to me. The only way I can get warmed up is if I can complain about it.$1#$e#Stay focused, stay fishing. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_winter_Wed2": "You know who is dedicated to the craft of fishing when you see them come into my shop during winter. The passion keeps them warm.#$b#Seeing them inspires me to go out there, no matter what, and try to catch something.$1#$e#Keep it up, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_winter_Thu2": "Sometimes I wonder if the winter storms are brought on by the fish themselves, wanting to test fisherman to brave them. I'd like to think that.#$b#I'll think about anything that inspires me to go out into that cold#$e#Good to see you. Have a good one.",
"Willy_winter_Fri2": "I think it might be warmer today. It's hard to be sure. Spring can't come quick enough, I'll tell you that.#$b#This spring, I'm going to spend every moment I can fishing and enjoying the outdoors#$e#Keep the good work going. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_winter_Sat2": "I talk so much about fish, you probably think I made snow fish instead of snow people as a child, right?#$b#You'd be correct. I made a whole snow ocean, which I'm still proud of to this day.$1#$e#Enjoy today, and keep fishing. See you, @.",
"Willy_winter_Sun2": "'The cold wind blows, everything is frozen. The eyes of the fish stare from the depths below. They call to me, challenge me. I drink my cocoa.'#$b#Not the best poem, but it's based on real life#$e#Have a great day, @. See you soon.",
"Willy_winter_Mon4": "I'm a terrible ice skater. I've tried many times in my life, and have always fallen flat. I'm not sure what it is, but it's very embarrassing for me.$1#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_winter_Tue4": "Winter nights by the fire, those are special moments, aren't they? Reading a good book against the crackle of burning wood.#$b#I hope to do that real soon. Even got the wood picked out.$1#$e#Stay focused, stay fishing. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_winter_Wed4": "My Grandfather never minded the cold. I like to think his love of life kept him warm, or he was really good at not complaining.$1#$b#My Father was like me, though. He'd always bring the warmest blankets, and they were never enough#$e#Keep it up, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_winter_Thu4": "Last night, I thought I saw the stars shivering in the night sky. That can't be possible, but it sure felt like it.$1#$e#Good to see you. Have a good one.",
"Willy_winter_Fri4": "I keep hoping to catch some spring time when I go fishing lately, but all I get is more winter. My bait isn't working, I tell you!#$b#See you around, @#$e#Keep the good work going. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_winter_Sat4": "Pulling up a cage full of freshly caught fish, when it's raining during winter, is an experience that tests one's very soul.#$b#Your whole body asks yourself, is this worth it? You can't answer in the moment, only much later.$1#$e#Enjoy today, and keep fishing. See you, @.",
"Willy_winter_Sun4": "During this time of year, the Lingcod come out. Those are some scary fish, but I do like them. They seize the day, as it were.#$b#If you bring me one, I'd appreciate it. They are tasty.$1#$e#Have a great day, @. See you soon.",
"Willy_winter_Mon6": "This is the time of year the great sky fish appear. They swim in schools that make the winter storms, and they cause it to snow.$1#$b#At least that's what my old book said. I wonder where they go during the year?#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_winter_Tue6": "The Great Sky fish are called Cloud Surfers, and they dash through the clouds, having a good time.#$b#As a child, I would watch for them, waiting to see if they would appear. I think I saw one once, but it turned out to be an airplane.$1#$e#Stay focused, stay fishing. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_winter_Wed6": "I've always had a dream to escape the winter and head somewhere warm. I always think about it during winter, and then forget during spring.#$b#One of these years, though. I'll be gone!#$e#Keep it up, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_winter_Thu6": "On a cold day like today, I like to think back to the year that has passed and remember the good times. Some have even been shared you with, @!$1#$e#Good to see you. Have a good one.",
"Willy_winter_Fri6": "All my soap operas are entering holiday season, so I've had that to enjoy. On 'The Arm of the Law,' Rockstone had to find out who killed Father Winter.#$b#Turns out, it was an evil clone of Rockstone from another universe! What a twist.$1#$e#Keep the good work going. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_winter_Sat6": "I watched a show last night about being a fisherman. It was called 'The Sad Salt Man,' and they got everything wrong.$2#$b#It makes me mad when people don't learn about what they are talking about. Especially if you make people like me look silly!$1#$e#Enjoy today, and keep fishing. See you, @.",
"Willy_winter_Sun6": "I've caught a good book recently about the joys of farming. Maybe you can teach me a thing or two, eh, @?#$b#I'd love to learn all that you've gone through this year.$1#$e#Have a great day, @. See you soon.",
"Willy_winter_Mon8": "Sorry, @. I'm really feeling down today. If I can I'll talk to you again sometime this week.$2#$b#...$1#$e#Have a great day, @. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_winter_Tue8": "Winter holidays are interesting, because it's all about getting together with loved ones. What if you don't have any?$2#$b#What if you're all alone in this world? What then?$2#$b#What a rotten mood I'm in this week. Sorry, @#$e#Stay focused, stay fishing. Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_winter_Wed8": "I can't stand the sight of couples this time of year. I shouldn't be this bitter, I'm an old man now, but it still gets to me.$2#$b#Do you understand where I'm coming from, @?#$e#Keep it up, @. I'll see you soon.",
"Willy_winter_Thu8": "Couldn't sleep last night. I've been up all night. I'll catch you again some other time, @.$2#$b#...$1#$e#Good to see you. Have a good one.",
"Willy_winter_Fri8": "I've got nothing to say today. I'll catch you again, @.$1#$e#Keep the good work going. I'll see you around.",
"Willy_winter_Sat8": "I want to apologize for my behavior lately, @. I've had a lot on my mind. Sometimes it gets to be a bit much, even for an old fisherman like me.#$b#I hope you can forgive me.$1#$e#Enjoy today, and keep fishing. See you, @.",
"Willy_winter_Sun8": "Oh, hey, @. Don't mind me today. I've been remembering a lot of sad things.#$b#See you around, okay?$1#$e#Have a great day, @. See you soon.",
"Willy_winter_Mon10": "During this time of year, I used to get into a funk. Sad all around. But getting to know you, @, has made things better.$1#$b#I still want spring to come fast, of course, but seeing you makes the wait not so bad.$1#$e#Have a good one, @.",
"Willy_winter_Tue10": "I hear you've become somewhat of an adventurer down in the mines, @. That's pretty exciting. The principles of a fisherman and explorer are similiar.$3#$b#Have you met any weird characters down there? What are they like?#$e#Unlikely friends in unlikely places. Have a good one.",
"Willy_winter_Wed10": "Unlike previous years, I've looked forward to the holidays. Spending time with you, @, is going to be a lot of fun.$1#$e#See you soon.",
"Willy_winter_Thu10": "Staying warm despite the cold, @? Looks like it. Your hard work is inspiring.$1#$b#I hope your winter is a happy one!$1#$e#If not, I'll be here to talk to. See you around, @.",
"Willy_winter_Fri10": "Another day, another visit from @. You're one of my favorite people, you know that? I'm so glad you showed up on that farm.$1#$e#I'll see you around, @!$1",
"Willy_winter_Sat10": "Somedays I still get a bit sad. But then I think about all the good times we've had this year, @, and it makes it feel better.$2#$e#Thanks for everything. I'll see you soon.$1",
"Willy_winter_Sun10": "'Till spring comes again and winter washes away, we have our friends for warmth. Another night will pass and in the morning, all will be right.'#$b#That poem makes me think about you and your farm, @.#$e#See you soon!",


//Wizard
"Wizard_Introduction": "Greetings, young @. I had foreseen your arrival.#$b#It will be a pleasure getting to know you. There are many adventures ahead for you and I.",
"Wizard_spring_1": "The energies have begun again. Spring is here, and the year is reborn.#$b#Many well wishes to you, @. I see a good year ahead.#$e#A very good year, indeed.",
"Wizard_spring_Mon": "The red berry with many faces commands attention. Its lovers are many, yet it can only be enjoyed once.#$b#It is associated with love, yet can harbor betrayal. Beware of its powers.#$b#Such is the mystery.#$e#Have a day to remember, @.",
"Wizard_spring_Tue": "The blue flower, it's blossom brings force profits. But where to place it? Its many shades have no meaning.#$b#A flower unloved but well liked has no true purpose. It sings the blues, indeed.#$e#Embrace the mysteries of the day, @.",
"Wizard_spring_Wed": "Have you seen it? The green plant? It grows and grows but is not a weed.#$b#It cannot be eaten raw by normal people, and must suffer fire to become delicious.#$b#Yet, its value is high, and is very healthy. A mysterious crop indeed.#$e#Have a good day, @. Learn something new.",
"Wizard_spring_Thu": "The brown tuber, growing beneath the earth, it's powers locked away. One must know the right way to unlock its true potential.#$b#It has saved nations and yet crushed them. Such is it's temperament.#$e#Seek the energies, @. Enjoy the day.",
"Wizard_spring_Fri": "Nothing can stop it from growing until the energies of spring leave. It will continue to grow all season long.#$b#Its powers are many, yet alone it is worthless. Such is its lot in life.#$e#Focus your mind today, @, and be at peace.",
"Wizard_spring_Sat": "Beware of the wilds during Spring, for the nature itself is cursed. To make a fast enemy, offer them vegetables from the untamed earth.#$b#It is only your farm that can cleanse the curse.#$e#Seek knowledge, seek answers. Have a good one.",
"Wizard_spring_Sun": "Not all flowers are loved. Where some see a rose, others see only thorns.#$b#Be careful who you enchant with flowers found freely.#$e#Be enchanted, @. Be at peace.",
"Wizard_spring_Mon2": "Spring is a time of renewed energy. The powers are not at their full strength yet, and everything is still returning to life.#$b#It is a time to set a focus, for the rest of the year is decided by the Spring.#$e#Have a day to remember, @.",
"Wizard_spring_Tue2": "To some, the powers at my disposal must be perplexing. Yet, I am not the only one who can use such energies.#$b#Anyone with the will to believe and follow their path can tap a source of energy far greater than seen here, but most do not wish to see it.#$e#Embrace the mysteries of the day, @.",
"Wizard_spring_Wed2": "Someday I hope to record all my findings into a book, bound with leaves of the Eternity Tree. Then all will be saved forever.#$b#Until then, I could lose it all, and what a terrible fate that would be.#$e#Have a good day, @. Learn something new.",
"Wizard_spring_Thu2": "I've learned many things about the powers spring, yet I do not understand all of it.#$b#The mysteries are always changing. To truly know would mean an end to innocence.#$e#Seek the energies, @. Enjoy the day.",
"Wizard_spring_Fri2": "Where does the energy come from? Where does it go? I have studied long, and have read many theories, but nothing is concrete.#$b#Like a butterfly, once caught, the answers live only for a short while.#$e#Focus your mind today, @, and be at peace.",
"Wizard_spring_Sat2": "If I were to write a book, only those who had the will and a yearning for knowledge would be able to read it.#$b#It is unfortunate, but that is the nature of the powers.#$e#Seek knowledge, seek answers. Have a good one.",
"Wizard_spring_Sun2": "Are there others like me? I've often wondered. Someday I will know for sure.#$b#It is a secret to everybody.#$e#Be enchanted, @. Be at peace.",
"Wizard_spring_Mon4": "You are now able to use the Shrine of Illusion down below. Use it wisely.#$b#Its power is great, for good and for evil.#$e#Have a day to remember, @.",
"Wizard_spring_Tue4": "I got the Shrine of Illusion from a man who wanted it gone. He reached out to me, begging me to take it.#$b#Getting it here was difficult, but he was glad to be rid of it. It had taken more than just his face.#$e#Embrace the mysteries of the day, @.",
"Wizard_spring_Wed4": "The Shrine of Illusion allows one to change their appearance on the outside, but not the inside.#$b#An evil being who uses the shrine cannot free itself from what it has done, you see.#$e#Have a good day, @. Learn something new.",
"Wizard_spring_Thu4": "Should the Shrine of Illusion ever again fall into the hands of evil, I will have to get it back. It is my duty now.#$b#It is a terrible artifact from a forgotten age, and I am its keeper.#$e#Seek the energies, @. Enjoy the day.",
"Wizard_spring_Fri4": "I have never used the Shrine of Illusion, but I do not fault those that do. It is important to project who you truly are.#$b#If you do not, what you are will eat itself out from the inside, and that is not pleasant.#$e#Focus your mind today, @, and be at peace.",
"Wizard_spring_Sat4": "Once, an animal went into the depths of my tower and used the Shrine of Illusion. It transformed into what it truly wanted to be seen as.#$b#Out walked a being of nightmare, and I had to find a place for it to thrive. It was difficult to do, but I succeeded.#$b#That dog-turned-nightmare? Mayor Lewis.$1#$b#I'm kidding. My joke powers wane.#$e#Seek knowledge, seek answers. Have a good one.",
"Wizard_spring_Sun4": "The Shrine of Illusion needs gold to function, an offering before its powers activate.#$b#Such is it's power.",
"Wizard_spring_Mon6": "I met my ex-wife in better times. She was the most beautiful person I'd ever seen, and we were quickly smitten with one another.#$b#Funny how time changes. The true mystery is why it happens so fast.#$e#Have a day to remember, @.",
"Wizard_spring_Tue6": "It's hard to remember the old days with my ex-wife. We were happy, very happy.#$b#Things just fell apart. In the end, we broke up, and it wasn't pretty.#$b#Many people still remember her flying around, cursing all she saw. I still feel responsible.#$e#Embrace the mysteries of the day, @.",
"Wizard_spring_Wed6": "We had similar interests, my ex-wife and I. We would spend hours in each other's arms, reading forbidden books.#$b#In the end, what we couldn't decide on was how to live. We were very different people.#$b#If only things could have been different.#$e#Have a good day, @. Learn something new.",
"Wizard_spring_Thu6": "My ex-wife still lives nearby, and appears like a green witch of legend. However, it's just an illusion.#$b#I still see her for as she truly is. It breaks my heart.#$e#Seek the energies, @. Enjoy the day.",
"Wizard_spring_Fri6": "All the powers in the universe are not enough to fix a broken heart. It can be mended, but once shattered, shall it remain.#$b#Someday I will find a way to fix my own, but even that may take centuries.#$b#Sorry to bore you with this old man's woes.#$e#Focus your mind today, @, and be at peace.",
"Wizard_spring_Sat6": "I did some things that I regret when I was married. I let things lapse, I avoided responsibility, and it cost me.#$b#If you become committed to any cause, big or small, do not run from it. It would have been better if you hadn't got involved.#$e#Seek knowledge, seek answers. Have a good one.",
"Wizard_spring_Sun6": "Joy is a mysterious power. Fragile in its most pure state, when it does appear it can resonate through the ages.#$b#Yet, that same joy can become corrupted over time. It must be protected, at all cost.#$e#Be enchanted, @. Be at peace.",
"Wizard_spring_Mon8": "@. Have you traveled? I yearn to return to the days of my youth, so very long ago.#$b#I was young and full of passion. I learned many things that I still remember strongly.#$b#Youth is fleeting, hold onto it while you can.#$e#Have a day to remember, @.",
"Wizard_spring_Tue8": "I've traveled all over, looking for secrets of the energies. I've had grand adventures, and suffered terrible tragedies.#$b#When you have a drive and a passion, that is an energy that cannot be destroyed.#$e#Embrace the mysteries of the day, @.",
"Wizard_spring_Wed8": "I will tell you of one place that I have been to. While lost in a forest, I found a cabin and took shelter in it.#$b#It was larger than it appeared on the inside, and it seemed to go on for miles.#$b#At the end, I found a bed, and in it, a child. Its eyes were open, and it rose to stare at me.#$b#It pointed at me, and I awoke in my bed at the inn. Very strange, and I still wonder about it.#$e#Have a good day, @. Learn something new.",
"Wizard_spring_Thu8": "Walking the libraries of the world, even if you cannot understand the language, is an inspiring feeling. The energy one gains by being near books is great.#$b#I used to spend hours in them, absorbing it all. Many are now gone, and it is a shame.#$e#Seek the energies, @. Enjoy the day.",
"Wizard_spring_Fri8": "Where I come from the libraries would be brimming with life. Every page a portal, recorded down by scribes long past.#$b#Some were full of secrets no one should know, and I took to them immediately. I regret it still.#$e#Focus your mind today, @, and be at peace.",
"Wizard_spring_Sat8": "The world I once knew is long gone. I hold onto fragments of it, but I am old. Someday, it will all be forgotten.#$b#I'd like to tell you about it, @, but no energy in the universe would allow me to discuss it. As is the way.#$e#Seek knowledge, seek answers. Have a good one.",
"Wizard_spring_Sun8": "I wish I could go back to the days of my youth for one more day. Go into the shop I always put off, talk to the librarians, learn even more.#$b#Those days are long gone, and all I have left of them is a shadow. Such is life.#$e#Be enchanted, @. Be at peace.",
"Wizard_spring_Mon10": "Despite the focus I have on my studies, I have always wanted to be a father. It is a shame that it isn't so easy for people like me.#$b#However, there is one in the village that I suspect may indeed be my child. It is hard to know for sure.#$e#Someday I'll get the courage to talk to them and confirm it.",
"Wizard_spring_Tue10": "I am glad to see you, @. I had predicted we would become friends, but I didn't see how much I would come to enjoy your company.#$b#There are many mysteries in this world, and I am glad you chose me as one of yours.#$e#I count myself to be very lucky indeed.",
"Wizard_spring_Wed10": "Many people are scared of me. The unknown causes them to tremble, and my association with it frightens them.#$b#You have continued to show you don't mind the mysterious. You embrace it, and take time out of your day to see me.#$b#Thank you, @. I thought I would be alone forever.#$e#You are truly a special person, indeed.",
"Wizard_spring_Thu10": "The energies, at their core, are chaotic. Ever changing, they are denser than air yet more elusive than wind.#$b#In the end, many people believed it was not worth trying to solve the mystery, yet here I remain.#$e#Someday, @, I will truly understand.",
"Wizard_spring_Fri10": "I feel renewed this year, not just because spring is the time for it, but because of my friendship with you, @.#$b#You have reminded me that I am still human. To focus on being human is a mystery itself that I almost forgot about.#$e#Thank you, @.",
"Wizard_spring_Sat10": "The air is electric, I feel this year will be a special one. Let us do our best to achieve our dreams, @.#$e#Do not give up. I will be cheering for you.",
"Wizard_spring_Sun10": "The greatest energies are the ones we allow ourselves to find. Everything else is false.#$b#Be true to what moves you, and you will be energized the rest of your life.#$e#That is my hope for you, @. Live forever!",
"Wizard_summer_1": "Summer has come at last. The energies are at their most powerful. I'll get a lot of work done this season.#$b#Stay cool, @, and do not let the sun curse you.#$e#Maybe I'll go swimming this time...",
"Wizard_summer_Mon": "The many eared crop, its leaves capture the sun's energy itself, painting it all over.#$b#Amazing in its uses, it's true desire is to feed people. An inspiring crop indeed.#$e#Have a day to remember, @.",
"Wizard_summer_Tue": "The bush with eyes of blue, it can see many things. Its power is in healing, and as such, is quite potent indeed.#$b#People crave them, but they are hard to find most of the year, and only good fresh. A crop whose quality is fleeting, very mysterious.#$e#Embrace the mysteries of the day, @.",
"Wizard_summer_Wed": "Melon of the Earth, Melon of the Sky, Melon of the People, Melon of the Eye.#$b#Melon of the Mother, Melon of the Father, Melon of the Son, Melon of the Daughter#$b#That concludes my shopping list.$1#$e##$e#Have a good day, @. Learn something new.",
"Wizard_summer_Thu": "It is now that the crops that can make energy are born, and it is up to people like yourself to harness it.#$b#There are two crops available, and one has its seeds. To utilize them is pure alchemy.#$e#Seek the energies, @. Enjoy the day.",
"Wizard_summer_Fri": "A powerful plant, it can induce dreams in those who drink it. Its powers many, its flavors are endless.#$b#Yet, it has brought ruin to civilizations, and is no friend of men or women. What is its true purpose?#$e#Focus your mind today, @, and be at peace.",
"Wizard_summer_Sat": "The energy of the sun is too much for some, and the only solution is to stay indoors. I hide within my tower for this purpose.#$b#Yet, the energies are so powerful during time of year that I do not even need sleep. Isn't it wondrous?#$e#Seek knowledge, seek answers. Have a good one.",
"Wizard_summer_Sun": "The red crop, vegetable to some and fruit to others, has no keeper. It is delicious raw, cooked, or squeezed.#$b#Many people like it, and some can't live without it. No home should lack it's prescence.#$e#Be enchanted, @. Be at peace.",
"Wizard_summer_Mon2": "Long ago, there was a language that allowed people to converse with the spirits of the sun. They held many festivals during summer.#$b#That culture is long gone, and the language of the sun lost to time. If only I could find a way...#$e#Have a day to remember, @.",
"Wizard_summer_Tue2": "The energy during summer allows for easier methods of the mysterious. It is very addicting trying out new theories after two seasons of wondering.#$b#Can you feel the energies? Do not worry if you cannot.#$e#Embrace the mysteries of the day, @.",
"Wizard_summer_Wed2": "It was said that only the most powerful could learn and write the Sun Language, for it could burn those who wrote it.#$b#It is rumored that there was a rival tribe that wrote in a special moon rune, but there has been no proof of such a language ever existing.#$e#Have a good day, @. Learn something new.",
"Wizard_summer_Thu2": "One of my experiments went well today. I was able to glance at the future for a moment.#$b#All the voices, all of the emotions. It is going to be interesting.#$e#Seek the energies, @. Enjoy the day.",
"Wizard_summer_Fri2": "I am very fortunate to have found just one letter of the Sun Language, which I keep hidden away. It burns crimson, constantly and forever.#$b#It is the letter for 'hope.' Strange, isn't it? Someday I might be able to show you, but not now.#$e#Focus your mind today, @, and be at peace.",
"Wizard_summer_Sat2": "Tomorrow I will be focusing my energy, and doing an experiment that could go very well, or very badly. If you see me, I will be in a trance.#$b#If it works, then you'll wake up and everything will be fine. If it doesn't, well, I did try.#$e#Seek knowledge, seek answers. Have a good one.",
"Wizard_summer_Sun2": "Hakata Monno ba, hakata bal bala. Shamlao 'tswal, catakan grana.#$e#Must...focus...must not...give in...",
"Wizard_summer_Mon4": "If you've yet to use the Shrine of Illusion, then I must tell you to be cautious. Its history is vast, and much of it, bloody.#$b#Use it with wisdom and all shall be fine.#$e#Have a day to remember, @.",
"Wizard_summer_Tue4": "The previous owner of the Shrine of Illusion was a vain man, trying to find the perfect look for himself. He was wealthy, and won the shrine in a contest.#$b#He invested all his wealth into it, trying to find the perfect look, but he was never happy.#$b#He was trying to fix what was on the outside and not the inside, and it consumed him. Strange, isn't it?#$e#Embrace the mysteries of the day, @.",
"Wizard_summer_Wed4": "I found a warning in an old book regarding the Shrine of Illusion. It went as follows:#$b#'Only those who wish to find their true self are permitted to use the Shrine. Those who wish to change their appearance to trick others shall be cursed.'#$b#I've spent a long time trying to find what the curse is, but only have theories.#$e#Have a good day, @. Learn something new.",
"Wizard_summer_Thu4": "My guesses for the Curse of the Shrine of Illusion are that if you use it for your own gain, and not to reveal your true self, your time on this mortal plane is cut short.#$b#Many have tried to use it as such, and all were destroyed. But this is just a theory of mine, nothing concrete about it.#$e#Seek the energies, @. Enjoy the day.",
"Wizard_summer_Fri4": "It is curious to me why the Shrine demands gold for its use. If it was a construct of good, it shouldn't matter.#$b#Yet, it will not work without a gold offering. Such a curious thing.#$e#Focus your mind today, @, and be at peace.",
"Wizard_summer_Sat4": "There is no proof of any kind that the Shrine of Illusion is more powerful during summer or not. All other sorts of mysterious objects are, but it appears indifferent.#$e#Seek knowledge, seek answers. Have a good one.",
"Wizard_summer_Sun4": "I believe you to be a good person, @, so the Shrine should be kind to you. If I misjudged you, then...#$b#You might still be fine. I'll have to see.#$e#Be enchanted, @. Be at peace.",
"Wizard_summer_Mon6": "My ex-wife was my companion. We did many things together, and during summer, when the energies are so potent, it was truly wonderful.#$b#Now, I am alone in this tower. It is not the same, and probably will never be again.#$e#Have a day to remember, @.",
"Wizard_summer_Tue6": "I have the ability to create an image of any being and converse with it. However, they bore me, and I bore them.#$b#They claim I need to get over my ex-wife, but it's easier said than done.#$e#Embrace the mysteries of the day, @.",
"Wizard_summer_Wed6": "To be lucky in love is a special sort of energy that not all beings possess. It strikes randomly, and only once.#$b#I have been hoping for another chance for many years, but to no avail.#$e#Have a good day, @. Learn something new.",
"Wizard_summer_Thu6": "I once conjured a being that was a talking cat. It would go on and on about facts from around the world, but it was only things I knew.#$b#I couldn't bring myself to send it away, so I gave it to a friend. I wonder where it is now.#$e#Seek the energies, @. Enjoy the day.",
"Wizard_summer_Fri6": "The summer full moon is a special one for me. I proposed to my ex-wife underneath it's power.#$b#It was...enchanting.#$b#That was a very long time ago.#$e#Focus your mind today, @, and be at peace.",
"Wizard_summer_Sat6": "It is a danger power to wonder about how things could have been. It is impossible to know, but it can be a destructive force.#$b#It's better to always to what you feel is right so you have no regrets. Doing what you feel is wrong, but doing it anyway, is madness.#$e#Seek knowledge, seek answers. Have a good one.",
"Wizard_summer_Sun6": "The days are long, @. I am in a slump, but I can feel a time when I will soon rise above it.#$b#I let the powers of the past take over me, and I tell you this, I will break free of them.#$e#Be enchanted, @. Be at peace.",
"Wizard_summer_Mon8": "One of things I did when I was younger was hunt and fight evil beings and creatures. I've encountered them all.#$b#There are beings in is world who still fight wars, the point of which long forgotten, replaced only with hatred of the enemy.#$b#It is a tiring life, and I got out of it.#$e#Have a day to remember, @.",
"Wizard_summer_Tue8": "The problem with monsters is that most of the time they do not know why they do what they are doing.#$b#Some are created, or others are enchanted in some terrible way. Have you seen any carry an object called a 'Strange Bun?'#$b#Beware the Strange Bun, @.#$e#Embrace the mysteries of the day, @.",
"Wizard_summer_Wed8": "There was a war, fought long ago, that almost swallowed the entire world. Unknown to humans, it was fought below the earth.#$b#In the end, neither side won, and the warriors are forgotten. Such is the price they paid for their stupidity.#$e#Have a good day, @. Learn something new.",
"Wizard_summer_Thu8": "In youth, my powers were attuned for fighting, and I could hold my own. It was a heart-pounding time.#$b#Unfortunately, it cost me some years of my life. I have little to show for it other than the scars.#$e#Seek the energies, @. Enjoy the day.",
"Wizard_summer_Fri8": "The mines go deeper than you might imagine, and there are secrets locked away that will probably never be found.#$b#It is my hope that all the horrible things that happened down there stay there, and sometimes I must interfere.#$e#Focus your mind today, @, and be at peace.",
"Wizard_summer_Sat8": "Anger and hatred, they are false energies. They hide the real sources of power, which is understanding and sadness.#$b#It has become cliche, but it's true. I have learned so much, and it still holds true. Find peace before you rip yourself to pieces.#$e#Seek knowledge, seek answers. Have a good one.",
"Wizard_summer_Sun8": "Someday things will be at peace with the beings in the mines, but anytime soon. Probably not until the world is but a husk, and humans are long gone.#$b#That is how deep their hatred burns. It is a tragedy of the ages.#$e#Be enchanted, @. Be at peace.",
"Wizard_summer_Mon10": "Sometimes I wonder if I'm missing out on life. I have access to secrets that would astounding your average person, and yet, I am lonely.#$b#Would it have been better to just have a normal job, and have a family? Would I have been happier?#$e#It is not mine to know. Be well, @.",
"Wizard_summer_Tue10": "Ignorance is bliss. You've heard that saying before, I'm sure, but it's true. To know too much, it can turn one bitter.#$b#I still find hope in my studies, but some days, I just sit. Thank you for coming out to see me, @.#$e#You are what holds me to this reality.",
"Wizard_summer_Wed10": "The focus on my life has always been on my studies now. Everything else fell away.#$b#Becoming friends with you, though, has made me realize that maybe I should not be so obsessed.#$b#There's more to life than reading the books about the lives of the dead.#$b#Maybe I'll find a girlfriend!$1#$e#I hope.",
"Wizard_summer_Thu10": "Using the energies comes at a cost. It's not free. To discuss all the different aspects would take ages.#$b#I'll tell you this though, @. My hair was not originally purple.#$e#That was a long time ago...",
"Wizard_summer_Fri10": "Thank you for spending time with me, @. I was hoping you would come by today.#$b#It's nice to take a break from my experiments and talk with you. How is your farm?#$e#It is my hope you are successful in all your doings.",
"Wizard_summer_Sat10": "One can get so caught up in work that life just falls away. Others retreat to their work because they cannot handle their life.#$b#I'm realizing lately that I've done a lot of things that I wasn't happy with. Forced myself to do what was wrong for what I thought was right.#$b#I hope to someday get forgiveness, @.#$e#Someday.",
"Wizard_summer_Sun10": "There is a special energy in the air today. I can feel it, can you?#$b#It is the energy of our friendship! It is energizing. It makes me feel young again.$1#$e#Is that weird? I don't get out much, @.",
"Wizard_fall_1": "Can you feel the changes in the air? I don't just mean in the temperature. The trees, they are giving off a unique energy.#$e#May this fall be an enchanted one.",
"Wizard_fall_Mon": "They who live in the shadows are lost, for their world has moved beyond them. Pity those who have consumed the dark pastry.#$e#Have a day to remember, @.",
"Wizard_fall_Tue": "The creatures who slide on the earth, what is their purpose? Where do they come from?#$b#They are known across the ages and cultures but a source for their being has never been found.#$e#Embrace the mysteries of the day, @.",
"Wizard_fall_Wed": "Have you seen them? The golems that search for their long-dead creators.#$b#They will wander the mines forever, alone, until they run out of energy.#$e#Have a good day, @. Learn something new.",
"Wizard_fall_Thu": "Normal creature or monster? It's hard to tell of the bats that fly in the caves.#$b#Their energy fluctuates with the moon, and they crave the lifeblood of any they can. Beware their haunting gaze.#$e#Seek the energies, @. Enjoy the day.",
"Wizard_fall_Fri": "There are creatures who have adapted to look like stone itself in the mines. It it is not through magical means that they did so, rather through sheer will-power.#$b#Sometimes the only energy you need comes from within.#$e#Focus your mind today, @, and be at peace.",
"Wizard_fall_Sat": "There are spirits, deep in the mines, who have wandered for eternity. Some of the first souls are still trapped in there.#$b#They don't even resemble humans anymore, so twisted has their ethereal image become. Such a tragedy.#$e#Seek knowledge, seek answers. Have a good one.",
"Wizard_fall_Sun": "The mines were once a vast world that was compacted as a result of an ancient war.#$b#Going through the layers is to pass through time itself. Be wary, for it is an unforgiving place.#$b#Those creatures have lost more than their minds.#$e#Be enchanted, @. Be at peace.",
"Wizard_fall_Mon2": "This season is special, for the power to be able to change is heightened. Be it your life, your thinking, or your surroundings, the powers of fall make it possible.#$b#Choose wisely, however, for not all change is positive.#$e#Have a day to remember, @.",
"Wizard_fall_Tue2": "Focus on what matters, and all should work out, unless it doesn't. There are no guarantees in life.#$b#In my studies, I have found this to be true, and it is unfortunate. Nothing is guaranteed to always work.#$e#Embrace the mysteries of the day, @.",
"Wizard_fall_Wed2": "As the trees enter their slumber, they let loose their leaves and their energy. It is this energy that is useful to me.#$b#Once winter comes, all the energies wane. Fall is the finale.#$e#Have a good day, @. Learn something new.",
"Wizard_fall_Thu2": "When all seems lost, it is important to remember that things can still change. For better, or for worse.#$b#It is important not to give up, and to see it through to the end. Easier said than done, sometimes, but I've found it to be true.#$e#Seek the energies, @. Enjoy the day.",
"Wizard_fall_Fri2": "I once saw a person try to keep a tree alive all year long, using powerful energies to do so.#$b#It was horrible: the tree itself wept, and begged to be freed. I had to step in and save the tree.#$b#I still have some of its leaves it gave to me as a gift. They are special to me.#$e#Focus your mind today, @, and be at peace.",
"Wizard_fall_Sat2": "My powers have begun to lose their potency, as it always is in fall. I would take from the trees, but I refuse to do so.#$b#I plan on reading a lot this season. Who knows what I'll find?#$e#Seek knowledge, seek answers. Have a good one.",
"Wizard_fall_Sun2": "You must be having some success on your farm to make it this far, @. How fairs your crops?#$b#It is refreshing to see someone push through the difficulty and keep going. Your rewards are ahead of you.#$e#Be enchanted, @. Be at peace.",
"Wizard_fall_Mon4": "Long ago, the Shrine of Illusion was in the hands of a group of assassins. They used its powers to change their appearance and make hits.#$b#A very long time ago, indeed.#$e#Have a day to remember, @.",
"Wizard_fall_Tue4": "The assassins who used the Shrine of Illusion were almost unstoppable in their time. It took a group of people like myself to stop them.#$b#It was a troubling time. An artifact like that should never be used for such gains.#$e#Embrace the mysteries of the day, @.",
"Wizard_fall_Wed4": "With the Shrine of Illusion gone from the ranks of the assassins, their order crumbled. Many searched for it, to reclaim their honor, but alas.#$b#Such is the way of those who used it for evil. It never worked out for them.#$e#Have a good day, @. Learn something new.",
"Wizard_fall_Thu4": "The Shrine of Illusion was lost for a time, and there is no known record for where it went.#$b#Some like to believe it changed its own shape, and hid in the world somewhere, finding peace.#$e#Seek the energies, @. Enjoy the day.",
"Wizard_fall_Fri4": "I feel bad for the assassins who were stuck in the form they chose after losing access to the Shrine of Illusion.#$b#Their burden to bear, wearing a mask stitched onto their face forever. Chilling. Such is its power.#$e#Focus your mind today, @, and be at peace.",
"Wizard_fall_Sat4": "It is impossible to converse with the Shrine of Illusion, yet I feel a living presence within it. I know it can hear me, but yet it remains silent.#$b#It makes a poor companion. It really just wants gold, and to be left alone, so I do the best I can.#$e#Seek knowledge, seek answers. Have a good one.",
"Wizard_fall_Sun4": "The Shrine of Illusion has amazing powers, and I am honored to have it here in my tower.#$b#I think it feels safe, but it's hard to know with such artifacts.#$b#I would like to see someone try and break in here for it, though.$1#$e#Be enchanted, @. Be at peace.",
"Wizard_fall_Mon6": "Here is a warning, @. Be careful during fall, for it is a time of enchantment.#$b#The trees, as they go dormant, let loose their energies and their wishes. It can have some strange effects on people.#$e#Have a day to remember, @.",
"Wizard_fall_Tue6": "If you find yourself obsessed with something you've never been interested before, it can mean you have been enchanted.#$b#Not all enchantments are bad, of course. Some can be quite positive. It is very mysterious.#$e#Embrace the mysteries of the day, @.",
"Wizard_fall_Wed6": "My ex-wife was very strong during fall. Her energies were off the chart.#$b#I will admit, it made me jealous, and that didn't help things.#$b#Sometimes I wonder if it's her enchanting people during fall...#$e#Have a good day, @. Learn something new.",
"Wizard_fall_Thu6": "I need to focus on my experiments before the energies of fall are gone. Winter is a rough time.#$b#If I can make a breakthrough, I'll ride the excitement till spring.#$e#Seek the energies, @. Enjoy the day.",
"Wizard_fall_Fri6": "Many cultures around the world must be aware of the odd energies of fall. So many festivals about monsters are scattered throughout.#$b#It was my favorite time of year as a kid. Now, I must be on my guard.#$e#Focus your mind today, @, and be at peace.",
"Wizard_fall_Sat6": "This is the time of harvest, so how has your farm been? Have you been able to get any special crops?#$b#It is my hope that you do. Only through the hands of hard work can the true energy be found.#$e#Seek knowledge, seek answers. Have a good one.",
"Wizard_fall_Sun6": "The shadow brutes, have you seen them? Though many are monsters, there is one out there who isn't. Have you met him?#$b#I have known of it for a long time. I hope it remains friendly.#$e#Be enchanted, @. Be at peace.",
"Wizard_fall_Mon8": "Enchantments, energies, and experiments. Though their powers are great and can do many things, they can't solve all of life's problems.#$b#They cannot, for example, make someone fall in love with another and have it be an honest relationship. It never ends well.#$e#Have a day to remember, @.",
"Wizard_fall_Tue8": "When I was young, I found myself in a haunted house during a rainstorm and had to stay the night.#$b#I saw many things that night, but the one that sticks with me is the spirit of a child, wandering the halls all night long.#$b#It did not cry, it only looked for its parents. What's worse is, I thought I saw her parents fly around nearby her, but they couldn't see each other.#$e#Embrace the mysteries of the day, @.",
"Wizard_fall_Wed8": "I do not want to become a ghost. It is my hope that when my time comes, I will be able to transcend to some higher plane.#$b#I would be a terrible ghost, as well. I do not enjoy scaring people.#$e#Have a good day, @. Learn something new.",
"Wizard_fall_Thu8": "One of the oddities about my studies are the rules of certain things. For example, I can conjure familiars, obelisks, and more.#$b#Yet, there are no powers at my disposal that can open a sealed jar of pickles or peanut butter. I have searched long and far, yet the rule remains.#$e#Seek the energies, @. Enjoy the day.",
"Wizard_fall_Fri8": "I will be honest with you, @, I did not expect to last this long, and sometimes I wonder what I've done right.#$b#Many people who lead this life give in to temptation, or go too far. It amazes me that I have not.#$e#Focus your mind today, @, and be at peace.",
"Wizard_fall_Sat8": "There is an odd feeling during this time of year for me. Things are at peace, and yet, I am worried.#$b#Maybe I'm just getting paranoid. I need to get out more.#$e#Seek knowledge, seek answers. Have a good one.",
"Wizard_fall_Sun8": "There is a part of me that wishes I could become enchanted, to live life free from knowing the secrets and be at peace. Yet, that would be impossible.#$b#I've studied too much, and learned things I cannot unlearn. It is a benefit, and yet also, a burden.#$e#Be enchanted, @. Be at peace.",
"Wizard_fall_Mon10": "Studying and using the energies can make one very tired, @. All these years of it has brought me to the brink.#$b#Yet it is my curiosity that drives me. I don't have all the answers, and there are still questions I have.#$b#Despite that, my body yearns for eternal sleep.#$e#Many mysteries to be answered. Someday soon, @.",
"Wizard_fall_Tue10": "There have been times when I have had the chance to wield unlimited energy. Many would be tempted by such power.#$b#I am only human. I was lucky to reject them, for it would have destroyed me.#$b#All that glimmers is not always good, @.#$e#Who knows what I would have become? A scary thought.",
"Wizard_fall_Wed10": "Am I a better person than I was before all this? In all my searching, have I been able to find a way to become stronger?#$b#I have answers to many mysteries, but they haven't changed me. They are only answers. Have I done all I can?#$e#I have thought about these things for a long time. My own mystery.",
"Wizard_fall_Thu10": "It's been good to have you around, @. It is nice to be able to talk with someone about all the aspects of my work.#$b#Maybe you would want to be an apprentice? That is for another time and place, unfortunately.#$e#Maybe someday.",
"Wizard_fall_Fri10": "I have been focusing my energies lately to find the answer to this question: how come when I'm out and about I'm tired, but when I try to sleep, I cannot?#$b#It is a grand mystery, @. Someday I will solve it. First with sheep-counting.#$e#So many sheep...",
"Wizard_fall_Sat10": "Your crops, how have they fair? It is my hope that they are doing well.#$b#You deserve greatness, @. It is my hope you find it, for I believe it is close at hand for you.#$e#If not, then, I have failed you.",
"Wizard_fall_Sun10": "It is difficult to remember what it is to have normal conversations. When conversing with the energies, one must speak a unique and complex language.#$b#To talk human is to ask how another is, and to do that with meaning is hard for me. Luckily, I can practice on you.#$e#What's up, dog? No? Is that not a saying?",
"Wizard_winter_1": "It is a time for peace and study. The snow fall has made me weak, and I will rest.#$e#I hope this is a special winter for you, @.",
"Wizard_winter_Mon": "The snow is beautiful, isn't it? It has special properties that give it an enchanting aura.#$b#I enjoy watching it. It is very calming.#$e#Have a day to remember, @.",
"Wizard_winter_Tue": "During winter, as my power is at its weakest, I enjoy reading books in my collection.#$b#I have so many interesting books, that I wonder if I'll ever get the chance to read them all.#$e#Embrace the mysteries of the day, @.",
"Wizard_winter_Wed": "I've just finished a book recently about the many types of monsters. I had forgotten a few from ages past.#$b#Terrible beasts that would roam the world during winter when they knew they couldn't be stopped. I'm glad they are gone.#$e#Have a good day, @. Learn something new.",
"Wizard_winter_Thu": "The ice is a friend and a foe, isn't it? Friend when you have a hot beverage, foe when you want to plant crops.#$b#Some of my friends specialize in studying ice in all forms, and their studies are double-edged indeed.#$e#Seek the energies, @. Enjoy the day.",
"Wizard_winter_Fri": "There are still some books left in this world that can impart special abilities on those who read them.#$b#Some can teach the reader entire languages if they have all four copies. Imagine that.#$e#Focus your mind today, @, and be at peace.",
"Wizard_winter_Sat": "It is now time to meditate till the spring, when the energies of the region return. To do any of my experiments now would be a mistake.#$b#Luckily, I have many things to read and think about, so not all is lost.#$e#Seek knowledge, seek answers. Have a good one.",
"Wizard_winter_Sun": "Much is still unknown amongst my colleagues about winter. As our energies are at their weakest, it makes it difficult to study.#$b#Someday we may be able to reverse the process and hold onto our energies, but until then, it's books for me.#$e#Be enchanted, @. Be at peace.",
"Wizard_winter_Mon2": "Since there's not much for me to do during this time of year, I tend to watch movies. I recently saw an interesting one...#$b#In it, a carrot fell in love with a grape, but their families were against it. They fought hard to be together, but in the end, were eaten.#$b#It was very sad, but also, quite colorful.#$e#Have a day to remember, @.",
"Wizard_winter_Tue2": "I make an effort to watch movies when I can. However, one of things I hate most are people who chew with their mouth open.#$b#I took an oath to never harm a living soul, and that oath is put to the test when someone chews aloud.#$e#Embrace the mysteries of the day, @.",
"Wizard_winter_Wed2": "What you call 'fantasy movies' I call 'comedy.' It amazes me all the things they get wrong.$1#$b#However, I'd be worried if they got things right. Our secrets aren't for the public, you know.#$e#Have a good day, @. Learn something new.",
"Wizard_winter_Thu2": "When I watch movies, I tend to like the ones that have a lot of special effects.#$b#How they pull it all off will always amaze me. If I didn't do what I do, I'd probably be a special effects artist.#$e#Seek the energies, @. Enjoy the day.",
"Wizard_winter_Fri2": "I recently found a book written in a language I had never seen before. Upon closer inspection, it's for people who code.#$b#This book claims to be from the beginning of the universe...what could it mean?#$e#Focus your mind today, @, and be at peace.",
"Wizard_winter_Sat2": "There is a new movie coming out that I am looking forward to. It is about a wizard with a scar on his arm that has a lot of adventures.#$b#It could be biographical for all I know!$1#$e#Seek knowledge, seek answers. Have a good one.",
"Wizard_winter_Sun2": "They are making a movie about 'Legend of the Prairie King.' It is one of my favorite games, but a movie?#$b#They never do game movies right. What if it turns off potential fans of the game?#$b#How do I know about that game? I have my ways.#$e#Be enchanted, @. Be at peace.",
"Wizard_winter_Mon4": "The Shrine of Illusion has a unique origin, however there are many variations.#$b#Some believe it was born from the sun itself and crashed as a meteor. Others say it has always been.#$b#The truth, once I recall it, is far more interesting.#$e#Have a day to remember, @.",
"Wizard_winter_Tue4": "The being who created the Shrine of Illusion was none-other than a young girl, who wished on a stone to change her appearance to escape her terrible life.#$b#The stone granted her this power, and she turned into a hawk and flew away. When the girl's father found out, he was mad.#$b#He then threw the rock into a lake, to be forgotten forever.#$b#Come back tomorrow, and I'll tell you the rest.#$e#Embrace the mysteries of the day, @.",
"Wizard_winter_Wed4": "The Shrine of Illusion, as a rock, needed to get out of the lake it was thrown in, so it absorbed all the gold at the bottom of the lake until it shown magnificently.#$b#It attracted the girl who had become a hawk, and told her what had happened.#$b#To get revenge, the shrine turned the girl into a bear, and she scared her father.#$b#I'll tell you more tomorrow.#$e#Have a good day, @. Learn something new.",
"Wizard_winter_Thu4": "The Father, realizing what he'd done, pulled the Shrine out of the Lake, and begged for forgiveness. The girl flew away, but the Shrine demanded it taken to the king.#$b#Once at the king, the story stops. The kingdom, the king, the girl, what happened to them is lost to history.#$b#Bit anti-climactic, but such is the way with stories of this nature. Why not ask the Shrine yourself?#$e#Seek the energies, @. Enjoy the day.",
"Wizard_winter_Fri4": "I personally believe the Shrine of Illusion has a grand purpose not yet realized. What it could be exactly I'm not sure of, yet I feel it.#$b#Will it ever return to being a humble stone? Is it waiting for the return of the girl-turned-hawk? Many secrets still remain.#$e#Focus your mind today, @, and be at peace.",
"Wizard_winter_Sat4": "The Shrine of Illusion can only change our appearance, and does not turn us into animals, yet it's recorded that it has.#$b#I wonder if I could unlock that ability again? Maybe if I ask with a sweet voice.$1#$e#Seek knowledge, seek answers. Have a good one.",
"Wizard_winter_Sun4": "I've been reading up on legends of old lately, and found a new one that Shrine of Illusion was involved in.#$b#There once was a frog who wished to be human, and it asked the Shrine for such a wish.#$b#The Shrine granted him his desire, but demanded gold. The frog had no gold, so as a human he stole some. The frog was then thrown in jail, and that's where he died.#$b#Brutal, isn't it? I feel bad for the frog.#$e#Be enchanted, @. Be at peace.",
"Wizard_winter_Mon6": "Lately, I have had troubled dreams in which I meet the children I've never had. They ask about me, where I have been, what I have done.#$b#I wake up with a hollow feeling, it's strange. I've always wanted to have children, and yet...#$b#So it goes. I wonder what it all means?#$e#Have a day to remember, @.",
"Wizard_winter_Tue6": "I believe I do have a child, someone in this town, but it's hard to know for sure. Sometimes it just happens.#$b#I'd love to meet them someday, and talk with them. Until then...I wait.#$e#Embrace the mysteries of the day, @.",
"Wizard_winter_Wed6": "In my dreams I've been fighting a version of myself that has only existed in theory.#$b#It is an evil version, where all my desires were realized and driven him mad. He tries to get out, and each night, I stop him.#$b#How much longer will it go on for? It is uncertain.#$e#Have a good day, @. Learn something new.",
"Wizard_winter_Thu6": "My dreams are haunting me into the day. Children that don't exist, my evil side...#$b#Only during Winter are such assaults possible. I'm too weak, @! Seeing you inspires me to keep fighting.#$e#Seek the energies, @. Enjoy the day.",
"Wizard_winter_Fri6": "I have not slept. I refuse to confront my dreams again.#$b#Instead, I've been...trying to...read...books...#$b#...#$e#...",
"Wizard_winter_Sat6": "I am refreshed today, and I've come to terms with my feelings. I may not be a father, but I can still be a good person.#$b#I hope you forgive my oddness of late, @. You have seen me in a moment of weakness.#$e#Seek knowledge, seek answers. Have a good one.",
"Wizard_winter_Sun6": "Today I will focus on the positive things. I have a new friend in you, @. For that I am thankful.#$b#Here's to spring coming soon! It will be wonderful.#$e#Be enchanted, @. Be at peace.",
"Wizard_winter_Mon8": "I will now tell you why I went down the path to live this life. It is quite the story.#$b#Long ago, when I was young, my mother became very ill.#$b#At first, she was just a little sick, but it got worse. I watched her die in front of my eyes.#$b#It was so horrible. I had heard that there was a chance she could be healed if one could manipulate the energies...#$b#I'll tell you the rest tomorrow.#$e#Have a day to remember, @.",
"Wizard_winter_Tue8": "After traveling far to find a cure for my mother, I found an old woman who understood how to heal. I tried to bring her to my mother, but she, too, was sick.#$b#She didn't last the trip. Then, when I returned to my mother, she had passed.#$b#If I had been able to heal, I could have cured my mother. If I had been able to heal, I could have saved the old woman.#$b#I'll tell you even more tomorrow.#$e#Embrace the mysteries of the day, @.",
"Wizard_winter_Wed8": "After I buried my mother, a man approached me. He had heard about my story, and wanted to teach me in arts. I then began to learn under him, and when he died, I continued his work.#$b#I have sought long and read much to find an answer: how can I cure people using the energies? Someday, I hope, I will know.#$e#Have a good day, @. Learn something new.",
"Wizard_winter_Thu8": "Learning and studying has been my focus for such a long time, I've forgotten how old I actually am.#$b#I still wonder if I will ever succeed, but it's hard to know. What do you think?#$e#Seek the energies, @. Enjoy the day.",
"Wizard_winter_Fri8": "What if one could cure the dead? Or perhaps even stop people from death? Would that be a power for good, or evil?#$b#What if you charged people for immortality? What if only the rich lived forever? Such crazy futures...it's best not to think about it.#$e#Focus your mind today, @, and be at peace.",
"Wizard_winter_Sat8": "I've seen a movie in which a man gets smarter, but his body disappears until he's nothing less than a husk.#$b#The last line was, 'and to think for a moment, I could understand forever.' I know how that character feels.#$e#Seek knowledge, seek answers. Have a good one.",
"Wizard_winter_Sun8": "My mother's grave is long lost, but I still go to where I remember it to be. One of these days, I'll be there with the answer.#$b#Then I won't feel like such a failure.#$e#Be enchanted, @. Be at peace.",
"Wizard_winter_Mon10": "I wish I could reveal my true name to you, @. In truth, I just don't remember it.#$b#Was it Carl? Or Hank? Maybe John?#$b#I think it was a cool name. It's hard to know.#$e#Maybe it was @! Imagine that?",
"Wizard_winter_Tue10": "I am always happy to spend time with you, @. It's great seeing you.#$b#How is the farm? Are you happy? Tell me everything.#$e#Every day is a good day when @ shows up.",
"Wizard_winter_Wed10": "It is my hope that our conversations have inspired you in some way, as you have inspired me.#$b#Together we are stronger than being alone, and for that, thank you.#$e#Who knows? If we hadn't met, I'd just talk to myself.",
"Wizard_winter_Thu10": "There is a great feeling in friendship. I hope someday to be able to be as I am with you with the whole village.#$b#They still fear but, someday, hopefully, they'll give me a chance. You have.#$e#That's made all the difference.",
"Wizard_winter_Fri10": "My name is...I still don't remember.#$b#Maybe Bart. Or perhaps, Tracy? Robert?#$b#Maybe I was named something like Leaf, or Tree, or Apple.#$e#I just don't remember! It's driving me crazy.",
"Wizard_winter_Sat10": "What a year it has been. I'm glad we got to know each other, @. It would have been very boring without you.#$b#Just me and the Shrine of Illusion, making faces at each other.$1#$e#I still make faces at the Shrine. I'm not sure it appreciates it.",
"Wizard_winter_Sun10": "All in all, remember this, @: the only energy you truly need is your own.#$b#Use that logic, and seize the day. Let nothing stop you!#$e#Unless it's not a good idea, in which case, don't do it.",


//Krobus
"Krobus_spring_Mon": "Grhzll bit, mok rana man.",
"Krobus_spring_Tue": "Bakzll man, ralkizz.",
"Krobus_spring_Wed": "Barikant, mank, manko bilaunt.",
"Krobus_spring_Thu": "Karakl, sibopka.",
"Krobus_spring_Fri": "...............",
"Krobus_spring_Sat": "Jour gaka? Man lila.",
"Krobus_spring_Sun": "Vank mana be.",
"Krobus_spring_Mon2": "Zer batal. Mana man lila mok rana man.",
"Krobus_spring_Tue2": "Grhzll bit, barikant bal?",
"Krobus_spring_Wed2": "Fand gee bo, bral bo bo.",
"Krobus_spring_Thu2": "Zag zani bakul bot.",
"Krobus_spring_Fri2": "...............",
"Krobus_spring_Sat2": "Karr bat grhzll bit? Ralkizz fand gee bo.",
"Krobus_spring_Sun2": "Scharr grak! Bara vank! Grhzll?",
"Krobus_spring_Mon4": "Learning...language...brak'zal.",
"Krobus_spring_Tue4": "You...brazzle...bakzll?",
"Krobus_spring_Wed4": "Language...learning...sibopka bot?",
"Krobus_spring_Thu4": "Words...graka...",
"Krobus_spring_Fri4": "...............",
"Krobus_spring_Sat4": "Bakzll, barikant, bara bot...banana?",
"Krobus_spring_Sun4": "Bendle gaka, zer vank mana, the language of all human beings.",
"Krobus_spring_Mon6": "I'm beginning to understand how you humans talk. It is...complicated. Tell me more words.#$e#Shadows be with you.",
"Krobus_spring_Tue6": "Do you pray to Yoba? I am silent every Friday in Yoba's honor.#$b#Never betray Yoba.#$e#I’ll see you from the shadows.",
"Krobus_spring_Wed6": "Yoba is all knowing. If I am not silent on Friday, I would, how do you say...#$b#Be totally destroyed by a holy being.#$e#Have a day of positive thoughts.",
"Krobus_spring_Thu6": "You call us shadow brutes, is that right? We have a different name for ourselves.#$b#My name, Krobus, means 'bridge-crosser.' Your name, in our tongue, means 'the player.' Weird, graka?#$e#The shadows call. They say ‘bye.’",
"Krobus_spring_Fri6": "..............",
"Krobus_spring_Sat6": "It is stinky down here, yet here I remain. I don't go outside when the enemy of Yoba is in the sky. At night, however...#$b#The things that move in the shadows are probably me trying to hide.#$e#Have a good time out there.",
"Krobus_spring_Sun6": "I sell things my friends to not like me selling. They say it is a betrayal. I disagree.#$b#You have taught me how to speak. You deserve rare things.#$e#See you tonight, maybe.",
"Krobus_spring_Mon8": "Humans are so horrible to us. We do not understand why. I tell them we should stop attacking humans, but my friends do not listen.#$b#Maybe someday we will live in a world where we can live alongside humans. Until then.#$e#Have a nice day.",
"Krobus_spring_Tue8": "You do not want to know how I collect the void eggs. It is...how do you say...#$b#Completely messed up and disturbing. That's a good way to put it.#$e#Shadows be with you.",
"Krobus_spring_Wed8": "When we die, Yoba takes our spirit and puts it into a new body. I have been many things already.#$b#That is what we believe. Next, I want to be a bird, to fly far away.#$e#I’ll see you from the shadows.",
"Krobus_spring_Thu8": "The dwarves are a brutal bunch of beings. Recently, a war between us came to its conclusion.#$b#Many of us lost our lives for no reason. It is very sad.#$e#Have a day of positive thoughts.",
"Krobus_spring_Fri8": ".................",
"Krobus_spring_Sat8": "I find seeds and food thrown away. I sell them in my shop, to let them not be wasted.#$b#To be wasted is the greatest dishonor.#$e#The shadows call. They say ‘bye.’",
"Krobus_spring_Sun8": "There are beings in the dark that call to me. Things far scarier than any encountered in the mines.#$b#I do my best to ignore, but I worry someday I won't be able to.#$e#Have a good time out there.",
"Krobus_spring_Mon10": "You have shown true kindness to me. It is very strange. I do trust you, you know.#$b#Maybe someday more of my kind will see it my way. We'll see.#$e#See you tonight, maybe.",
"Krobus_spring_Tue10": "I sell an artifact of a long-forgotten time. The Return Scepter was once wielded by Yoba herself.#$b#To sell such a thing would require someone worthy of it. Could it be you?#$e#Have a nice day.",
"Krobus_spring_Wed10": "Some beings are afraid of the darkness, yet I am afraid of the light. A sunny room fills me with terror.#$b#It's all a matter of perspective, you know?#$e#Shadows be with you.",
"Krobus_spring_Thu10": "One of the items I have is what you call a Stardrop. I won that in a battle against the dwarves.#$b#To you, it has great value. To me, it reminds me of the friends I've lost.#$e#I’ll see you from the shadows.",
"Krobus_spring_Fri10": "............",
"Krobus_spring_Sat10": "Do you enjoy coming down here and seeing me? I enjoy talking with you.#$b#Every word we exchange is added to my vocabulary. The more words the better, I say.#$e#Have a day of positive thoughts.",
"Krobus_spring_Sun10": "Eventually the void sun will shine above again, and we shadow brutes will walk above to our pleasure.#$b#You'll be spared, human. I give you my promise.#$e#The shadows call. They say ‘bye.’",
"Krobus_summer_Mon": "Krazz. Man grak, krazz.",
"Krobus_summer_Tue": "Bazzl grak. Man grak brazzl.",
"Krobus_summer_Wed": "Barflagl. Gramma grakka?",
"Krobus_summer_Thu": "Bah 'tsway. Grazzl. Man grak.",
"Krobus_summer_Fri": "..............",
"Krobus_summer_Sat": "Kel bah 'tsway. Grazzl manak.",
"Krobus_summer_Sun": "Shenlai. Bakrell zazzle bak.",
"Krobus_summer_Mon2": "Venai grah bah. Graka bit.",
"Krobus_summer_Tue2": "Scharr tazzle bak. Gram!",
"Krobus_summer_Wed2": "For'kazzle, brakan grak. Bak grazzle.",
"Krobus_summer_Thu2": "Shal manak, bal graam?",
"Krobus_summer_Fri2": "..............",
"Krobus_summer_Sat2": "Zal manak. Venai graam grak bakan.",
"Krobus_summer_Sun2": "Flaz zal manak. Shal manak, venai.",
"Krobus_summer_Mon4": "Trying to learn...graka.",
"Krobus_summer_Tue4": "Language...bazzle...graka.",
"Krobus_summer_Wed4": "More...bazzl...words.",
"Krobus_summer_Thu4": "Bakul bot...slowly...learning...",
"Krobus_summer_Fri4": ".................",
"Krobus_summer_Sat4": "Human...words...manak.",
"Krobus_summer_Sun4": "Soon graka bazzle. Soon indeed, zazzle.",
"Krobus_summer_Mon6": "Learning your language takes a lot of practice, but I think I'm getting it graka.#$e#Shadows be with you.",
"Krobus_summer_Tue6": "This Friday will be a special one, as I give thanks to Yoba for helping me learn your language.#$e#I’ll see you from the shadows.",
"Krobus_summer_Wed6": "I enjoy the glow that iridium gives off, don't you?#$b#It's so calming and refreshing. I should collect more of it...#$e#Have a day of positive thoughts.",
"Krobus_summer_Thu6": "You call this season summer, is that right? It doesn't matter much down here.#$b#It's always cool down here in the sewers.#$e#The shadows call. They say ‘bye.’",
"Krobus_summer_Fri6": "..................",
"Krobus_summer_Sat6": "Gra- I mean, hello. Switching languages can be tough.#$b#I started talking to a friend in human instead of our language and they about killed me.#$e#Have a good time out there.",
"Krobus_summer_Sun6": "We do not know how we are born. One day, there is nothing, and then, we are.#$b#Where do we come from? Where do we go? What is our purpose?#$b#...much to think about.#$e#See you tonight, maybe.",
"Krobus_summer_Mon8": "Not all beings you call 'monsters' get along. My people and the dwarves especially.#$b#I try so hard to not be angry, but it's my very soul that burns with...#$b#...hatred.#$e#Have a nice day.",
"Krobus_summer_Tue8": "Never eat a Strange Bun. If you do, you'll lose your mind to a dark will.#$b#A lot of my people have given in to the Strange Bun...#$e#Shadows be with you.",
"Krobus_summer_Wed8": "Do you enjoy minerals and shiny rocks? I sell such things.#$b#To my people, we cannot see the colors they give off. They have no meaning to us.#$e#I’ll see you from the shadows.",
"Krobus_summer_Thu8": "Today was a very lonely day. I'm glad you came down here to talk to me.#$b#It's nice.#$e#Have a day of positive thoughts.",
"Krobus_summer_Fri8": "..............",
"Krobus_summer_Sat8": "In my free time I enjoy finding bridges in the depths below. I cross them.#$b#Nothing beats a good crossing, you know? It's why I'm called Krobus.#$e#The shadows call. They say ‘bye.’",
"Krobus_summer_Sun8": "Today's a bad day...you better go...before I lose control...#$e#Grazzl...braka...zaan....",
"Krobus_summer_Mon10": "I can only hope that the future for monsters and humans is peaceful. I don't think it will happen soon, though...#$b#It's up to beings like us to make a better world.#$e#I hope I can someday see that world...",
"Krobus_summer_Tue10": "Can you feel the year changing? Getting older? It cries out in the mines, the creaking of the stones...#$b#At night, it gets pretty loud. I wander around until it calms down.#$e#The price of quiet is a high one.",
"Krobus_summer_Wed10": "You humans can get sick. I've seen it. We shadow people do not get sick.#$b#We go on until, suddenly, we don't. When will it happen?#$b#Now? Or now? Soon? It's hard to know...#$b#I try not to think about it.#$e#I take each moment as a special gift.",
"Krobus_summer_Thu10": "I overheard some people talking about something I hadn't heard before. They said they were in 'love,' do you know what that is?#$b#It sounds...nice.#$e#Maybe I can get love someday...",
"Krobus_summer_Fri10": ".................",
"Krobus_summer_Sat10": "There is a human who has no home who sees me when I go out at night. I do not talk to him, but he looks like he knows me.#$b#It's strange. Have you met this person?#$e#Is he a monster? He sleeps on the ground...",
"Krobus_summer_Sun10": "I have many things to sell, and each one is special. Do not let them go to waste.#$b#It would hurt my feelings.#$e#Don't hurt my feelings.",
"Krobus_fall_Mon": "Gaka gran bazzle! Man gran baz!",
"Krobus_fall_Tue": "Kengrak dana graka! Pal grak dana.",
"Krobus_fall_Wed": "Mani graka zan? Pal graka dan.",
"Krobus_fall_Thu": "Man daka por joula. Dan grak. Zan grak. Zani bi.",
"Krobus_fall_Fri": "................",
"Krobus_fall_Sat": "Zal. Zal. Zal. Zal. Zal. Zal. Zal. Zal. Zal. Zal? Zal.",
"Krobus_fall_Sun": "Pordani man daka grak. Jakal grak zan.",
"Krobus_fall_Mon2": "Kal dan por graka. Zazzl bak bal.",
"Krobus_fall_Tue2": "Kel dal po graka. Dani bot? Bi grakl.",
"Krobus_fall_Wed2": "Zaliana brak bal. Doni bot kall?",
"Krobus_fall_Thu2": "Trigalor, balzaki. Zal banak.",
"Krobus_fall_Fri2": "..............",
"Krobus_fall_Sat2": "Jalugala. Jalugala. Jalugala. Jalugala. Jalugala. Jalugala. Jalugala. Jalugala. Jalugala? Jalugala.",
"Krobus_fall_Sun2": "Zalgran. Palagarag. Zaka? Zanagi.",
"Krobus_fall_Mon4": "Language...words...more...garak.",
"Krobus_Krobus_fall_Tue4": "More...more...words...zalgala.",
"Krobus_fall_Wed4": "Your mouth...I enjoy...watching it...gala.",
"Krobus_fall_Thu4": "The language...will...be learned...zal.",
"Krobus_fall_Fri4": "................",
"Krobus_fall_Sat4": "Kalagran. Language...more...",
"Krobus_fall_Sun4": "Dalgraka zan fried fish. Gral?",
"Krobus_fall_Mon6": "Now that I can speak your language, I have many questions.#$b#Such as, why do humans hate monsters so much? What have we done?#$e#Shadows be with you.",
"Krobus_fall_Tue6": "I never thought I'd finally absorb all the words I'd need, but you've helped out greatly.#$b#Without your help, who knows what I'd be saying.#$e#I’ll see you from the shadows.",
"Krobus_fall_Wed6": "This Friday I will give thanks to Yoba, in silence, for as long as I can. I can now talk to humans.#$b#Such a great honor.#$e#Have a day of positive thoughts.",
"Krobus_fall_Thu6": "When I give thanks to Yoba, I enter a trance. I enter the void itself and become one with the darkness.#$b#Just kidding. I just think about happy things all day.#$e#The shadows call. They say ‘bye.’",
"Krobus_fall_Fri6": "..................",
"Krobus_fall_Sat6": "Pffft. Pfffft. Pffffffft. Pfffft. Pffffffffffft.#$b#I can't whistle.#$e#Have a good time out there.",
"Krobus_fall_Sun6": "I once found an egg that was on fire. I didn't know what to do.#$b#I took care of it, and then eventually, a bird came out of it.#$b#I wonder where it is now...#$e#See you tonight, maybe.",
"Krobus_fall_Mon8": "I got together with my friends last night. We all sat around, staring at each other.#$b#It was nice.#$e#Have a nice day.",
"Krobus_fall_Tue8": "When I go out at night, I see the trees are dying. Be glad you cannot hear them.#$b#The song of the trees as they enter their slumber is haunting.#$e#Shadows be with you.",
"Krobus_fall_Wed8": "What does it feel like? The cold? I cannot feel that sensation.#$b#I feel only the shadow around me. It embraces me. Soon, the whole world will be covered in it.#$b#That will be nice.#$e#I’ll see you from the shadows.",
"Krobus_fall_Thu8": "It's hard to explain the feeling I get when I see humans that aren't you. It's scary...#$b#Yet I know I could probably take them if they fought me.#$b#I don't want to fight anyone.#$e#Have a day of positive thoughts.",
"Krobus_fall_Fri8": "..................",
"Krobus_fall_Sat8": "Have you seen any dwarves around? They really hate us shadow people. It's too bad.#$b#I wish we could all get along.#$e#The shadows call. They say ‘bye.’",
"Krobus_fall_Sun8": "There are many artifacts of the elemental war still down in the mines. Maybe you'll find them.#$b#Watch out for cursed ones. That would be bad.#$e#Have a good time out there.",
"Krobus_fall_Mon10": "Do you really like me, or am I just interesting?#$b#I'd like to imagine we're really friends...#$e#It's hard to know sometimes.",
"Krobus_fall_Tue10": "I'm glad you come down here. I've been to your farm.#$b#It's nice.#$e#Next time I'll knock on your door. Maybe.",
"Krobus_fall_Wed10": "Sometimes we shadow people wear masks and walk among you humans. You'd never guess it's us.#$b#Just kidding. We're too afraid to do that...#$e#I'd still like to, though.",
"Krobus_fall_Thu10": "Am I beautiful, or ugly? Does it matter? I heard humans care a lot about their looks.#$b#I hope I'm ugly. That's a much better word.#$e#Don't hate me because I'm ugly...",
"Krobus_fall_Fri10": ".................",
"Krobus_fall_Sat10": "I hear the rumbling of the earth as trains go by sometimes. I find it soothing.#$b#At night, under the stars, I watch the trains go by.#$e#Such is this life...",
"Krobus_fall_Sun10": "I don't have much to say today. I'm feeling a bit lost.#$b#Maybe it's just that I need to get out more. Tonight, I will go wander.#$e#I'll see you around. Maybe tonight. Look for me in the shadows of the moon.",
"Krobus_winter_Mon": "Bakral manak gral.",
"Krobus_winter_Tue": "Zalgara. Bakra. Zalmanak.",
"Krobus_winter_Wed": "Corgraka zan. Angara.",
"Krobus_winter_Thu": "Korigar zal. Karga?",
"Krobus_winter_Fri": "...............",
"Krobus_winter_Sat": "Batal granna grak zanna.",
"Krobus_winter_Sun": "Kalgro rana mak. Zagal.",
"Krobus_winter_Mon2": "Keriga gor rana? Mak zagal karga.",
"Krobus_winter_Tue2": "Dolmgraka zal rana mak. Batal zal.",
"Krobus_winter_Wed2": "Kalgro manak. Zal daka zan.",
"Krobus_winter_Thu2": "Dagral nam Yoba zan. Grakl.",
"Krobus_winter_Fri2": ".............",
"Krobus_winter_Sat2": "Dolmgraka zal dan. Batal zal grakl.",
"Krobus_winter_Sun2": "Yan. Yan. Yan. Yan. Yan. Yan. Yan. Yan. Yan. Yan. Yan? Yan.",
"Krobus_winter_Mon4": "So close...to understanding...graka.",
"Krobus_winter_Tue4": "Amagra zal ba, how are you today?",
"Krobus_winter_Wed4": "Need...to absorb...more...words...",
"Krobus_winter_Thu4": "Your words...make the air...electric...zal daka.",
"Krobus_winter_Fri4": "..............",
"Krobus_winter_Sat4": "Absorbing...all...words...gral...need more....",
"Krobus_winter_Sun4": "Please...more words....please...",
"Krobus_winter_Mon6": "I now can speak your language. It makes me very happy.#$b#Such interesting words. I will cherish them always.#$e#Shadows be with you.",
"Krobus_winter_Tue6": "Now that I can speak your language, I wonder if I can read it. I'd like to read the books I find.#$b#At least I can enjoy the pictures.#$e#I’ll see you from the shadows.",
"Krobus_winter_Wed6": "Do you like your language? Can you speak more than one? I want to absorb as much as I can.#$b#Then I will be complete.#$e#Have a day of positive thoughts.",
"Krobus_winter_Thu6": "Tomorrow I will give all my thanks to Yoba. I remain silent for the entire day.#$b#I submerge myself in happy thoughts. It's nice.#$e#The shadows call. They say ‘bye.’",
"Krobus_winter_Fri6": "................",
"Krobus_winter_Sat6": "My friends are not happy that I learned your language. They say it creeps them out.#$b#I wish they were more open minded.#$e#Have a good time out there.",
"Krobus_winter_Sun6": "With all these new words, I can see things differently. It helps me appreciate them.#$b#Rock. Snail. Moss. It's nice.#$e#See you tonight, maybe.",
"Krobus_winter_Mon8": "I crossed a really good bridge the other day. It was all natural, made from the earth.#$b#I crossed it, and said to myself, I will tell @ about this.#$b#So, there you have it.#$e#Have a nice day.",
"Krobus_winter_Tue8": "I like Void Eggs. I sell them, but I collect them, too.#$b#It's hard to get them sometimes. It can be dangerous.#$b#It's a lot of fun.#$e#Shadows be with you.",
"Krobus_winter_Wed8": "I have lived a long time. I do not actually remember when I came to be.#$b#I bet it was a nice day, though. That's what I like to think.#$e#I’ll see you from the shadows.",
"Krobus_winter_Thu8": "It's best not to talk to dwarves if you can. They put you through this very strange trial, called the trial of rejection, where they are just mean.#$b#That definitely didn't help during the war...#$e#Have a day of positive thoughts.",
"Krobus_winter_Fri8": "..................",
"Krobus_winter_Sat8": "A lot of the shadow people are still angry. Be it from the war, or from humans...#$b#Many have taken the power of the Strange Bun and lost their minds.#$b#It makes me so sad.#$e#The shadows call. They say ‘bye.’",
"Krobus_winter_Sun8": "I hate mushrooms. They are so creepy. They know too much.#$b#I try to avoid them when I can.#$e#Have a good time out there.",
"Krobus_winter_Mon10": "There are still secrets to be found. Things that I shouldn't talk about.#$b#A dark talisman. The place where mutants dwell. Scary.#$e#I shouldn't have brought it up.",
"Krobus_winter_Tue10": "I'm glad I've gotten to know you, @. You're nice.#$b#Maybe someday others like me will see you as I do.#$b#Until then, it's just us friends.#$e#I'll see you in the shadows.",
"Krobus_winter_Wed10": "This week I will thank Yoba for our friendship, and the fact I have been able to live long enough to meet you.#$b#Who knows when I'll be gone. It might happen tomorrow. But today, I am happy.#$e#It's nice.",
"Krobus_winter_Thu10": "I've been so focused on my void egg collection I didn't realize winter has come.#$b#Winter has no meaning for people like me.#$e#I wonder what snow tastes like.",
"Krobus_winter_Fri10": ".................",
"Krobus_winter_Sat10": "I want to pet a chicken. That would be nice. I shouldn't, though.#$b#If I touch something, it has a tendency to...#$b#...have its life essence forced out through its soul.#$e#Or so they say.",
"Krobus_winter_Sun10": "Here's hoping for many more years of friendship. May we live forever.#$e#In our own special way.",


//Dwarf
"Dwarf_Introduction": "A human! Prepare to face the trial of rejection! May you find yourself worthy.",
"Dwarf_spring_Mon": "You may know the language now, but I still don't trust you.",
"Dwarf_spring_Tue": "Do you know our language, or can you just understand it? Get lost.",
"Dwarf_spring_Wed": "Who do you think you are, coming up and talking with me, human? Go away.",
"Dwarf_spring_Thu": "I don't trust you one bit. Get lost.",
"Dwarf_spring_Fri": "You think you can come in here and get to talk to me? Wouldn't that be easy? Go away.",
"Dwarf_spring_Sat": "Go. Away. Human.",
"Dwarf_spring_Sun": "Sure, I have stuff. Never turn away from a sale, right? Now go away.",
"Dwarf_spring_Mon2": "I've seen you a lot lately, and I've got to say, I'd like to forget it.",
"Dwarf_spring_Tue2": "I'm sick of you. You keep coming in here. Why? What do you hope to gain?",
"Dwarf_spring_Wed2": "Get lost. I have my shop, I'm enjoying my day, and you show up again. Go away.",
"Dwarf_spring_Thu2": "It's you again. What do you want of me? I'm just a dwarf.",
"Dwarf_spring_Fri2": "You would be blown away if you knew what I was saying before you learned the language. Bye-bye.",
"Dwarf_spring_Sat2": "You really want to piss me off? I sell things that go boom. That's gotta be scary, right?",
"Dwarf_spring_Sun2": "How many times are you going to come in here? Go away.",
"Dwarf_spring_Mon4": "Oh look, it's you. Again. I'll just ignore you now.",
"Dwarf_spring_Tue4": "Buy something, then leave. Easy as that.",
"Dwarf_spring_Wed4": "Annoying. I said that in your language, because I wanted to know exactly what you do to me.",
"Dwarf_spring_Thu4": "If only I had some wild elephants in here right now...",
"Dwarf_spring_Fri4": "Go! Away! When will you learn?",
"Dwarf_spring_Sat4": "Another day, another appearance. What do you want now? Go away.",
"Dwarf_spring_Sun4": "Buy the thing you want, then go. Simple. Do it.",
"Dwarf_spring_Mon6": "You have passed the trials of rejection. You are now a friend, human. Welcome.#$b#Sorry I had to put you through that. It's a rite of passage.#$e#Stones be with you, human.",
"Dwarf_spring_Tue6": "I'm glad you toughed it out through the trial of rejection, human. A lot of people give up.#$b#I don't blame them, it's tough to take all that rudeness.#$e#Don’t let anything ruin your day. Bye.",
"Dwarf_spring_Wed6": "You have been in the mines long enough to see all sorts of creatures. Have you ever seen a dwarf like me before?#$b#Probably not. I'm the worst at hiding.#$e#Have a great one, okay, human?",
"Dwarf_spring_Thu6": "We dwarves used to be a mighty group of beings, with wonderful cities and magical artifacts.#$b#Sometimes, I like to pretend that's still the case...#$b#...not anymore, though.#$e#Enjoy the sky above, human.",
"Dwarf_spring_Fri6": "Do you like understanding dwarvish? Some have called it the language of rocks. We find that offensive.#$b#The rocks are really mean and foul-mouthed. No one should talk to rocks.#$e#Rock and roll, human. Rock and roll.",
"Dwarf_spring_Sat6": "The world above is toxic to use dwarves. It's why we live below. However, I sometimes venture up to find items for my shop.#$b#It about kills me, but what's life without near death experiences?#$e#Embrace the good feelings. Bye.",
"Dwarf_spring_Sun6": "I found an emerald today. You can't have it. It's mine. I love it so. Do you want to see it? Do you want to?#$b#Well, you can't. I actually don't have an emerald.#$b#...I lied.#$e#Be smart, be strong, be free. See you.",
"Dwarf_spring_Mon8": "Be glad you only had to go through the trial of rejection, human. We dwarves have many possible trials, including the trial of name calling.#$b#I made a name for you just in case, though. Want to hear it?#$b#...friend.#$e#Stones be with you, human.",
"Dwarf_spring_Tue8": "Shadow people...so many of them still lurk below. It scares me.#$b#I thought for a time you were an assassin sent by them to kill me. I now know that's not true.#$b#You'd be a terrible assassin to let me live this long.#$e#Don’t let anything ruin your day. Bye.",
"Dwarf_spring_Wed8": "Here is a dwarven joke. Two rocks roll into a lake. One of the rocks say to the other rock, 'this was a bad idea.'#$b#Get it? Rocks can't swim. They just sit.#$b#I see dwarven humor is lost on you, human.#$e#Have a great one, okay, human?",
"Dwarf_spring_Thu8": "We dwarves used to have the answers to many of the secrets of life. Yet, most are lost.#$b#In the mines, I've found a few. Why is green the color of green?#$b#Because green. Such vast knowledge, a shame it's lost.#$e#Enjoy the sky above, human.",
"Dwarf_spring_Fri8": "Only those who eat of the Strange Bun lose their mind and free will. Never eat the Strange Bun, human.#$b#If you ever see one, beware of its power.#$e#Rock and roll, human. Rock and roll.",
"Dwarf_spring_Sat8": "I can still hear the explosions from the war. I lose sleep at night over it.#$b#If only things could have ended differently. Then I wouldn't have to sell junk.#$e#Embrace the good feelings. Bye.",
"Dwarf_spring_Sun8": "We don't eat rocks. That's not only disgusting, but harmful. Us dwarves sustain ourselves on other things.#$b#It's a bit embarrassing to say. But jewels and gems are delicious indeed.#$e#Be smart, be strong, be free. See you.",
"Dwarf_spring_Mon10": "I've never met a human as persistent as you. You just know what you want and go for it, don't you?#$b#If only the dwarves had kept that attitude. Things may have been different.#$e#If only...",
"Dwarf_spring_Tue10": "War is a terrible thing, but you must be able to fight for what you believe in.#$b#I wish there were a lot more dwarves still alive, but to say they died for nothing taints their memory...#$e#Many rocks and stones in your favor, human.",
"Dwarf_spring_Wed10": "If you ever see a dwarf with eyes of blue, let me know, would you?#$b#To see those eyes again...my heart would soar.#$b#Life isn't fair, human.#$e#Life isn't fair at all.",
"Dwarf_spring_Thu10": "Slimes make bad conversationalists. You ever get stuck in a cave in with a slime before?#$b#They always start really weird discussions and can't read if it makes you uncomfortable.#$b#It's why my shop is here, and not deeper.#$e#Beware the slimes, human.",
"Dwarf_spring_Fri10": "The underground goes on for a very long while. It would be impossible to truly map it.#$b#There is a purpose to it, though. A design. It only reveals itself to those who see all of it.#$b#And it is beautiful.#$e#Don't let the rocks tell you how to live, human.",
"Dwarf_spring_Sat10": "Sometimes I find a flower down here. I love finding them.#$b#To choose below instead of above, it is rare to see true strength from a plant.#$e#Grasp the stones of tomorrow with both hands, human.",
"Dwarf_spring_Sun10": "I'm just...remembering...the war....#$b#It was...not...good.#$b#Maybe...I'll...sleep...#$e#............",
"Dwarf_summer_Mon": "You think I'm going to talk to you? You're wrong. So wrong. Go away!",
"Dwarf_summer_Tue": "I'm tired of humans, especially you. Get lost.",
"Dwarf_summer_Wed": "Beat it! Go away, human! You disgust me.",
"Dwarf_summer_Thu": "Who are you? Seriously, who are you? Go away.",
"Dwarf_summer_Fri": "Don't get me mad. You don't know what I'm capable of. Go away!",
"Dwarf_summer_Sat": "Get lost, and never return, human!",
"Dwarf_summer_Sun": "You think you're so cool? You're wrong. I'm way cooler, so go away!",
"Dwarf_summer_Mon2": "You're so nasty. Go away, and stop talking to me.",
"Dwarf_summer_Tue2": "I'll fight you! With words. Not with violence. Go away!",
"Dwarf_summer_Wed2": "I bet you think I'm small and dumb, don't you? Go away!",
"Dwarf_summer_Thu2": "It's you. Go away, please. Thanks.",
"Dwarf_summer_Fri2": "When will you realize you just need to go? Don't come back, okay?",
"Dwarf_summer_Sat2": "Am I going mad? I thought I told you to go away? Maybe I wasn't clear.",
"Dwarf_summer_Sun2": "Please go. Never return.",
"Dwarf_summer_Mon4": "This is your last shot to go away, and not return, ever again. Go!",
"Dwarf_summer_Tue4": "Enough of you! Take what you need, and never return. Ever.",
"Dwarf_summer_Wed4": "I'm so sick of you and your face. Get out of here!",
"Dwarf_summer_Thu4": "You make me so mad. I'm so tired of you!",
"Dwarf_summer_Fri4": "I'm so done with seeing you. I look forward to not seeing you again.",
"Dwarf_summer_Sat4": "You probably think I'm a monster, don't you? That's where you're wrong. Go away!",
"Dwarf_summer_Sun4": "I'm not going to acknowledge you. Just get what you need, and go.",
"Dwarf_summer_Mon6": "You're one of the few humans to face the trial of rejection and not give up.#$b#In my eyes, you're amazing.#$e#Stones be with you, human.",
"Dwarf_summer_Tue6": "To think, if you'd given up during the trial of rejection, I couldn't tell you how much I admire you.#$b#You're a great human. I'm sorry I said those things.#$e#Don’t let anything ruin your day. Bye.",
"Dwarf_summer_Wed6": "Many creatures don't understand why we dwarves do the trials. It's simple: real friends can see through the lies.#$b#You're a real friend now, human.#$e#Have a great one, okay, human?",
"Dwarf_summer_Thu6": "I have an idea for a new trial, called the trial of the tickle. I ran it by some monster friends.#$b#They said something about violating personal space, so I guess that plan is out.#$e#Enjoy the sky above, human.",
"Dwarf_summer_Fri6": "What's under my hood? What hood? This is what I am.#$b#In fact, you might even say I'm naked...#$b#Just kidding!#$b#Or am I?#$e#Rock and roll, human. Rock and roll.",
"Dwarf_summer_Sat6": "I was eating a tasty ruby earlier. I thought about saving some for you, human.#$b#I didn't. I don't regret it.#$e#Embrace the good feelings. Bye.",
"Dwarf_summer_Sun6": "Have you met any shadow people before? Vile creatures. I hate them.#$b#Now that the war is over, there will never be redemption for my family.#$e#Be smart, be strong, be free. See you.",
"Dwarf_summer_Mon8": "I'd like to say that I was a hero of the elemental wars, that I was the one everyone looked up to. I'm not.#$b#I hid. It's because of that, I lived.#$b#At what cost?#$e#Stones be with you, human.",
"Dwarf_summer_Tue8": "I just got done doing some hardcore mining. Can't you tell?#$b#Can't you see the smile on my face? No? That makes me smile wider.#$e#Don’t let anything ruin your day. Bye.",
"Dwarf_summer_Wed8": "Explosives are a lot of fun in the mines. They can do a lot, especially if you know how to use them.#$b#I like putting them in a line and watching them go. It's relaxing.#$e#Have a great one, okay, human?",
"Dwarf_summer_Thu8": "I can tell it's what you humans call summer outside. The rocks are sweating. Can't you see it?#$b#A lot of people look to the caves for the cool air. It makes me nervous.#$e#Enjoy the sky above, human.",
"Dwarf_summer_Fri8": "I once tried this drink that comes in a metal can. It was horrible, and I spit it out.#$b#I now try the cans I do find and see if they are any better.#$b#They never are.#$e#Rock and roll, human. Rock and roll.",
"Dwarf_summer_Sat8": "I didn't think you'd show up today. Why do you keep coming in here? Do you like it as much as me?#$b#Maybe you can live here forever. Would you like that? I can make it happen.#$e#Embrace the good feelings. Bye.",
"Dwarf_summer_Sun8": "Carp. I despise them. They are some of the most powerful fish, and they are always out to get us dwarves.#$b#Beware of carp, human. Beware.#$e#Be smart, be strong, be free. See you.",
"Dwarf_summer_Mon10": "Do you have regrets in your life? I sure do.#$b#I regret my actions in the past. I regret not doing more for my people.#$b#Maybe the future will allow me to get over my regret, and be free.#$b#We'll have to see.#$e#One can only hope to find peace, I guess.",
"Dwarf_summer_Tue10": "You are a farmer. Do you like it? Are you living the best life you can be?#$b#Do you have any regrets that you would want to change? These are my thoughts lately.#$e#Much to regret.",
"Dwarf_summer_Wed10": "Snails are so cute that I hate them. If I see one, I get real mad.#$b#Something shouldn't be that cute. I'm mad just talking to you about it.#$b#Snails! Cute snails! Rage!#$e#This is my angry face. Fear it.",
"Dwarf_summer_Thu10": "It has been quiet today. I hope everything is going well down in the mines.#$b#I do not like the silence.#$e#Loud and merry, that's the way I like things.",
"Dwarf_summer_Fri10": "I have a real name, did you know that? I cannot tell it to you. If I did, I would explode.#$b#That's what our parents tell us. Our name is to be known by only other dwarves. To tell humans is to ignite the very air.#$e#All this to say it's not Paul.",
"Dwarf_summer_Sat10": "Do you like collecting minerals? I always try to, then I end up eating them all.#$b#I have no self control. Maybe someday I will.#$e#Probably not, though.",
"Dwarf_summer_Sun10": "Here's a dwarven rhyme for you, human. 'The rocks can't talk because they are full of chalk, to eat the stones would turn me back to bones.'#$b#'So if you can light yourself up and keep the fire down, you'll always find your way back to town.'#$e#It's my favorite rhyme ever.",
"Dwarf_fall_Mon": "You again. Great. Go away now, okay?",
"Dwarf_fall_Tue": "Get lost.",
"Dwarf_fall_Wed": "Go away.",
"Dwarf_fall_Thu": "You can speak the language of the dwarves but not the language of my heart.",
"Dwarf_fall_Fri": "Get going and don't come back.",
"Dwarf_fall_Sat": "Enough. Just enough. Go away.",
"Dwarf_fall_Sun": "Wonderful, you're here again. Now go away.",
"Dwarf_fall_Mon2": "I'm so tired of you. Go away.",
"Dwarf_fall_Tue2": "I'm amazed you showed up again today. Now get lost.",
"Dwarf_fall_Wed2": "You come in here, and now I tell you, please leave.",
"Dwarf_fall_Thu2": "You're weird. Go away.",
"Dwarf_fall_Fri2": "I know a word in your language. It's called scram, and you should do it.",
"Dwarf_fall_Sat2": "I have nothing to say to a human like you. Go away.",
"Dwarf_fall_Sun2": "No more! Go away! Now!",
"Dwarf_fall_Mon4": "You've entered the fourth stage. Can you stand the heat? Probably not.",
"Dwarf_fall_Tue4": "I'm amazed at your tenacity. Now get lost.",
"Dwarf_fall_Wed4": "Don't come back down here. You'd have to be crazy to come back down here.",
"Dwarf_fall_Thu4": "I look forward to the day I don't have to see your face anymore.",
"Dwarf_fall_Fri4": "Look, I'm telling you again, go away. Please. I said please this time.",
"Dwarf_fall_Sat4": "This time stay gone. Bye.",
"Dwarf_fall_Sun4": "Never come back here if you know what's good for you!",
"Dwarf_fall_Mon6": "Not many people can stand the heat of a dwarf. You passed the trial with great ability.#$b#You're amazing.#$e#Stones be with you, human.",
"Dwarf_fall_Tue6": "I'm amazed you stayed through the trial of rejection. Most people melt under the heat.#$b#It's very impressive.#$e#Don’t let anything ruin your day. Bye.",
"Dwarf_fall_Wed6": "The trial of rejection is awkward sometimes, but it's for us dwarves to find out who can see through it. We find friends that way.#$b#So we're friends now.#$e#Have a great one, okay, human?",
"Dwarf_fall_Thu6": "Do you know what procrastination is? It is considered a great disgrace in dwarven culture.#$b#'Why not get it done?' is the motto all dwarves carry with them and obsess about.#$e#Enjoy the sky above, human.",
"Dwarf_fall_Fri6": "Jades are tasty, and so is aquamarines. I wish I could eat them all day.#$b#You got any of them? The minerals? Give them to me.#$e#Rock and roll, human. Rock and roll.",
"Dwarf_fall_Sat6": "Dwarf babies are strong enough to crush rocks into pieces with their little fists.#$b#...I made that up. I wish that were true.#$e#Embrace the good feelings. Bye.",
"Dwarf_fall_Sun6": "It must be fall outside. The song of the trees going to sleep echoes down here.#$b#It is such a sad melody.#$e#Be smart, be strong, be free. See you.",
"Dwarf_fall_Mon8": "The items I have in my shop I found. I did not create any of these things.#$b#I yearn to be able to make something worthy of my legacy, however. Someday I will.#$e#Stones be with you, human.",
"Dwarf_fall_Tue8": "During the elemental wars, life was hard. I'm still suffering from the fighting.#$b#Maybe someday I will be able to move on and forgive.#$b#Not today. Not anytime soon.#$e#Don’t let anything ruin your day. Bye.",
"Dwarf_fall_Wed8": "This is my angry face.#$b#This is my happy face.#$b#This is my sad face.#$b#Which face do you prefer?#$e#Have a great one, okay, human?",
"Dwarf_fall_Thu8": "It's so quiet now. These mines used to be filled with the sound of dwarves working hard on their masterpieces.#$b#Now nothing but the random cry of a monster, or the crumbling of stone.#$e#Enjoy the sky above, human.",
"Dwarf_fall_Fri8": "When you first came in here, I was afraid you might hurt me. Clearly you haven't.#$b#It's hard for me to trust people, but since you succeeded in the trial of rejection, I know I can trust you.#$e#Rock and roll, human. Rock and roll.",
"Dwarf_fall_Sat8": "I don't even know who wrote the dwarven scrolls. I'd be curious to look them over.#$b#Probably full of crude jokes. That makes me happy.#$e#Embrace the good feelings. Bye.",
"Dwarf_fall_Sun8": "I've been thinking about snails lately, and it makes me so mad. They are so cute, I want to love them forever.#$b#I'm so mad! Get away from my head, snails!#$e#Be smart, be strong, be free. See you.",
"Dwarf_fall_Mon10": "If a human falls in the mines, it is up to us dwarves to save their lives. We pull them out, and take their items.#$b#A lot of the items I'm selling today are from humans who dug too deep.#$e#Be careful down there, human.",
"Dwarf_fall_Tue10": "There was once a human king who trusted the dwarves with helping build an underground copy of his castle. They worked day and night on it.#$b#When it was done, the king retired to it, and live out many joyous years.#$b#That's the version I'd like to believe.#$e#Life is sometimes far worse.",
"Dwarf_fall_Wed10": "I learned a lot about myself during the wars. Some of the things I learned do not make me happy.#$b#I wish I could forget, but they eat away at me at night sometimes.#$e#It's too bad...",
"Dwarf_fall_Thu10": "I'm amazed you talk to me as much as you do. It makes me happy.#$b#I hope we can keep being friends. I will probably out-live you, though.#$b#I'll bring flowers for you.#$e#Is that too weird?",
"Dwarf_fall_Fri10": "I found a book recently. I tried to read it, but I can't understand the words. It has pictures, though.#$b#There's a yellow bird on it. I like it.#$b#The yellow bird is my favorite.#$e#I want to eat it.",
"Dwarf_fall_Sat10": "Fall is a nice time of year because people stop coming into the caves. It's too cold for them.#$b#Then again, it means it gets really quiet in here...#$e#There's two sides to everything.",
"Dwarf_fall_Sun10": "I've prepared a statement for you today, human. It goes like this.#$b#Eat right, be right, live right. Eat rubies, eat emeralds, eat topaz.#$b#A great motto, isn't it?#$e#You should put it on a canvas",
"Dwarf_winter_Mon": "Get lost, human. This is not the place for you.",
"Dwarf_winter_Tue": "Go away, and don't give me anything! I will take it, out of spite!",
"Dwarf_winter_Wed": "So tired of you, please go away!",
"Dwarf_winter_Thu": "Annoying human, it's winter. Go have fun in the snow. Stop coming down here.",
"Dwarf_winter_Fri": "Get out of here. Isn't there something more interesting for you to do?",
"Dwarf_winter_Sat": "You disgust me. I don't want to see you. Go away.",
"Dwarf_winter_Sun": "Not you again. Do you have nothing better to do?",
"Dwarf_winter_Mon2": "I'm really mad now. Go away. Get lost. Scram.",
"Dwarf_winter_Tue2": "See this face? This is my angry face. Now go!",
"Dwarf_winter_Wed2": "I'm so tired of seeing you get close to me. Go away!",
"Dwarf_winter_Thu2": "It must be lonely being you, because you keep annoying me!",
"Dwarf_winter_Fri2": "I'm sick of you. Go away!",
"Dwarf_winter_Sat2": "I reject you. Hear that? It's me rejecting you!",
"Dwarf_winter_Sun2": "I have nothing to say to you. Go away!",
"Dwarf_winter_Mon4": "What would it take to have you go away?",
"Dwarf_winter_Tue4": "Go play in the snow, human, and stop bothering me.",
"Dwarf_winter_Wed4": "I'm so tired of you. Get lost!",
"Dwarf_winter_Thu4": "Look into my eyes. See that? That's true anger. Now go.",
"Dwarf_winter_Fri4": "You come in here and I just have to ask, why? What do you hope to gain?",
"Dwarf_winter_Sat4": "No more. Do not come back in here. You are banished.",
"Dwarf_winter_Sun4": "I heard you think I'm dumb. Is that true? Wanna fight? Go away!",
"Dwarf_winter_Mon6": "You have passed the trial of rejection. No one ever does.#$b#You're so cool.#$e#Stones be with you, human.",
"Dwarf_winter_Tue6": "I thought you'd give up, I really did, but you made it through. Amazing.#$b#I admire you.#$e#Don’t let anything ruin your day. Bye.",
"Dwarf_winter_Wed6": "I feel bad putting people through the trial of rejection sometimes, but it's only in self-defense.#$b#We dwarves don't like our feelings hurt.#$e#Have a great one, okay, human?",
"Dwarf_winter_Thu6": "We are now friends. Forever. It's the truth.#$b#By passing the trial of rejection, you are now a part of my life.#$b#Yay.#$e#Enjoy the sky above, human.",
"Dwarf_winter_Fri6": "I may be your friend now, human, but I am not the friend of any shadow person. I will always hate them.#$b#The wars have left many scars.#$e#Rock and roll, human. Rock and roll.",
"Dwarf_winter_Sat6": "I like winter, because I know that if I get near water, the carp won't attack.#$b#I hate carp. Beware the carp!#$e#Embrace the good feelings. Bye.",
"Dwarf_winter_Sun6": "No more snails this season. I miss them. I hate them so much.#$b#With their dumb little shells, and cute little faces. I hate them!#$e#Be smart, be strong, be free. See you.",
"Dwarf_winter_Mon8": "Tell me, human, have you been able to achieve your goals? Or do you struggle?#$b#I would hope you can accomplish all that you strive to do. But that is rare in this world.#$e#Stones be with you, human.",
"Dwarf_winter_Tue8": "The dwarves were once very successful, and had a thriving culture. It's all gone now.#$b#Now I just sit here and sell things that go 'boom.'#$b#It's so quiet. I miss those days so much.#$e#Don’t let anything ruin your day. Bye.",
"Dwarf_winter_Wed8": "I'm bad at finishing projects. I never completed anything special in the time before the war.#$b#Now, I never will. It's the hole in my heart I must carry forever.#$e#Have a great one, okay, human?",
"Dwarf_winter_Thu8": "When all your friends are gone, it stings. Knowing you will never be able to finish the conversations you used to have...#$b#I'm glad you're here to listen to me now, though.#$e#Enjoy the sky above, human.",
"Dwarf_winter_Fri8": "There is a lost dwarf city somewhere below, that was abandoned early in the war.#$b#Finding that would be amazing. Preserved through time.#$b#The artifacts would be there for the taking.#$e#Rock and roll, human. Rock and roll.",
"Dwarf_winter_Sat8": "Today I am feeling sad. I don't know what else to say.#$b#I'm glad you're here, human. You make me happy. Stay a little longer.#$e#Embrace the good feelings. Bye.",
"Dwarf_winter_Sun8": "I am inspired today. I've been down all week, but now, I feel the urge.#$b#I will create something special. Just you wait, human.#$e#Be smart, be strong, be free. See you.",
"Dwarf_winter_Mon10": "Maybe I judged humans too harshly. You are a good person. Are there more like you?#$b#Maybe it's time to meet some more. We'll see.#$e#More friends would be nice.",
"Dwarf_winter_Tue10": "I know what it's like when the whole world is crumbling. It's not great.#$b#You must lose your emotions in that moment, and focus on staying alive.#$b#You can be scared, sad, mad, happy, but you must stay focused.#$e#The cost of learning that was very great.",
"Dwarf_winter_Wed10": "I never thought you and I would be friends, human. Now, I value you.#$b#Let's stay friends for a very long time.#$e#I will never forget you.",
"Dwarf_winter_Thu10": "If you've ever fallen in the mines, it was I that picked you up. I never thought anything more of it, though.#$b#Just doing my job.#$e#Stay safe down there.",
"Dwarf_winter_Fri10": "Have you ever wanted to fly? Last night I had a dream that I was flying. It was amazing.#$b#What is beyond the sky? That is what I wanted to find out, but I ended up falling.#$e#Such is the way, I guess.",
"Dwarf_winter_Sat10": "Never stop fighting the monsters, human. I don't mean real monsters, though.#$b#The monsters in your mind. The monsters in your soul.#$b#See what I just did? I went deep. Get it? I'm a dwarf.#$b#This is my awkward face.#$e#...........",
"Dwarf_winter_Sun10": "The year is dying. It will fade into the rocks itself.#$b#I will remember this one, though, thanks to you, human.#$b#Thank you.#$e#You mean a lot to me.",
}
